window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1401,"title":"Chapter 1401 - Sort you out when we reach home (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1401: Sort you out when we reach home (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“You got yourself bruised and riddled with scars and still dare to ask me if I’m disappointed or not? And although I do admire the fact that you’ve lost so much blood but instead of feeling uncomfortable, you actually feel excited?”","Li Moting’s gaze harshly stared at her as he spoke madly.","Huang Yueli went blank, “Ah.... It feels..... a little uncomfortable.....”","She had immersed herself in the joy of victory and really didn’t notice the unusual condition on her body. Right after Li Moying prodded her, she suddenly sensed that her head was a little giddy and because she had lost too much blood, her hands and feet were icy cold to the point of becoming numb...","Actually the injuries that she had sustained weren’t any lighter than Fang Shaoning’s.","But she had just advanced successfully and obtained victory to the arena tournament so her body was still in a state of stimulation hence she wasn’t like Fang Shaoning who fainted on the spot.","Now, that kind of dizzy sensation was much stronger as though in an instant, her energy was zapped totally.","Huang Yueli’s feet staggered and at the next moment, she suddenly felt her body being lifted into the air. Immediately after, Li Moying’s enlarged handsome face appeared right in front of her.","Li Moying carried her horizontally and at the same time, carefully avoiding the injuries on her body as he protected her in his embrace.","Huang Yueli subconsciously stretched out her hand as she wrapped it around his neck.","“Ah.... So giddy...”","“Giddy and you still push yourself so hard! You’re not allowed to talk, follow me home to rest!” Li Moying stared at her as his tone was still rather fierce.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips in grief, “Orh.... Why must you be so fierce? I’ll listen to you.....”","Just looking at her put on this aggrieved little wife look, no one could imagine that just a quarter of an hour ago, she was the same person who put on an awe inspiring face, winning over the strong. She was a truly strong talented practitioner!","Seeing her acting so obediently, Li Moying’s tummy full of anger from seeing her being injured repeatedly instantly vanished by a major half.","“You are just lacking in lecture, see how I will go back and sort you out when we reach home!” He gave a cold humpf and although he still put on a look of disdain, but his tone had already softened by quite a large bit. When he mentioned the words “sort you out”, the deterrent force wasn’t there and it seemed rather ambiguous.","Huang Yueli looked upwards as she lifted her eyes to see his perfectly contoured lateral view. Those originally taut cold lines had already softened down by quite a bit.","She lightly curled her lips, thinking in her heart that this man was a paper tiger. She knew about this long ago in her past life that no matter how she ruffled him up, as long as she turned obedient, acted cute and coquettishly, she would be able to settle this man. Indeed, even after a lifetime, he was still the same...","She instantly felt reassured as she leaned her head against the man’s robust and strong chest, closing her eyes.","She had indeed lost too much blood and moreover it was an intense battle. Plus the fact that she had advanced at a hurried moment, her exhaustion was extreme so the minute she was in her beloved man’s embrace, she completely felt safe and ignoring the scenario, she fell asleep dizzily.","Li Moying saw her condition and his heart started to ache.","He lowered his head to kiss her face as he carried her and left.","As he walked, he didn’t forget to instruct Mo Yi, “Hurry and go invite all the best doctors in the Sect to my courtyard to do a consultation for Third Miss... wrong, get all the doctors to come over! Quick, go immediately! If you delay any time, then bring your head over to see me yourself!”"]},{"number":1402,"title":"Chapter 1402 - Sort you out when we reach home (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1402: Sort you out when we reach home (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Mo Yi heard that, he ran off hastily.","Li Moying turned his head towards Murong De’s direction as he nodded his head, carrying his young fiancée and left the arena stage with big strides.","By the time he left, the disciples below the stage all started to discuss enviously.","“Junior Sister Bai is really fortunate. Young Sect Master actually carried her.... carried her in the way grooms carry their brides! And even kissed her! If Young Sect Master treated me in that same way, I’d faint in happiness. I envy Junior Sister Bai so much!”","“Tsk, who do you think you are? Why would Young Sect Master want to carry you for? Junior Sister Bai is Young Sect Master’s fiancée! There’s nothing rare about her being hugged? Moreover both of them have such good looks, just looking at them warms the heart and delights the eye!”","“But it’s really a little unimaginable! In the past, Young Sect Master would often put on a cold face. Don’t think that Senior Sister Murong keeps following him around all day and tried ways and means but he had always remained distant without any intimate actions. That time I kept assuming that Young Sect Master was those kind of genius whose heart was totally devoted towards cultivation, totally without any interest towards ******! In the end, ever since Junior Sister Bai came to Celestial Light Sect...”","“That’s right, ever since Junior Sister Bai came, I realised that it wasn’t that Young Sect Master didn’t know how to pamper anyone, he’s practically a slave to his wife.... Indeed, no matter how cold and powerful a man is, there would be someone who can subdue him. The crucial point is it depended on who that person was!”","“That’s right, Young Sect Master knows it all too well! After comparison on Senior Sister Murong and Junior Sister Bai, the former’s ability lacks the latter by a huge notch, not to mention that Junior Sister Bai is a genius armament master who even President Hu admires and she’s so beautiful. It’s no wonder that Young Sect Master couldn’t help but be touched by her.....”","“Really envy Junior Sister Bai. She has everything, and even a man like Young Sect Master who is faithful to her...”","These discussions which were filled with envy were loud as they didn’t conceal their volumes. That was because everyone felt it right from the bottoms of their hearts that Li Moying and Huang Yueli were a match made in heaven plus the two of them had already left the public square so they didn’t need to hide what they were thinking of in their minds.","No one noticed that underneath a big tree not too far away, laid Murong Fei who had just regained consciousness!","After she was injured by Fang Shaoning earlier, as her injury was too serious, she couldn’t be moved too vigorously hence the doctors moved her carefully below the tree shade.","Whoever knew that she had just woken up to see Huang Yueli being beaten by Fang Shaoning till she was covered in blood and was escaping everywhere in a dishevelled state!","Murong Fei almost laughed out loudly, forgetting all the pain on her body as she hurriedly turned around to ask Li Lingchuan who hurried over to take care of her, “What’s going on? Bai Ruoli that little slut.... how did she run up the arena stage?”","Li Lingchuan had assumed that Huang Yueli would be defeated without any doubt as he couldn’t help but laughed, “Heaven knows, why on earth would she seek death for herself?”","He narrated the scene where Huang Yueli jumped out to challenge Fang Shaoning and the both of them exchanged glances as they burst out laughing, sitting at one corner waiting for Huang Yueli to be beaten till she was either dead or crippled!","For this Murong Fei didn’t even hate Fang Shaoning that much as she was hoping that he would injure that little slut to even more miserable state. The best would be if he could kill her directly then he would become her, Murong Fei’s benefactor!","In the end, even before she could finish laughing, she saw the clouds change and the situation on the arena underwent a reverse twist in a blink of an eye!","Huang Yueli actually advanced just before the battle on the arena state, even breaking out in an unimaginable powerful ability, causing Fang Shaoning to be sent flying down the stage!","Murong Fei’s face instantly turned green."]},{"number":1403,"title":"Chapter 1403 - Sort you out when we reach home (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1403: Sort you out when we reach home (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","She simply couldn’t understand why under the heavens would such a fascinating thing even occur!","Murong Fei thought that she was hallucinating due to her serious injury but the events after that and the crowd’s response verified that all this..... had really happened!","After she realised this, Murong Fei was entirely on the verge of breaking down!","She simply could not accept the fact that the little vixen whom she had looked down upon was not only an Armament Master with outstanding talent, moreover she had such abnormal innate talent and ability in the way of cultivation, which was even enough to match Li Moying!","How could that be possible? Why did things turn out to be like this? Obviously she was the woman who was most compatible with Eldest Senior Brother!","That little slut should be someone whom her Eldest Senior Brother was fooling around with and completely wasn’t worthy of Eldest Senior Brother. Why.... why had she turned into this kind of talent??","What made Murong Fei even unable to accept was that because of Huang Yueli’s outstanding talent, after she represented Celestial Light Sect to obtain the ultimate victory at the arena tournament, everyone treated her as the person who had rendered outstanding service to save Celestial Light Sect as everyone held her in high respect, praising her non-stop.","It was not only those ordinary young disciples, even the Sect’s various Elders and including her own father Murong De, were filled with pride as each and every one of them praised Huang Yueli to the skies!","Murong Fei was so upset as her jealous emotions was like a poisonous snake, repeatedly nibbling at her heart.","All these.... should originally have been hers!","It should have been her who was Celestial Light Sect’s saviour and she should rightfully be the arena champion, the person whom was adored and respected by all! Why had it became that little slut??","Murong Fei totally did not reflect on the fact that she herself did not have the ability but on the contrary, she felt that it was Huang Yueli who stole everything away from her!","This wasn’t the most infuriating thing!","Following this, Li Moying even went down the stage on his own accord and extremely gently carried Huang Yueli. Then he even kissed her on the spot and the both of them totally had no qualms on displaying their love publicly for a short while before they left under the crowd’s envious glances!","The crowd’s reaction was the thing which truly made Murong Fei almost fainted from anger!","Everyone actually felt that that little slut and Eldest Senior Brother were very compatible!","To the fact that some of them directly said it outright that she Murong Fei couldn’t be compared to Huang Yueli, so she couldn’t make Li Moying fall for her.","These words totally struck Murong Fei’s sore foot like a resounding slap that was viciously slapped onto her face on the spot!","Actually she had already realised this from the inner depths of her heart that Huang Yueli’s ability was extraordinary and she was indeed much more powerful than her. It was exactly because of this which made her totally unable to accept it!","She had always had a good opinion of herself, feeling that there was no young lady in South Sky Region who could match up to her. Even if Huang Yueli snatched away Li Moying, it was all because she was shameless!","How would Murong Fei ever admit that she was inferior to Huang Yueli?","The more Murong Fei thought, the more infuriated she got as she couldn’t help but turned back and stared fiercely at Li Lingchuan who was behind her, “It’s all because of you! Weren’t you saying before the match that this time round, I’d be the one who is in the limelight and can make Eldest Senior Brother regret not getting engaged with me! But now??”","Li Lingchuan’s expression wasn’t pretty as well because Murong Fei had totally vented her anger onto him!","“You have the cheek to blame me for this? What I obviously said was for you to gain victory on the arena stage, obtaining the status as arena champion to get the seventy percent quota for Celestial Light Sect! Only in this way, Eldest Senior Brother would be able to see your ability! But in the end? How would I know that you actually couldn’t win Fang Shaoning??”"]},{"number":1404,"title":"Chapter 1404 - Sort you out when we reach home (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1404: Sort you out when we reach home (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Murong Fei hadn’t expected that even Li Lingchuan would criticise her as her embarrassment instantly turned into fury.","“You.... what right do you have to say that of me? The last tournament we had with Green Cloud Sect, you also couldn’t win Leng Yi Feng and had to rely on Eldest Senior Brother to confront the enemy personally? Green Cloud Sect’s practitioners total ability originally are much higher than our Celestial Light Sect, it’s not as if you didn’t knew about this!”","Li Lingchuan was struck right on the sore point in his heart as his expression sunk gloomier.","In the last tournament, he had finally waited for Li Moying’s absence and thought that he would be able to hold his fort in the tournament, standing out in the limelight! In the end, he was defeated by Leng Yi Feng, and lost miserably! It was Li Moying who managed to rush back in time to save the losing battle.","The situation then was exactly the same as today! Only the main characters had changed into Huang Yueli and Murong Fei.","Recalling this, he forced himself to suppress his anger. He wanted to steal the position of Young Sect Master from Li Moying’s hands and because of this, Murong Fei was the best cooperating partner whom he could not afford to offend. He could not break the alliance between them just because of a moment of fury.","“Alright, it’s useless to say all these now! The fact is you didn’t win Fang Shaoning but it was Bai Ruoli who defeated him instead, becoming the ultimate arena champion! The plans we had previously were all established on the basis that you had obtained the arena champion so it’s of no use now.”","Murong Fei said hatefully, “It’s all that wretched lass’s fault! She is merely an opportunist! If I knew that Fang Shaoning’s cultivation would drop after two hours, I would have also used the delay tactic then the person who won would have been me!”","Li ingchuan couldn’t help but look askance at her.","Murong Fei made it sound so easy!","Escape? Where could she have escaped to? How could she escape?","Sixth stage realm second level versus sixth stage realm seventh level, that was a difference of five small realms. The disparity in terms of speed was already extremely too obvious.","If it wasn’t for Huang Yueli’s phantom movements and Profound Skill, she totally could not last for an entire two hours!","But he didn’t expose her as he said, “Let’s not mention the things which had already passed. Although this plan failed, we can still think of other ways which could absolutely separate the both of them!”","Murong Fei heard that and a spark of joy flashed past her eyes, “Oh? What idea do you have again?”","Li Lingchuan gave a cold laugh, “That’s right. Although our plan failed today but it’s not as though we didn’t reap any benefits. Today, I discovered that we may have a possible ally and he should be the same as us, anticipating with great hope to separate Eldest Senior Brother and Bai Ruoli!”","“Who are you talking about?” Murong Fei was totally muddled.","“Green Cloud Sect’s eldest disciple — Leng Yi Feng!”","...","Li Moying’s courtyard.","Huang Yueli was surrounded by a group of doctors as Li Moying sat by the side with a gloomy expression.","Among those doctors present, there were not only Celestial Light Sect’s doctors, there were some other doctors who were sent by President Hu and other various powerhouses and each of them were all renown Divine Doctors in South Sky Region.","Usually if any of them were to give a consultation, the patients would beg earnestly for their help and also accepted a huge consultation fee before they were willing to help. But now, all of them hurried over just to please Young Sect Master Li and his little fiancée.","But this fawning was absolutely nothing good at all.","Celestial Light Sect’s main doctor was helping Huang Yueli take her pulse while he wiped off the sweat off his forehead three times, with a trembling in fear look on his face, just short of kneeling onto the ground.","Ever since he placed his fingers on Huang Yueli’s slender wrist, he immediately sensed a huge amount of pressure."]},{"number":1405,"title":"Chapter 1405 - Sort you out when we reach home (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1405: Sort you out when we reach home (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s glare was like two sharp blades as it repeatedly and endlessly swept across his body.","Li Moying’s coercion was so powerful and doctors were the same as Armament Masters, where most of them were not skilled in cultivation. With his coercion, the doctors were all trembling from shock as all of them went into a daze and used a long time yet still unable to give a precise diagnosis.","This in Li Moying’s eyes made him extremely dissatisfied.","“Doctor Ling, how is my Li’er’s condition? After such a long time of diagnosis, there’s still no conclusion?”","Li Moying’s voice was biting cold and that gaze seemed as though he couldn’t wait to chop off Doctor Ling’s hand which had touched Huang Yueli’s wrist.","Huang Yueli thought it was very funny and was full of sympathy for Doctor Ling as she hurried butted in, “Alright, stop being overly anxious. I said earlier that there’s nothing wrong with me. I merely lost a bit too much blood and over exhausted my Profound Energy which was why I fell into a coma. So I’d probably recover after recuperating for a few days.”","Li Moying gave her a repulsive stare, “I didn’t ask you!”","He turned towards Doctor Ling, “What’s the result of the diagnosis?”","Doctor Ling immediately retracted his hand and at the same time, wiped his sweat for the fourth time as he answered in fear and trepidation, “Re... Reporting to Young Sect Master, just as what Miss Bai said, she merely over exhausted herself too much which was why she went into a coma.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she tugged Li Moying’s sleeve as she raised her little chin speaking a low voice, “I said this right, you’re making a fuss over nothing!”","Li Moying totally ignored her as he continued to look at Doctor Ling.","“Just this conclusion and you needed to diagnose for such a long time?”","Huang Yueli looked up into the sky speechlessly. From these words, he said it as though the doctor intentionally took advantage of her! But she was the demon king’s fiancée, who dared to do so?","Doctor Ling hurriedly replied, “But Miss Bai’s exhaustion isn’t quite the same. She wouldn’t be able to recover after a few days so quickly. She had suffered a huge loss in blood and Profound Energy so she must use a large quantity of rare treasures to refine into medicinal pill and take it continuously. Furthermore, it’s best that she lay down in bed for the next two months and must take note not to cross hands with anyone!”","Huang Yueli interrupted him, “It’s not that serious okay? This little injury needs two months to recover? How could that be possible? Moreover, isn’t the ancient mystic region going to be opened in slightly after a month> How can I stay in bed for two months?”","Doctor Ling hurriedly continued, “This... I also know that based on Miss Bai’s ability and innate talent, you definitely want to go to the ancient mystic region but the after-effects of Profound Energy exhaustion may be a huge matter. If you don’t recuperate properly, it may affect your meridians and dantian and will easily lead to qi deviation when you cultivate in future so please don’t think lightly of this condition!”","“But...”","Huang Yueli wanted to say something else but was stared at by Li Moying’s cold glare.","“Not allowed to speak. Today you’re so disobedient, I haven’t even sorted you out yet! You dare to not listen to the doctor’s advice?”","Huang Yueli pouted as she didn’t want to argue with Li Moying. But she turned around and used a threatening look at Doctor Ling, wanting him to change his words.","The sweat on Doctor Ling’s forehead started to drip down uncontrollably. This time he didn’t even dared to use his hand to wipe it off.","Helping Miss Bai do a consultation was really an extraordinary tough job. First of all, Young Sect Master didn’t even want to let him help her do a check-up and even just taking her pulse on her wrist rendered a death stare. Now Miss Bai even used such a vicious gaze to look at him.","He didn’t manage to please any side at all!","This young couple was simply too difficult to please?","Doctor Ling hurriedly replied, “Miss Bai is still young and her underlying condition is good so perhaps it might be possible for her to recover quickly.”"]},{"number":1406,"title":"Chapter 1406 - So shameless (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1406: So shameless (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli immediately waved the chicken feather as a token of authority as she turned back and told Li Moying, “See, Doctor Ling said that I’m still young and my condition is good so I’d definitely recover very quickly!”","Li Moying’s brows rose, “Li’er, do you feel that my age is catching up so there’s a problem with my hearing? Doctor Ling obviously said ‘maybe’ and not ‘definitely’. Don’t use your small intellect on your husband, that’s useless!”","Huang Yueli was exposed on the spot but she didn’t feel embarrassed at all as she rolled her eyes at him and mumbled softly, “What husband, we are not even married yet!”","Doctor Ling saw through that they were exchanging sweet nothings so he hurriedly added, “I will go prescribe some medicinal pills for Miss Bai and once it’s successfully refined, I’ll send it over to Miss Bai immediately. I’ll be excused!”","“Mn!” Li Moying nodded his head.","Doctor Ling slipped away immediately as though his feet were smeared with oil!","This was simply too terrifying. A man with such a cold character like Young Sect Master actually said such mushy stuff to Miss Bai which made Doctor Ling’s goose bumps all fell onto the ground! If he didn’t slip away quickly, he would probably be disgusted to death!","The minute Doctor Ling left, Li Moying immediately walked over, putting his hand on Huang Yueli’s shoulder and pushing her onto the bed.","“Alright, you’ve been tired for the entire day so it’s time to get some rest!”","“Aiya, wait a minute!” Huang Yueli nudged her shoulder as she attempted to escape from the evil force’s coercion.","But Li Moying’s strength was very powerful and with just two hands gently pushing on her shoulder without even using any strength, it rendered her totally immovable.","He frowned as he looked at his little fox wriggling like a caterpillar.","“Alright, can you stop moving? Don’t you feel pain when you move in this way and rub against your wounds?”","Earlier before Doctor Ling entered, he used up all his self-restraint to help Huang Yueli apply medicine on her wounds. That entire bloody scarred body made his heart wrenched in multiple folds of pain, wishing that he could drag Fang Shaoning out and chop him into eight pieces!","Huang Yueli said, “Since you know that I will feel pain then just stop pressing on me!”","“If you obediently sleep, then I naturally won’t press down on you. But you’re so disobedient so I have to supervise you!” Li Moying’s brow rose as he said that.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but give him a stare, “How could you be so overbearing! I ask you, surely you won’t force me to stay in bed for an entire two months right? The ancient mystic region will be opening up in slightly over a month and I’ve wasted so much effort to gain the quota so I must enter! You’re not allowed to stop me!”","When Li Moying heard that, his face sunk, “I know you want to enter but if your body condition doesn’t allow that, then I cannot possibly agree to let you take the risk! There are plenty of chances for experience training but if you really hurt your body’s fundamentals, by then no amount of rare treasures will be able to nurse your body back!”","Huang Yueli pouted, “What, you’re not allowed to leave me and go to the mystic region alone!”","Li Moying continued, “What are you thinking of? How could I possibly leave you to go on an experience training alone? If you really are not able to recuperate, then I will stay behind in Celestial Light Sect with you to recuperate. Otherwise how can I rest my heart?”","Huang Yueli went into a short blank and following that her eyes turned wide with disbelief.","She said those earlier purely because she was being arrogant and had mainly wanted to see Li Moying’s vexed look. In actual fact, she had no intention to not allow him to go to the mystic region.","In the end, she had not expected that this man actually planned in advance that if things didn’t go well, he would give up the chance to enter the ancient mystic region like her, staying behind to accompany her."]},{"number":1407,"title":"Chapter 1407 - So shameless (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1407: So shameless (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","In actual fact, in a place like South Sky Region, the amount of resources which Li Moying was able to obtain as compared to his past life, was really too little.","Moreover he needed to revert back to his past life’s cultivation quickly, or even surpassing his past life. In this way, the chance to enter the mystic region was already an extremely rare thing and it was extremely useful for him to raise his cultivation, so he really shouldn’t miss it.","But because of her, he didn’t hesitate in giving it up...","Huang Yueli bit on her lips as a sour feeling arose in her heart. This man was always like this, no matter if it was in their past lives or now, he would forever place her in first place, willing to give in to her.","But it was exactly because of this which was why she must absolutely get well soon. She absolutely cannot drag Li Moying down!","Li Moying saw her dazed look and seemingly red eyes as he anxiously questioned, “Li’er, what’s the matter? Had your wound split open again? Quick let me take a look!”","Huang Yueli saw a light in her mind and suddenly recalled something.","She stretched out her arm and grabbed Li Moying’s shirt in front of his chest as she said, “I remember now! I have a way to get well immediately. Probably don’t even need a month, just ten days and I’d be able to completely recover, ten days!”","Li Moying totally didn’t believe in her, “Alright, Li’er, I know you still want to go to the ancient mystic region and I promise that I will bring you to other places for experience training so don’t be so stubborn...”","“I’m not joking with you! Let me go first!” Huang Yueli gave him a stare.","His little fox’s glare was too vicious so Li Moying had no choice but to obediently let go of his hand to see what she was up to.","Huang Yueli’s right hand waved and right in the middle of the bedroom appeared a super large bath tub.","Li Moying was stunned as he didn’t expect to see this.","“What is this? Don’t tell me... you want to take another medicated bath?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Almost there, take a look at what’s in the bathtub?”","Li Moying heard her words and gave her an astonished look as he walked to the side of the bathtub.","The bath tub was filled with pungent red sticky liquid as an intense blood stench whiffed over!","At this moment, he was able to sense clearly that this red liquid contained an extremely powerful and dangerous energy! This kind of presence even brought along an indescribable pressure, capturing one’s soul. If it was someone with weaker determination, that person would probably not be able to stand firm by the side.","Li Moying couldn’t help but creased his forehead, “What is this?”","Huang Yueli gave a sweet smile as she showed her sharp little fangs, “Do you remember that I told you previously about the reward which I obtained in the inheritance tower, which was to soak in the Phoenix Blood Pool? Before I left, I took a little Phoenix Blood away conveniently...”","Li Moying was speechless, “This is a little?”","An ancient spiritual beast’s bloodline was long extinct in Soaring Heavens Continent.","But many of the strongest powerhouses in the Continent still reared in groups of nine grade magical beasts to collect their blood as a kind of medicinal ingredient, to aid their disciples under their wings to advance.","But even for those disciples who had contributed heavily towards the Sect, the amount of reward they could obtain each time was generally a small bottle.....","What Huang Yueli took out was the extremely powerful ancient spiritual beast’s Phoenix Blood!","She actually took out such a big tub like this??","Huang Yueli laughed dryly, “That’s right, just a little. That Phoenix Blood is very large! Although I’ve already filled all of the containers I have in my space, filling up several tubs but I’d at most taken less than ten percent...”"]},{"number":1408,"title":"Chapter 1408 - So shameless (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1408: So shameless (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The corner of Li Moying’s lips twitched, “How many pails?”","She really was his Li’er, so she had conveniently taken away not just this little bit! He really underestimated her!","Huang Yueli continued speaking, “Last time when I was in the inheritance tower, I’d suffered from quite an amount of injuries at the last stage but perhaps due to the fact that I’m a part of the Sacred Phoenix Race, after entering the Phoenix Blood Pool, the multiple injuries on my body from external to internal all speedily recovered. It didn’t even leave a little scar and further, I even advanced!”","Li Moying heard that and evidently heaved a sigh of relief.","“I’ve never expected that you have such good stuff with you! Since that’s the case, hurry up and soak in it. If it’s really effective, then I can rest my heart at ease a little.”","Huang Yueli nodded as she used her arm to prop herself against the bed, wanting to get onto the ground.","Li Moying shot up like an arrow as he carried her up from her waist, into the bathtub.","Huang Yueli used her hand to push his chest, “You... you can leave now. I can manage these few steps on my own, no problem at all.”","Li Moying’s feet didn’t even nudge as he stared at her intently, “I’m still worried. You are so weak now, what will happen if you faint in the bathtub which is very dangerous as well! Alright, stop being why, which part of you haven’t I seen before? Have you forgotten that earlier when I applied the medicine for you I’ve already seen everything!”","“... Ah??”","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in disbelief as she didn’t expect Li Moying to say such shameless words out!","However, Li Moying wasn’t just saying only, he directly took action.","His slender long fingers went round her waist as he undid her loose waist belt, attempting to take off her inner shirt directly.","Earlier for the convenience of applying medication, Huang Yueli had taken everything off including her undergarments so now she didn’t wore anything on the inside as she instantly felt the man’s scorching large hand pasted on her naked skin around her abdomen, causing her to shiver slightly as that area which he touched started to burn up!","“Hey, you can’t do this! Earlier when you were applying medication, I had already fainted otherwise I wouldn’t allow you to do as you wished! Quickly go away! ..... Where are you looking at? Not allowed to look, I won’t allow you to look!”","Huang Yueli cried out utterly discomfited. If not for the fact that her body was weak, she would probably have jumped up to hit him long ago!","Li Moying’s vision swept across her bosom area and propped up his chin while in deep thoughts, “Earlier I didn’t take a close look. From the looks of it, it seems that you’ve grown quite a bit? Looks like I’ve taken quite good care of you!” If she is a little more well fed, it’s almost time to prepare for a bite!","Huang Yueli looked at his gaze as she simply wanted to murder someone!","Li Moying then lowered his head as he laughed softly, “Such good spirits, your wounds really don’t hurt anymore? Relax, I’m not some beast so how would I bear to lay my hands on an injured woman? Obediently soak in the bath. I’m really worried about you so just let me stay here, I won’t touch you!”","Huang Yueli had already been stripped naked by him and she curled up entirely in his arms without even raising her head as she cursed him more than ten times silently.","Hearing that, she hurriedly replied, “Make sure you keep your words!”","Li Moying shook his head as he laughed, “Keep, of course I’ll keep my words! When had I ever lied to you?”","“That’s very hard to say, you’ve lied to me so many times already.....” Huang Yueli mumbled.","This man was usually very reliable but every single time he wanted to get fresh with her, the things he said were no different from a fart at all."]},{"number":1409,"title":"Chapter 1409 - So shameless (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1409: So shameless (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The current situation really made her unable to rest her heart at all.....","Although she thought in that way, she still obediently hugged Li Moying’s neck, allowing him to place her inside the bathtub.","Huang Yueli just sat inside when she immediately moaned.","“Ughh.....”","The wounds on her body haven’t healed yet and the energy contained in Phoenix Blood was too strong hence it stung her wounds making her feel a sharp pain, crying out unbearably.","Li Moying immediately rushed over nervously, “Li’er, you.... are you alright?”","Huang Yueli clenched her teeth hard as she tried her best to turn over to give him a glance, “I.... I’m alright. It’d be better after a little while, don’t... don’t be too worried.....”","Li Moying looked at her tightly creased brows as he felt an instant heart ache but he also knew that this was unavoidable, so he could only try his best to control himself.","Luckily this torturous stage which tormented the duo didn’t last for too long and after a while, Huang Yueli’s wounds started to heal at a speed which was visible to the naked eye.","After two hours later, those bloody wounds had all closed up and although it wasn’t able to completely seal up but they could tell that it wouldn’t take much longer for her to be healed completely.","This made Li Moying finally rest his heart down. It really was an ancient spiritual beast’s blood, using it luxuriously for a bath soak and its effect was indeed extraordinary!","Huang Yueli was soaked in the bathtub and initially she was mostly in a daze as all her determination had been used to resist against the pain from her body. But as the wounds started to get better, she didn’t feel that unbearable slowly and gradually opened her eyes.","The minute she opened her eyes, she was so shocked that she jumped up. Because Li Moying was actually sitting by the bathtub with his eyes staring at her fixatedly!","Although she knew that the lustre of the Phoenix Blood was dark red and Li Moying actually couldn’t see her body while she was soaked in it, hence he could only instinctively see something. But being stared at by her own fiancée still made her cheeks blush a shade of red.","“Mn, that... Moying....” she opened her mouth as she whispered.","Li Moying immediately leaned nearer, “Li’er, what’s the matter? Are you feeling better now?”","Huang Yueli nodded, “My wounds seemed to have closed up and it’s not that painful already...”","Li Moying heaved a sigh of relief, “That’s great! You can soak a little longer because the energy in Phoenix Blood is extremely abundant. Moreover it is compatible with your attribute so if you soak in it long enough, it will also repair the damage in your meridians.”","Huang Yueli nodded, “I know, that’s right!” She suddenly thought of something, “Do you want to take a soak as well? That time when I took the Phoenix Blood out, it was so that you and Little Wang Cai could have a soak in it but as there were plenty of matters happening later on, I forgot about it...”","She hadn’t completed her sentence when she saw Li Moying’s eyes lit up.","“Li’er, are you inviting me to have a lover’s bath?”","“Lo... Lover’s bath??” Huang Yueli was flabbergasted as she went into a daze and then furiously stared at him, “Love your head! You go over to that tub to soak!”","Saying that, her right hand waved and a bathtub appeared in the room. It was filled completely with Phoenix Blood as well but this bathtub was obviously much smaller than hers by two sizes.","Li Moying turned his head and took a look as he couldn’t help but frowned, “This small?”","Based on his tall figure, this bathtub really seemed a little too small. If he sat in it, he probably needed to curl up entirely."]},{"number":1410,"title":"Chapter 1410 - So shameless (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli took a look and realised that as she said helplessly, “This... my space only had that little tub! But I have several tubs here! Why don’t you go look for a bigger tub and pour two tubs of Phoenix Blood into it then you can wash yourself with it.”","Li Moying’s lips curled, “Why so troublesome?”","He gave a devilish smile, a little different from usual but still had the same handsome and tempting look which made Huang Yueli’s heart skip a beat as her senses were slightly off.","By the time she regained her senses, she discovered that Li Moying had deftly stripped all his clothes off!","Furthermore he wasn’t shy at all as he totally had nothing on him and specially walked over calmly.","The minute Huang Yueli opened her eyes, she happened to see the spot where she wasn’t supposed to be looking at...","“You... how could you suddenly remove all your clothes! Pervert! Shameless!” Huang Yueli flusteredly covered her eyes, feeling her own face burning up.","Li Moying innocently replied, “Wasn’t it you who asked me to have a soak? Don’t tell me you want me to have a soak with my clothes on? How unbearable would that be?”","“But... but you can tell me first!”","“Since you said to have a soak, then isn’t the next step to take off the clothes? Such an obvious matter and I still need to inform you beforehand?” Li Moying put on an innocent look.","Huang Yueli was stuffed. If it wasn’t for the fact that she knew this man’s true character, just looking at the expression on his face, one would really thought that he was a just good male who was framed! He was really so bad that he was shedding dregs!","Huang Yueli was extremely melancholic as she hurriedly replied, “Alright, since your clothes have already been taken off, then hurriedly go into the bathtub to soak! Why are you wasting time?”","She was thinking that if Li Moying went into the bathtub, then whatever shouldn’t be seen would not be seen, then the both of them would be able to have a good chat.","Otherwise, she would probably get a stye from seeing something that she shouldn’t be looking at!","Although she said that but in Huang Yueli’s mind, the earlier scene kept popping out.","Li Moying’s figure was tall and robust; from his broad shoulder one could tell that it was filled with strength. His sturdy muscle lines were perfect and flawless and following that pectoral muscles all the way down.... Ughh.....","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but covered her face once again. She... what was it that she saw earlier! She actually remembered it so clearly? Could it be that she was a **** in her bones?","Li Moying gave a response and stopped right there.","Huang Yueli was just feeling bewildered when she suddenly felt the bathtub which she was sitting in shook gently. Subsequently, the contents in the bathtub suddenly rose upwards and with a “splash” some water spilled onto the ground.","A warm body squeezed in and plastered tightly to her back.","Huang Yueli suddenly turned her head as she saw the man had already entered the bath and that chest which made her full of imagination suddenly appeared right in front of her eyes.","“Li Moying—–!!!” Huang Yueli couldn’t help but screamed, “Who allowed you to enter???”","Li Moying laughed softly, “Hmm? Wasn’t it you who asked me to hurry and come over to take a soak earlier? I’m so obedient, listening to whatever you tell me, why are you still angry?”","Huang Yueli was so infuriated that she almost threw up blood!","“Don’t you understand human language? I asked you to go over to that bathtub for a soak!”","Li Moying replied, “This... how would I know where you want me to do? You didn’t make it clear earlier and now that I’ve already jumped in, can you don’t be so picky! Moreover, that bathtub is so small, don’t you feel sorry for me?”"]},{"number":1411,"title":"Chapter 1411 - So shameless (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli retorted angrily, “That bathtub is too small! Then if we squeeze two people in this bathtub, it will definitely be even tighter! You still insist on squeezing in!”","Li Moying put on an extremely pure expression, “Two people together is indeed a little too squeezy but if we adjust our positions, we can still sit properly.”","Huang Yueli had not responded in time when her slender waist was locked by his hand.","Li Moying used his strength and lifted her slender body gently as he adjusted position so that she could sit on his leg.","Huang Yueli stumbled and directly fell into his arms, tightly stuck together with him.","If it was usual times, just based on the intimate relationship which they shared, this really wasn’t much but... the both of them had nothing on them!!","“You.... you big pervert, quickly let go of me!”","Huang Yueli tried her best to wiggle around, trying to get off from his body.","Li Moynig couldn’t help but moaned, “If you don’t want any accidents to happen, the best would be for you not to move!”","“What?” Huang Yueli sensitively sensed that something was amiss, but couldn’t totally understand what he meant....","Li Moying looked at her pure expression as he gave a bitter laugh in his heart, feeling that he had really moved a rock to smash his own feet. Not only did he not manage to flirt with his own fiancée, instead he started to burn up in passion. But unfortunately, he could not possibly really do anything to the injured her...","Li Moying held her slender waist as she nudged towards the other side, at the same time shifting himself a distance away.","Heaven knew that his body reaction indeed was unconcealable and if it wasn’t for rationality which reminded him that his Li’er had suffered heavy injuries today and couldn’t take any more torment, he would probably have turned into a wolf, pouncing towards her!","Really damnit!","Li Moying’s tone was stiff, “Alright, stop fooling around and cultivate properly! This Phoenix Blood’s energy is indeed powerful so don’t waste it!”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect this man to have a change of expression. Earlier he still had a lustful expression and the next moment, he actually turned so solemn and just, furthermore pushing her aside?","Was it because she treated him too fiercely causing this narrow-minded man to throw his pampered arrogant tantrum?","But what right did he have to be angry? He was obviously at fault!","Huang Yueli rose her eyes as she stole a look at Li Moying, sizing him up from left, right, up and down.","Li Moying shut his eyes, not daring to look at her delicate pretty face but through his soul trace, he was still able to clearly sense that his Li’er had been staring at him.","Worried that his little lass could tell that something was wrong with him, Li Moying hurriedly said, “What’s the matter? Why do you keep staring at me? Are you really having ulterior motives towards me?”","“I.... to you..... ulterior motives??” Huang Yueli’s mouth fell agape.","Li Moying smiled lightly, “Why? Really coveting my body? No problem, go ahead and pounce up on me, you know I would never reject you.....”","“Scram, hasn’t anyone told you that you’re a real narcissistic!” Huang Yueli exploded once again.","Li Moying couldn’t tolerate it and wanted to laugh as that burning passionate desire in his heart had subsided by quite a bit...","His Li’er was simply too cute. Usually she always acted to black bellied and powerful in front of outsiders but in front of him, she was so childish and adorable...","He lowered his voice, “Since you have no designs then I can rest my heart so let’s grab hold of time quickly to cultivate!”","“Do I need you to tell me that!”","She could tell that Li Moying was not angry so Huang Yueli immediately turned into her pampered arrogant self."]},{"number":1412,"title":"Chapter 1412 - Common purpose (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","She nudged to the side once more as she stayed far away from Li Moying before shutting her eyes and fully concentrating on cultivating.","Li Moying sensed that the young lady’s breathing became stable and opened his eyes, turning his head to look at her.","That fair complexion was filled with a shade of red because of the heat and his heart started to jolt again.","Li Moying hurriedly shut his eyes and held his breathing, forcing himself to forget what he had seen earlier but alas, his reaps were minimal.","It took a long period of time before he successfully entered the state of cultivation.","He gotta admit that the energy contained in Phoenix Blood was extremely powerful.","The next morning, Huang Yueli’s injuries had recovered by a large majority. Although it was still a distance from a full recovery, at least all the wounds had closed up and the swelling had gone down by quite a bit.","Whereas Li Moying seemed to have slight signs of advancement.","After Huang Yueli realised this, she looked at her own fiancé’s jealousy. This man.... his innate talent was just too good wasn’t it! He was already at seventh stage realm third level and just soaking an entire night in Phoenix Blood made him want to advance again?","He wasn’t from Sacred Phoenix Race and his main attribute wasn’t fire but his absorption towards energy was so powerful!","Li Moying turned back and threw her a puzzled look, “What’s the matter? Why are you staring at me like that?”","Huang Yueli raised her chin bluntly, “Next time you’re not allowed to take a soak with me! In order to prevent you from sneaking an attack on me, I’ve already let Mo Yi find a super large bathtub for you and it’s placed in the study room so you can go there and take a soak!”","Li Moying immediately put on a pretentious pitiful look, “Ah? Why? This is obviously my bedroom too? Why can’t I use it?”","Huang Yueli replied, “What you said is reasonable. If not you can just sleep in the study room from now on, so in this way you won’t feel that it’s not normal!”","“Don’t... don’t... I’ll go alright?” Li Moying was helpless as he could only raise both his hands and feet to surrender.","Although he was not able to see the beautiful view of the beauty emerging from the bath, but it was much better than being swept out of the door by his fiancée!","Only, Mo Yi this fellow really was too blind! Did he or did he not know who the Master of this house was? He actually dared to help Huang Yueli search for a bathtub? He was really in need of a lesson...","...","Li Moying spend every day accompanying his fiancée cultivating, soaking, refining armaments and was so indulged in the pleasure that he forgot his duties, too lazy to even leave his residence.","Murong De had sent someone over to look for him several times, to bring Huang Yueli over to Celestial Light Sect’s higher management meeting but were all rejected by him.","Now that seventy percent quota was already in their hands, for Celestial Light Sect to hold a meeting at this point of time, it was definitely to enquire on how to distribute the quota.","This was something which was linked to every wing’s benefits and if it were ordinary Elders, they simply could not be absent from this meeting.","But Li Moying totally wasn’t interested at all.","Anyway his position was up there in the Sect and moreover this quota was won entirely based on his Li’er so the quota that belonged to him would not be very little. As for how the others got it, what did it have to do with him?","This kind of lousy matter regarding fighting for benefits was something which he was most uninterested in. How on earth was it able to be as interesting as compared to teasing his little fiancée?","But even though Li Moying and Huang Yueli didn’t attend the meeting, Luo Jiyun came knocking on the door on pretext of visiting Huang Yueli and even brought along quite a number of latest news in the Sect.","“Eldest Senior Brother, Sister-in-law, luckily you didn’t join in that meeting to distribute the quote. You don’t know that on that day at the meeting, Elder Han and Elder Wang had completely torn their faces over a few quota!”"]},{"number":1413,"title":"Chapter 1413 - Common purpose (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Luo Jiyun gave a vivid and lifelike description, “The two Elders are all three to four hundred years old but they were still banging tables as they quarrelled, which was simply an eye-opener!”","According to the usual conditions, it wasn’t Luo Jiyun’s turn to attend such a kind of management meeting but as he displayed outstanding performance at the arena tournament plus Li Moying personally assigned him to his spokesman, hence he had the chance to attend the meeting.","Li Moying gave a cold snort, “These old men had always been like that but they always acted prim and proper in front of ordinary disciples only!”","Huang Yueli was rather curious, “Then what was the final conclusion of the meeting? How was the quota allocated eventually?”","Luo Jiyun replied, “The Elders each stood their own grounds, assuming that they had contributed the greatest to the Sect and all wanted a few more places! Moreover they mentioned that if they didn’t obtain a satisfactory amount of quota, they would reject giving a hand at the time when the mystic region opens up. By then, everyone would not be able to go! Simply too much!”","He felt indignant at the injustice as he spoke whereas Huang Yueli and Li Moying were totally used to this.","So what if they were ninth stage realm practitioners? So what if they were Elders from a large Sect? In front of benefits, no one would possibly give way as their ugly faces showed so they were long used to seeing this!","Luo Jiyun continued, “Luckily Master finally thought of an idea. Other than the ten quota which Eldest Senior Brother requested for and must be given, the remaining sixty quota must be given according to certification of ability. Which means, the Sect will hold a tournament seven days later. All of the disciples in the Sect, regardless of whether they are direct disciples or not, are all allowed to take part. However only those placed in the top sixty will be allowed to get a quota to enter the ancient mystic region!”","Huang Yueli laughed as she said, “Sect Master Murong is after all someone who had been a Sect Master for many years. He indeed has ideas so in this way, the other Elders have no way to oppose right?”","“Isn’t that so? Elder Wang’s disciples under his wings aren’t really that strong in terms of ability so this proposal is very disadvantageous to him but he simply couldn’t find any reason to oppose, so he was so infuriated that he left directly on the spot!”","Seeing the both of them in such speculative talk, Li Moying was watching from the side as he uncontrollably felt a little jealous.","He stretched out his hand and locked onto Huang Yueli’s arm as he carried her from the back, “All these are basically rubbish on the scramble for power and profit so there’s nothing much to listen to.”","Saying that he turned his head around to look at Luo Jiyun, “Fifth Junior Brother, from what you narrated, it means that you must take part in the tournament seven days later so why are you not returning back to cultivate?”","Luo Jiyun didn’t realise that Li Moying was jealous as he gave a complacent laugh when he heard what Li Moying said.","“Eldest Senior Brother, it’s not as if you don’t know! My current ability among the younger generation of the Sect is of no problem to get into the top ten. How could I not get a quota for myself?”","Li Moying’s face turned darker, “Then what will happen after you enter the mystic region? The ancient mystic region is filled with danger and just based on your fifth stage realm cultivation, you can’t even defeat your sister-in-law. What happens if you meet with danger?”","Luo Jiyun then detected that Li Moying’s tone wasn’t quite right.","“Ughh, this...”","Huang Yueli burst out in laughter.","“Junior Brother Luo, thank you for telling us these today. I have something on with your Eldest Senior Brother so do on back first! If there’s any new news, remember to let us know!”","Luo Jiyun looked at Li Moying’s hand which was clasped tightly on Huang Yueli’s waist then looked at his evidently unpleasant expression when he finally got it.","He wiped the cold sweat on his forehead as he gave an agreeable response and immediately slipped away."]},{"number":1414,"title":"Chapter 1414 - Common purpose (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli looked at his fleeing figure as she found it even funnier.","Li Moying gave a cold harrumph, “At last he’s gone, at least he knows what’s good for him!”","Huang Yueli shook her head helplessly, “You don’t need to act in this way right! Junior Brother Luo merely just spoke a few sentences to me!”","“What’s there to talk about? Those matters which he mentioned are of no value at all!” Li Moying was filled with disdain for him.","Huang Yueli curiously asked, “The matter regarding the quota allocation, you’re really not going to care about it? Then will you still go watch the tournament which will be held seven days later?”","Li Moying gave her a strange look, “What’s there to see, don’t tell me you wish to go?”","Huang Yueli shook her head.","“Then that does it! Let’s ignore those boring people and continue with our bath! Can we soak together today?”","“Scram, fat hope!”","...","Seven days later.","Celestial Light Sect’s internal tournament started as scheduled.","This tournament, to the Sect’s inner disciples, was an absolutely great chance for them to change their lives. Originally based on their statuses, it was impossible for them to fight for a quota with the direct disciples so such a good thing like entering the mystic region would never be their turn.","However this round, because of Huang Yueli who had fought for more quota, they were allowed to have a chance to take part in the tournament.","Many of them were feeling grateful towards Huang Yueli and in many Celestial Light Sect disciples’ eyes, Huang Yueli was the same as Li Moying, already becoming a legendary level character.","Many of them knew that they could not possibly win at this tournament but they still chose to take part in it. The main reason was hoping to catch a glimpse of the two of them.","Unfortunately, what made them disappointed was that Li Moying and Huang Yueli both didn’t appear at all.","But this totally didn’t affect the intensity of the tournament.","On the stage, the battle progress was unstoppable as everyone wanted to grab hold of this once-in-a-lifetime chance hence the battle was extremely intense.","On the contrary, some powerful direct disciples didn’t need to battle and they obtained the quota hence they stayed by the side to watch the show without any pressure.","Under the tree shade, Murong Fei swept her glances towards the high stage several rounds as she revealed a disappointed look.","“Eldest Senior Brother really didn’t come!”","Li Lingchuan replied, “So what if he came? Every time Eldest Senior Brother appears, he would bring along his little fiancée and now quite a number of people are fans of Miss Bai so her reputation has already outshone yours. If they were to appear together, then that scene.... You will definitely not be able to take it!”","Murong Fei was so angry that she bit her teeth but was totally unable to say any words of rebuttal.","“That little slut! I’ll show her sooner or later!”","“What’s the point of just cursing her? If you want to make her disappear, then you have to think of a complete plan!”","As Li Lingchuan was saying that, he suddenly saw a man dressed in white standing not too far away.","His gaze suddenly flashed as he said to Murong Fei, “Third Junior Sister, earlier Master seemed to have sent someone over to look for you.”","“Oh? Was there? How come I didn’t hear a thing?” Murong Fei asked in puzzlement.","Li Lingchuan replied, “Earlier I heard a servant girl calling out for you. Quickly go take a look, perhaps it might be something urgent!”","Murong Fei frowned but she didn’t consider the fact that Li Lingchuan would lie to her so she quickly left.","After Li Lingchuan sent Murong Fei away, he walked towards that white robed man.","“Master Leng, long time no see! I’d not expected to meet you here today.”","Leng Yi Feng stood alone under a tree not too far away as he was concentrating on the battle on stage.","He wasn’t Celestial Light Sect’s disciple so for him to return to his place, his motive was naturally not simple."]},{"number":1415,"title":"Chapter 1415 - Common purpose (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Leng Yi Feng saw Li Lingchuan walking nearer as he was extremely surprised. He had thought that his action of spying had caused Celestial Light Sect’s displeasure so he hastily tried to clear himself.","“Master Li, long time no see, how have you been? Don’t misunderstand, I happen to be passing by and coincidentally saw the tournament that your Sect is holding. I’m preparing to leave now.”","This was called telling a lie with his eyes wide open.","Green Cloud Sect’s base was quite a distance away from Celestial Light Sect and although there were quite a number of guards patrolling near the tournament grounds, Leng Yi Feng was able to avoid all the guards perfectly while appearing at this place which was absolutely not possible to be as simple as “passing by”.","A clear-minded person knew it clearly that he was here to help Green Cloud Sect scout for the real situation.","After all, after they enter the ancient mystic region, the victor of the tournament would become Green Cloud Sect’s opponent.","Li Lingchuan gave a smile which didn’t looked quite like a smile as he replied, “Master Leng, I’m not here to chase you away but here specially to wait for you. I have some personal matters... which I wish to discuss with you.”","As one of the younger generation’s top experts who was just beneath Li Moying, Li Lingchuan had long obtained a quota to enter the mystic region so his motive here was to meet Leng Yi Feng!","“Oh? Leng Yi Feng’s brows rose in surprise, “You’re Celestial Light Sect’s talented disciple. What matter could you possibly have, to discuss with me?”","Li Lingchuan replied, “Let’s move elsewhere to have a chat.”","Leng Yi Feng nodded.","The both of them walked to an even seclusive corner.","Li Lingchuan then said, “Upright people don’t speak secretly. Our motive for looking for you, I’m assuming that Master Leng has already guessed it. We have a common purpose so after entering the ancient mystic region, we must cooperate properly!”","Leng Yi Feng’s heart jolted but the words which came out of his mouth were as such, “What does Master Li mean? Why is it that I don’t understand you at all? We are both in different Sects so how is it possible that we have a common purpose?”","Li Lingchuan took a look at their surroundings and after verifying that no one was hiding in the darkness to eavesdrop, he finally brought his meaning out into the open.","“Master Leng, do you want Bai Ruoli or not?”","Leng Yi Feng’s body shook! He totally had not expected that his hidden thoughts was exposed in such a direct manner!","He indeed wanted that exceptionally talented genius young lady. Furthermore after witnessing her shocking performance on the arena stage that day, his heart desired her even more than ever as that feeling was so intense that it was like a ball of fire, devouring and scorching at his chest.","Only, the man behind Huang Yueli was simply too powerful! Furthermore Huang Yueli totally treated his Leng family’s authority with haughty contempt. That day she had directly rejected him so that left Leng Yi Feng with no more plans to execute.","Moreover, he had been defeated by Li Moying in just one move several times. It was simply so embarrassing that he didn’t even dared to talk about this so how was a Celestial Light Sect disciple able to see through him?","Leng Yi Feng immediately denied, “I don’t understand what you’re talking about! Bai Ruoli? Isn’t she a disciple of your Celestial Light Sect? What does she have to do with me?”","Li Lingchuan looked at this instantly changing expression as it affirmed the guess in his heart.","He spoke steadfastly, “Actually the performance which you showed on the arena stage that day already let many of us see that something was not quite right. Bai Ruoli was Li Moying’s fiancée but when Fang Shaoning wanted to deal her with a deadly hand, you suddenly appeared to stop your own junior brother! Isn’t that very strange?","“Logically speaking, if Bai Ruoli was either killed or crippled, my Eldest Senior Brother would be despondent but to you, it should be something which was worth celebrating over!”"]},{"number":1416,"title":"Chapter 1416 - Common purpose (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Leng Yi Feng really didn’t expect that his involuntary rashness that day actually allowed someone to see through his flaw.","He thought that he had concealed it very well!","Leng Yi Feng refused to admit, “I am doing this because of the friendship between our Sects. If someone died on the arena, and the person who died is Li Moying’s fiancée, then there would definitely be no way for our two Sects to continue with the cooperation.”","Li Lingchuan plainly knew that he wouldn’t easily admit to it as he wasn’t in a hurry as well.","He said this in a straightforward manner, “Master Leng, the graceful maiden is well suited as a spouse for the gentleman so what’s there to deny about? You don’t need to guard me as though you’re guarding against a thief. I’m here looking for you because I want to help you!”","“Help me? Are you that kind hearted?” Leng Yi Feng gave a cold laugh.","Li Lingchuan replied, “The lady you like is already engaged. Although it is disappointing but after all, they’re still not married isn’t it? If an accident were to happen to her fiancé while he was on experience training.....”","A light flashed past Leng Yi Feng’s eyes as he finally raised his head to look at Li Lingchuan in the eye.","The two exchanged glares and saw the ambition and schemes in each other’s eyes.","Leng Yi Feng remained silent for a while then laughed, “Looks like Master Leng is after something big! That’s not wrong either. Based on Master Leng’s innate talent and potential, you are considered as a top rated super talent in South Sky Region but unfortunately, having an abnormal Senior Brother like Li Moying, no matter how hard you try, it’s impossible to surpass him. If I were in your shoes, I would be extremely melancholic.”","Li Lingchuan didn’t deny nor did he admit to it. He merely replied, “So does that mean that Master Leng believes the sincerity that I have to cooperate with you?”","Leng Yi Feng nodded as he replied, “I understand your intention now but if I were to help you deal with Li Moying, the advantage which you will get is huge. Not only will you get to replace him as Celestial Light Sect’s Young Sect Master to become the future Sect Master, you will also be able to marry Sect Master Murong’s daughter. As compared to that, I am at a major disadvantage.”","Li Lingchuan said disapprovingly, “Master Leng, why try to sound me out? Whether I’m at a disadvantage or not, you know it very well! For a peerless talented young lady like Bai Ruoli, she is a rare case and even in the entire Sky Emperor City, there probably are not many around! Even if there is... there are so many strong practitioners in Sky Emperor City so when will it be your turn? You only have this one chance and if you miss it, you’ll regret it for life, isn’t that so?”","Obviously everyone could tell that it was a rare sight to see a young lady with exceeding innate talent in both armament refining and cultivation!","Even if Li Lingchuan had absolute disgust towards Huang Yueli because of Li Moying, but he had no choice but to admit that Huang Yueli’s value was even much higher than Celestial Light Sect, the number one Sect in South Sky Region!","The person to gain the biggest reward from this transaction was still Leng Yi Feng.","Leng Yi Feng saw that he was so clear-minded and didn’t bother to be pretentious anymore so he could only reply, “Alright, since we’re going to cooperate, then let’s bring out our sincerity. Actually I originally intended to take action in the mystic region and I have a rough idea. Only there’s a little problem which I have no way to solve.”","“Oh? What problem is that?”","Li Lingchuan didn’t expect the matter to be so smooth as he asked excitedly.","Leng Yi Feng continued, “Actually the ancient mystic region which we are going to enter this time is an early historical remains left in Soaring Heavens Continent which was left by the Cloudy Qilin Clan several thousands of years ago. It had been recorded in Green Cloud Sect’s historical ancient records and recently a few Elders from the Sect had finally decoded the contents after several hundred years of research, certifying the location of this ancient mystic region.”"]},{"number":1417,"title":"Chapter 1417 - Common purpose (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","He paused and continued, “The ancient records not only recorded the location of the ancient mystic region.. Furthermore it also roughly recorded the situation in the mystic region.”","Li Lingchuan’s eyes immediately lit up, “In this case, you guys have the map of the mystic region?”","Leng Yi Feng shook his head, “It’s not really considered as a map and the historical ancient records aren’t complete. Many contents are mutilated and some are totally non-decodable so we could only decode part of the contents. But it’s more than enough to use it to deal with Li Moying.”","Leng Yi Feng checked the surrounding as he lowered his voice even more, “The ancient records stated a few extremely dangerous locations and the most dangerous part of all is the area which is right smack in the centre of the mystic region, circumference of within ten miles. It was rumoured that in the several thousands of years, this ancient mystic region had been opened several times and every single time someone entered the centre region, there would always be no return and so far, no one had successfully come out before!”","“You’re saying...” Li Lingchuan was also an intelligent person so he immediately understood what he was trying to say, “We can lure Li Moying over to that centre region?”","Leng Yi Feng nodded and replied, “That’s right.”","Li Lingchuan continued while looking a little worried, “This plan sounds feasible but are you certain you’re able to trap him? You’ve also seen it for yourself on my Eldest Senior Brother’s ability. Many things which are totally impossible for others, but to him, it’s so easy. If this time round he’s done it yet again, completing what other people couldn’t complete to leave the centre region safely, then we...”","The minute Li Moying went into a rage, there was no one who could take his wrath.","Although Li Lingchuan was plotting behind him secretly but when he thought about the consequences which could possibly happen after their plot falls through, he couldn’t help but feel a chill run down his spine.","Leng Yi Feng gave a cold snort, “I really can’t tell that your guts is this small, and you’re still planning on becoming Celestial Light Sect’s future Sect Master? As the saying goes, you won’t be able to get the tiger cub if you don’t enter the tiger den? You can’t even take this amount of risk? Moreover speaking, for several thousands of years, among the number of talents who entered the centre region, there is definitely someone who is more outstanding than Li Moying but they also couldn’t return back isn’t it? This is a mystic region which was left by a historical sacred clan! If it wasn’t your Celestial Light Sect’s array, how could it possibly not trap him!”","Li Lingchuan thought about it and indeed found it logical, as he finally toughened his heart.","“Alright, then we’ll listen to your plan! How do you want me to coordinate with you?”","Leng Yi Feng continued, “This plan to me, the most difficult part is how to lure Li Moying over. After all we’re not of the same Sect and the minute we enter the mystic region, our relationship will then become the opposing team. Li Moying isn’t an idiot so how could he possibly not defend against me?”","When Li Lingchuan heard that, he immediately laughed, “You want me to help lure him over? This is simple, leave it all to me!”","As they were under the same wing, wasn’t it a small issue which didn’t require much effort to dig this hole for Li Moying?","Saying that, he looked left and right before preparing to leave.","This was Celestial Light Sect’s internal tournament grounds and as a disciple of Green Cloud Sect, it originally wasn’t a place which he could stay for long.","Li Lingchuan hurriedly called out to him, “Mister Leng, wait a moment, I have a request!”","“What’s the matter?” Leng Yi Feng frowned.","Li Lingchuan continued, “I need Murong Fei’s help to lure Li Moying over. So I’ll explain this entire matter to her but please do not expose the contents of the deal between us to her.”"]},{"number":1418,"title":"Chapter 1418 - Here for a spring outing (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Leng Yi Feng heard that, he was stunned, “What do you mean?”","Li Lingchuan explained, “You should be able to tell that my Third Junior Sister openly admires Li Moying. If she were to find out that our common purpose is to get him killed, then she would absolutely not help us, so...”","That was why he intentionally drove Murong Fei away when he saw Leng Yi Feng, before he approached him.","Leng Yi Feng understood the meaning behind as he immediately nodded to promise, “Be assured, I know what to say!”","After the two of them derived a common understanding, the both of them parted ways and sneakily left.","No one would have expected that the opposing Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect had two important figures who had secretly reached an agreement on an underhanded transaction.","...","Very quickly, a month’s time passed by.","This day was the important day which Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect agreed to meet, to work together mutually to activate the ancient mystic region.","Three days ago, both large Sects had assigned several flying ships with their Elders and disciples who were going to enter the mystic region to the meeting point.","Gathering at a dim swamp in between South Sky Region and West Sky Region’s boundary.","There weren’t many resources which were of use and were extremely dangerous so usually the number of people who neared this place was scarce. So there was practically no one who could have thought that this place hid an early historical remains which the ancient sacred clan left behind.","At this juncture, Green Cloud Sect didn’t keep any more secrets.","Under Murong De’s continuous urging, Cui Yuan introduced the situation in the mystic region in simple terms.","“This ancient mystic region was heard to be an early history which had been left behind by the great powerhouse Cloudy Qilin Clan in the ancient times, hence its name as Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region. According to ancient records, Cloudy Qilin Clan had left the Soaring Heavens Continent under the pressure of the Sacred Phoenix Race several thousands of years ago. As there were some treasures which they were unable to bring along with them, hence they left it all in the mystic region, protecting it and only using a special method would they be able to activate the mystic region.”","“Several thousands of years ago, there was someone who followed according to the ancient records to open the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region but in the past ten thousand years, more than half of the contents of the ancient records had gone missing resulting in no knowledge of this mystic region.”","“This time round, us two Sects will be working together to activate the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region so this is a huge feat for the past ten thousand years! It’s worth commemorating! Fellows of Celestial Light Sect who are able to join in this lucky chance are really having great luck!”","As Cui Yuan Shan spoke, he started to feel disgusted.","The ones who had decoded the ancient records and found Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region were then Green Cloud Sect.","But the one who benefited the most was actually Celestial Light Sect!","Seventy percent of the mystic region quota had been snatched away from them which really made his head ache, liver ache, flesh ache, aching everywhere!","Thinking of this, Cui Yuan Shan thought of the character who made Green Cloud Sect suffered the most loss – Huang Yueli! If not for her sudden appearance, things wouldn’t have developed to such a state and Green Cloud Sect would have definitely obtained enough quota smoothly.","Cui Yuan Shan’s gaze swept towards Huang Yueli and it only took one look to make him extremely infuriated.","He saw that young lass, the culprit, holding hands with Li Moying as they stood at the very end of the Celestial Light Sect team. Furthermore a relaxed expression hung on her face as she kept looking around, totally not carefully listening to him talking at all!","What situation was this? Based on her background as a young lass from the countryside, this should be the first time that she obtained such a good chance for experience learning, to enter such a high class mystic region for an expedition so shouldn’t she be acting in fear and trepidation?","Why did she totally seem as though she disregarded this, making it look as though she was out for a spring outing!","Did she know or not knew just how difficult it was to get this chance, which many people had tried their best but were still unable to get it?"]},{"number":1419,"title":"Chapter 1419 - Here for a spring outing (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Cui Yuan Shan would not have thought that to Huang Yueli, she had seen too many of such scenarios!","In her past life, she had been to almost all of the ancient mystic regions in Soaring Heavens Continent and moreover, most of the time, it was always with the man who was beside her.","So to her, following her own fiancé into the mystic region for experience learning, was really no different from a spring outing...","Huang Yueli acted as though there was nobody else as she observed the surrounding terrain and suddenly tugged Li Moying’s sleeve.","“Moying, did you hear what that old man Cui said? This Cloudy Qilin Clan was chased out of Soaring Heavens Continent by the Sacred Phoenix Race. Looks like they have a feud with my family clan!”","Li Moying shot her a glance with a smile, this lass! She looked as though she wasn’t paying attention but in actual fact, she had heard what Cui Yuan Shan was talking about?","He lowered his head as he laughed softly, “What’s the matter? Are you afraid? Perhaps the mystic region has some traps specially set up towards the Sacred Phoenix Race, just waiting to catch a young lass from the Sacred Phoenix Race like you to offer as sacrifice for their ancestors...”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but give him a punch, “What’s the meaning of this? How dare you actually scare me! I’m telling you, I’m not afraid! Earlier what I wanted to say is since it’s the enemy’s mystic region, then I must try my hardest to search for more treasures and not stand on ceremony with them!”","Li Moying burst out into laughter, “Just admit that you’re a money grubber, why bother to find excuses for yourself? Since when have you ever stood on ceremony with anyone?”","“Li Moying, say that one more time??”","Huang Yueli stared at her own fiancé in an utterly discomfited look. How dare he tear down her stage, simply too much! Didn’t he see Mo Yi and the rest giggling secretly by the side?","Li Moying especially loved to see her seething look so he intentionally teased her earlier to make her angry.","But he was also afraid that Huang Yeuli would really turn her face on him so on seeing her stomp her feet, he hurriedly stopped while he was still able to.","He pointed to the group in front as he attempted to switch the topic, “Quickly take a look! The two Sect’s Elders are already standing in position and from the looks of it, they are going to activate the mystic region immediately!”","Huang Yueli heard this important news and indeed shifted her attention towards the direction which he was pointing at.","Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect’s ninth stage realm Elders had already gathered together and now they were following Crui Yuan Shan’s commands, standing in position on their designated positions.","There were a total of eighteen Elders and the two Sects came out with half each.","One could tell that they were standing in position according to a special array position, and instinctively they formed a semi-circle shape whereas the core of the array stood the two Sect Masters, Cui Yuan Shan and Murong De.","After the Elders were in position, Cui Yuan Shan didn’t announce the activation of the mystic region but let everyone continue to wait.","Having waited roughly for more than one hour, by now, the sky had turned totally dark and a stage of the new moon slowly shifted towards the east direction.","Following the splendour of the moon’s rays, the ground of the swamp actually started to surface a mass of thick fog.","This mass of fog was originally very thin but very quickly, it became extremely thick and the boundary of it became wider and wider. Not long after, it started to envelop the entire swamp!","“This... what is this?? How did it become like this? I’m seeing white everywhere and unable to see the person in front of me!”","“Could it be that the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region is hidden inside this mass of fog?”","“What’s going on? I can’t see anything at all, how are we going to activate the mystic region?”","Almost all of the younger disciples present had not seen such a scenario before and after realising that they couldn’t see anything clearly, they started to turn panicky."]},{"number":1420,"title":"Chapter 1420 - Here for a spring outing (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It was a common sight to Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","Before an ancient mystic region surfaced, there was bound to be some form of heteromorphic happening. It was merely a mass of fog and nothing dangerous so it wasn’t something which was worth getting worried over.","Although this was the case, Li Moying still subconsciously held Huang Yueli’s hand tightly.","Huang Yueli laughed, “Why are you grabbing my hand so tightly for. My hand is already hurting and I won’t be lost!”","Li Moying gave a cold harrumph, “You always like to run about and if I don’t grab hold of you tightly, you’d just leave me on my own and run off!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but burst out into laughter. She knew clearly that Li Moying had recalled the events in her past life when she ran off on her own to look for high levelled materials for armament refining.","She held Li Moying’s hand and swayed while speaking obediently, “In the past I was young and immature but I won’t do that again now.... Moreover, I’m still very, very weak now and need a powerful fiancé to protect me right?”","Li Moying still gave a cold snort and although his tone didn’t sound any signs of softening up, but the grip on his hand had relaxed by quite a bit, no longer grabbing on his hand tightly, but rather holding on to her gently.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled. This man was really easy to coax! Just a few sweet nothings settled him totally!","Right now, the fog echoed Cui Yuan Shan’s loud booming voice.","“All Elders, the auspicious time had reached. I’ll count to three so will everyone please try your best to inject Profound Energy towards the array! I beseech everyone not to hold back and do your best. This ancient mystic region has existed for too long and the amount of Profound Energy required is extreme whereas we only have a quarter of an hour to prepare. Once we miss this chance, the mystic region will not be activated within the next ten years!”","Cui Yuan Shan expressed the severity of this matter and started to count.","“Three!”","“Two!”","“One!”","“Start!”","The minute he finished counting, all the Elders did all they could to unleash the Profound Energy within their bodies totally towards the array!","With so many ninth stage realm practitioners making a move all at one go, the air was permeated fully with the might of Profound Energy, overwhelming with surging waves!","Momentarily, some younger disciples couldn’t hold on as they started retreating. There were some who even fell onto the ground directly. Luckily the Elders were standing in a position which was very far away. Otherwise, the younger disciples here would all be seriously injured!","As the Profound Energy in the array grew abundant, not long after, the fog in the air speedily lightened and started to dissipate at a visible speed....","Roughly after a quarter of an hour, the fog completely disappeared.","But as it was night time, the surroundings still looked a little misty.","An obviously black hole appeared in mid-air, around the height of two human and four to five meters wide. They could tell that this was a passageway, only there was totally no way to see the situation on the other end of the black hole from the exterior.","Cui Yuan Shan shouted out again, “Alright, now that the ancient mystic region has successfully been activated, the mystic region’s entrance can only last for the duration of an incense stick so those qualified disciples please enter speedily! Lastly, to remind all of you, we will be activating the mystic region for the second time one month later so by then, everyone must arrive at the designated gathering point to wait for us to activate the entrance. If you miss the timing, then you will be trapped inside forever! No one can save you! Now, you may all set off!”","Everyone was jubilant as they had been waiting for this sentence of Cui Yuan Shan’s.","Once he finished his last note, several disciples rushed up ahead as they ducked into the black hole without turning back."]},{"number":1421,"title":"Chapter 1421 - Here for a spring outing (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The others weren’t resigned to being left behind as they all started to chase up, dashing towards the mystic region.","Li Moying however, wasn’t in a hurry. This wasn’t going to the market to buy vegetables. Surely it didn’t mean that being the first few would guarantee fresh vegetables right? If they really thought in that way, then wouldn’t that be a little too naïve!","There were plenty of dangers and various changes in mystic regions and in order to obtain a huge chance, to gain a rapid promotion required both luck and ability, which if either one was lacking, it would just not do.","He held his fiancée’s little hand as they walked in a neither fast nor slow pace, with the shadow guards following right behind them.","The few of them were already at the end of the group.","“Moying!”","Just as they were prepared to enter, Li Moying was suddenly called out by someone.","He turned back and saw Murong De standing right behind him bearing an anxious look.","“Moying, the mystic region is filled with dangers and because our Celestial Light Sect had obtained seventy percent quota this time round there is a large number of disciples who entered the mystic region. But because of this reason, there are many disciples whose ability are much lower have also entered the mystic region so we don’t know if they are able to adapt to the dangers of the mystic region. And although Green Cloud Sect’s numbers are much lower, but I suspect they have an internal map in their hands and if our Sect’s disciples were to meet with them, it would be extremely dangerous.....”","Li Moying understood his unspoken meaning as he said indifferently, “Master’s meaning is, for me to take care of our Sect’s disciples?”","Murong De hurriedly replied, “Exactly! I also know that you might not be able to take care of so many people but at the very least, try to keep an eye on your Junior Brothers and Junior Sisters.”","Murong De’s worry wasn’t out of nowhere.","This time, both his daughters, Murong Fei and Murong Ni were among those who had entered the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region. This fact made him, their father, felt really lucky but at the same time saddled with worries.","In the ancient mystic region, chances and dangers co-existed.","If both of his daughters got into trouble, how was he going to explain to his dead wife?","Especially Murong Ni, she was only at fourth stage realm cultivation and originally she would absolutely not be her turn to enter the Mystic Region. But as there were too any quota, that was why she had the chance but that also meant that the chances of her getting into an accident was much higher!","Li Moying narrowed his eyes slightly, “Master, you should be very clear that in order to obtain rewards in the mystic region, it would depend on one’s own ability and luck before they could roam about in the mystic region! The more critical the situation, the more possibility to obtain a heavenly chance. If they thought of getting my protection, then they would probably not reap any rewards so they might as well not go take the risk in the mystic region!”","Murong De was momentarily speechless.","Of course he understood whatever Li Moying had said right? He was only unable to rest his heart...","Li Moying paused for a moment and said, “I will take note of both Junior Sisters’ situation but as danger lurks all around the mystic region, I’m afraid that most of my time will be on self-protection, so I won’t have the extra energy to protect them.”","Murong De heard his reasonable and logical explanation and could only sigh, “Never mind, whether it’s a chance or a disaster, it would depend on their own fate! Quickly go in, the activation time of the mystic region is going to be over!”","Li Moying nodded as he pulled Huang Yueli’s small hand and walked into the black hole without turning back.","...","After a short span of time passing through the black hole, Huang Yueli felt that all she could see was darkness, as though she was swallowed entirely in endless darkness and her body floating without any source of support.","Immediately following that, she felt a warm sensation on her hand.","That was Li Moying holding on tightly to her hand! Not refusing to loosen!","Huang Yueli instantly felt secured as the flustered feeling in her heart was gone."]},{"number":1422,"title":"Chapter 1422 - Here for a spring outing (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","No matter where or when, as long as Li Moying was by her side, it made her feel extremely secured, as though there was nothing that her man could not handle.","Huang Yueli quickly regained her balance and steadied her footsteps as she followed Li Moying slowly moving forward.","Not long later, the darkness slowly disappeared.","It suddenly lit up brightly and the minute Huang Yueli opened her eyes, she realised that they were already at a picturesque location with beautiful scenery.","She turned her head back once again and saw that the black hole behind them had disappeared and all the disciples who had the quota to enter the mystic region had all entered while the entrance had officially closed up.","This meant that this bunch of people here were shut in this mystic region and they were to spend an entire month’s time here.","Young disciples sat in groups of three to five on the lush green grass but they were not admiring the scenery. On the contrary.... They were throwing up while clutching their chests!","Right before they entered the mystic region, which one of them weren’t filled with ambition and lofty ideas, thinking that the minute they entered this legendary ancient mystic region, they would immediately go on a lucky strike, obtaining a heavenly chance to rush towards the heavens, becoming one of the few top exponents in Soaring Heavens Continent?","The result was, the minute they had just entered the entrance, the majority of them almost tumbled!","They had not expected that the interior of the black hole was so black and so dark!","This darkness was very different from the normal kind of darkness where there was no light. That was absolute darkness, a kind of darkness origin which made one feel fear and unease right from their bones!","Even when Huang Yueli just entered this place, there was also a short moment of time when she felt ill at ease, what more for these young disciples whose experience and mentality was far worse off than hers?","Many of them stumbled onto the ground as they totally climbed into the mystic region.","Even if they finally saw light now, there were bouts of disgusted feeling in their stomach as they couldn’t stop themselves from throwing up.","Huang Yueli frowned in disdain, “What’s all these? The smell is really too pungent!”","Li Moying was also slightly discomforted. In his past life when he was in his Blue Profound Sect, this kind of soft-legged prawns who couldn’t even stand up from such a small matter would have been kicked out of his sect long ago, what more about letting them enter the mystic region?","Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect indeed couldn’t be compared to Sky Emperor City’s real powerhouses. The quality of their disciples were indeed on different grades.","“If you feel disgusted, then don’t look. Let’s find a quiet place to settle down for a bit!”","Li Moying tugged Huang Yueli along, as he wanted to leave.","Whoever knew, someone had seen them and shouted out loudly, “Eldest Senior Brother! Don’t go! How could you leave alone? I want to follow you guys!”","The two of them turned around and looked to discover that the person who spoke was Murong Ni whom they had not seen for quite a long time!","Ever since they parted ways in Dark Moon Forest the last time, Murong Ni had something against her conscience hence she didn’t dare to appear in front of Li Moying.","Especially after Huang Yueli and Li Moying returned, displaying her powerful armament refining and cultivation innate talent, Murong Ni felt that all the more she couldn’t afford to offend her hence she didn’t dared to find any trouble for Huang Yueli, hiding behind Murong Fei’s back to urge her on.","Alas, even Murong Fei wasn’t Haung Yueli’s match.","If it was usual times, Murong Ni would absolutely not dare to provoke Huang Yueli and the rest but unfortunately it was different this time round. As one of the practitioners who were allowed to enter the mystic region, her potential was one of the lowest among the rest and Murong Ni was very worried that she was not able to leave the mystic region safely.","Especially when she went through the black hole earlier, she had already experienced such a horrifying scene and Murong Ni almost couldn’t make it in time to enter the mystic region. She crawled on the ground for exactly a quarter of an hour and barely managed to nudge herself in at the very last moment just before the entrance closed up!"]},{"number":1423,"title":"Chapter 1423 - Here for a spring outing (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Recalling the scene earlier, Murong Ni was really frightened!","Because of this, she didn’t care about anything else other than the fact that she must grab hold of Eldest Senior Brother’s thigh properly.","Based on her own potential alone in this mystic region, it really wasn’t anything much and there were plenty of chances which she could land herself into danger. But if she could obtain Li Moying’s protection, that would be totally different!","However, even though she had made sound calculations for herself, Li Moying totally didn’t fall into her trap.","He only gave a fleeting glance towards Murong Ni as he said, “Not free!”","Saying that, he pulled Huang Yueli and was about to set off on his way.","Murong Ni hurriedly screamed loudly, “Eldest Senior Brother, you cannot leave! Before I entered the mystic region, my father had already told me that he will get you to protect me.... and elder sister’s safety in the mystic region! How could you not obey my father’s words? You must bring me along!”","Li Moying gave a cold humpf, “Just based on your guts and you have the cheek to come in for experience learning? If you had known this earlier, then you ought to give up your quota to someone else! There are plenty of disciples who want to come in! It’s not possible for me to bring you along so just drop the matter!”","Saying that, he totally ignored Murong Ni’s screams as he hurriedly dragged Huang Yueli away.","Murong Ni was simply so anxious that she was about to cry out loudly as she turned around, “Elder Sister, why didn’t you say anything? Eldest Senior Brother he’s really going to leave!”","Murong Fei was standing by the side watching Murong Ni sprawled on the ground still vomiting and the ugly sight of her sobbing as she really didn’t want to admit that she and her were biological sisters.","She spoke out disdainfully, “Enough, stop crying! Still not embarrassed enough? Since we’ve already entered the mystic region, then we’re here for experience learning and not for you to go on a scenic tour! There are plenty of chances among danger, so everyone has to rely on oneself!”","“Elder Sister, don’t you want to go experience learning with Eldest Senior Brother? Are you willing to see Eldest Senior Brother bringing that little slut long, behaving intimately?” Murong Ni asked in disbelief.","Murong Fei’s expression turned slightly ugly.","Of course she didn’t want to see Huang Yueli and Li Moying behaving intimately!","Heaven knows just how upset her heart was when she saw the two of them clasping their hands tightly and how intimately they conversed with each other!","But she had entered the mystic region today to achieve something big! She was going to eliminate that irritating little slut forever so that she was able to be with Eldest Senior Brother forever! Li Lingchuan had already told her that as long as she followed his plan, they would be able to let that little slut have no burial ground!","Thinking of this, Murong Fei forcefully suppressed the jealousy rooted in her heart!","Forget it, just let that little slut be more complacent for a little while more. Anyway she was going to be a dead corpse very soon and she absolutely could not leave this mystic region!","Eldest Senior Brother... he was going to be hers, Murong Fei’s eventually!","Murong Fei spoke against her own feelings, “Experience learning is experience learning, raising our own potential is more important than anything else! In this mystic region, real chances cannot be shared with anyone else, so it’s impossible for top exponents to group up with anyone! Stop thinking too much and be off! I am leaving as well!”","Murong Ni’s eyes widened, “Sister, you.... even you are not going to bring me? Then I... what should I do?”","She had not expected Murong Fei to actually disregard their sisterly relationship, leaving her in the lurch over here?","Murong Fei said, “This is experience learning and not a scenic tour trip! If you’re really afraid then just stay here and wait to leave the mystic region after one month! I think it’s pretty safe over here!”","She couldn’t hold herself back from wanting to harm Huang Yueli now so why would she even be bothered with her sister?"]},{"number":1424,"title":"Chapter 1424 - Here for a spring outing (7)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Elder Sister, wait, wait for me!”","Murong Ni kept shouting behind Murong Fei’s back.","Murong Fei pretended not to hear as she turned around to leave.","...","After Huang Yueli and Li Moying left, they could still hear the sister’s arguments faintly.","Huang Yueli’s brows rose as she stared at the man beside her.","Li Moying was stared at by her when he suddenly felt a chill running down his spine while asking hurriedly, “Li’er, what do you want to say?”","Huang Yeuli questioned him beamingly, “I’d not expected that you really ignored Murong Ni? I thought that.....”","“Thought what? Thought I would bring her along? Why would I want to bring along an irritating fellow?” Li Moying frowned.","Huang Yueli replied, “Because your Master specially instructed that you must take good care of your Junior Sisters so... I thought you probably wouldn’t reject her.”","Li Moying suddenly thought of something as he lowered his head and met that bright big eyes with its black and white part clearly segregated.","The young lady by his side suddenly kept blinking while bearing an innocent expression, but was unable to conceal the joy hidden inside her eyes.","Li Moying shook his head while laughing, “You ah.... Really a little vinegar jar! If you’re really afraid that I’d bring her along, just directly chase her away. Why didn’t you get worked up earlier and only start to tease me now?”","Huang Yueli pouted her lips as she mumbled, “I don’t even know what you’re thinking of isn’t it? She is after all your Junior Sister and your Master’s biological daughter. If you long wanted to bring her along, how would I dare to go against you...”","Li Moying saw her pampered and arrogant look as he couldn’t help finding it comical.","He locked her waist and brought her into his embrace, while leaning near to her ear as he gave a low laugh, “Have you even considered the fact that Murong Ni had once tried to assassinate you when your ability was still very weak. Although you’ve become strong enough now and not afraid of her taking any underhanded methods, how could I possibly place someone who had once harmed you by your side? I’ve already given my Master enough face by not going to find trouble for her and yet he still expects me to take care of her? How could that even be possible?”","He stretched out his hand and brushed Huang Yueli’s hair strands gently, “Rest assured, no matter when I will take your thoughts as first consideration and if there’s anything which made you dissatisfied, just raise your concerns on the spot. I will absolutely not tear down your stage and follow according to my wife’s thoughts to handle, alright?”","Huang Yueli’s heart immediately got lifted up as she revealed a smile.","But when she met Li Moying’s mocking gaze, she immediately swallowed her laughter as she resumed the pampered look.","“Can do that barely! But I’m not your wife so don’t you go saying I’m your wife!” She put on a solemn expression as she said that.","Li Moying felt that she was just too adorable as he lowered his head and wanted to kiss her.","Huang Yueli abruptly recalled the fact that they were in the mystic region now and immediately covered his lips which was leaning over.","“Don’t you come over. Brother Mo Yi and the others.... are still watching on from the sides!”","Li Moying didn’t manage to sneak a kiss successfully so he was extremely disappointed as he frowned slightly and straightened his body.","This time round he had brought ten over people along.","His Shadow Guards were all fifth stage realm and above and had all been brought along into the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region.","These people really needed to go through a good round of experience learning. Their abilities in Celestial Light Sect indeed wasn’t considered weak but when he returned to Sky Emperor City in future, this bunch’s cultivation was not enough at all.","Although he still had some subordinates in Blue Profound Sect, but fifteen years had already passed and no one knew if anything had changed so they might not be as reliable as the current Shadow Guards."]},{"number":1425,"title":"Chapter 1425 - Here for a spring outing (8)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Other than that, Luo Jiyun also followed them but the quota he used was one which Murong De had reserved for his own disciples.","For Huang Yueli’s side, the few subordinates she took in didn’t have enough ability hence she only brought along Yuan Zeyu.","Although Yuan Zeyu was only in the fourth stage realm, but he had already undergone Mo Yi’s demonic training and also practiced a few Heaven Grade Profound Skills which Huang Yueli had passed down to him. His battle power among same levelled practitioners was absolutely first rate. Even if he had to cross realms and fought against a fifth stage entry level top expert, he would not be at a disadvantage.","These people were following Huang Yueli and Li Moying at a distance far away.","Looking at their intimate exchanges, this bunch of people were long used to it as they started to look up into the sky, putting on a “I didn’t see anything” expression.","Luo Jiyun even laughed as he said, “Eldest Senior Brother, Sister-in-law, the scenery in the mystic region is not too bad eh? Ha ha.....”","The others repeated in agreement, “Yes, yes, the scenery isn’t too bad!”","Huang Yueli looked at their cover up which only made it look more conspicuous and simply wanted to vomit up blood!","Did they need to be so fake, did they really needed to be so fake??","Why don’t they just directly make themselves blind instead?","Not only was Huang Yueli furious, even Li Moying felt that it was too troublesome to have too many tails following behind them.","He opened his mouth and said, “Alright, since we’ve already entered the mystic region, you guys don’t need to follow us around and all split up to find your own experience learning chance!”","Everyone was stunned but no one made a move at all.","Mo Yi hesitated for a moment and stood out, “Master, this mystic region is filled with dangers all around and if you and Third Miss are alone.... What happens if you meet with danger? Your subordinate is worried.....”","Li Moying said disapprovingly, “If there’s really danger, am I the one who will protect you guys, or you guys protect me?”","Mo Yi and the rest were rendered speechless.","Having an abnormally powerful Master was an embarrassing thing..... he had trained so hard to overcome all the difficulties and finally completed the Shadow Guards training but in the end he discovered that he became his future Mistress’s errand boy and underling...","Li Moying continued, “This time it’s a rare chance to enter the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region. In this kind of ancient mystic region, chances are everywhere but however much you can reap from it will depend on your own fate! I brought you guys in not so that you can follow and protect me, but in the hope that you can all raise your own abilities! What I want is not underlings nor errand boys but Shadow Guards with real abilities, do you understand?”","Everyone shivered as they hurriedly responded, “Yes!”","“All of you go on your own experience learning and don’t group up together. Lone experience learning will reap the greatest chance. Jiyun you too leave on your own. You have the Sect’s aid token and if you really meet danger, just shoot out the token and I will go to save you.”","Luo Jiyun immediately replied, “Eldest Senior Brother, just rest assured and go on with lil Sister-in-law. This isn’t my first time out gaining experience so I can take care of myself!”","Li Moying waved his hand and those little tails behind them instantly dispersed. Within a few breaths of time, they had all completely disappeared without a trace.","Huang Yueli gasped with amazement as she sighed, “Young Sect Master Li, your level of conning people really make me respect you!”","Li Moying gave a soft snort as his gaze fell onto her fair delicate face.","“Why? Where did I say wrongly? My original intentions were for their own good!”","Huang Yueli blinked, “Really? I thought you despised them for being too irritating!”","“Since you know about it...”","Li Moying smiled slightly as he lowered his head and placed his lips onto hers."]},{"number":1426,"title":"Chapter 1426 - Rare Treasure appears (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Quickly look, there’s a plot of Extreme Fiery Obsidian Stone mine! Let’s hurry over, I want to collect all of it! This is an eighth tier ore, and there’s so many of it!! I want to bring everything back!!”","Huang Yueli pointed to a little mountain not too far away as she cried out in excitement and when Li Moying wasn’t paying attention, she slipped away from him as she lifted her dress hem, running off swiftly.","Li Moying chased up to her within a few steps and held her gently into his embrace, “Why did you run off so quickly? Aren’t you a little too careless! It’s not your first time entering a mystic region for experience learning. Being so careless, beware that you fall into some trap.”","Huang Yueli replied disapprovingly, “Aiya, how could that be? I’ve read about the relative introductions in ancient manuals records on this Extreme Fiery Obsidian Stone. Although the level of this mine is extremely high, but there aren’t many magical beasts hanging in wait nearby because the ore itself contains a powerful quantity of fire attributed energy and if it wasn’t ninth grade magical beasts and above, they totally couldn’t take it! Only fire attributed practitioners who have ninth grade talent are able to get close to it!”","Saying that, she pushed aside her sticky fiancé.","“Alright, I’m off to gather the ores. Relax, based on my fire attributed innate talent, gathering the Extreme Fiery Obsidian Stones is super safe so just wait here for me!”","After Huang Yueli completed what she had to say, she didn’t even took another look at Li Moying as she sped off impatiently towards the ore mine.","In her eyes, there was no longer the existence of a fiancé as her entire heart and eyes were filled with her beloved armament refining materials.","Li Moying’s expression instantly went stiff as his lips twitched, feeling both melancholic and helpless.","Practically fifteen years had passed by but her Li’er was still exactly the same as in her past life!","For a little armament refining material, she could totally ignore a glamourous handsome male, which directly gave a psychological blow to a man’s confidence!","Wasn’t it just some pieces of broken stones? Would flowers even grow out from it? It actually made his fiancée shift her affections away from him?","Li Moying gazed at the ore mine as though he was looking at a living ‘third party’!","He was melancholic for a while but very unfortunately, Huang Yueli had totally sprawled herself on the ore mine, starting to dig out pieces and pieces of ore stone, totally not free to notice him.","Li Moying could only chase up to her swiftly as he proactively leaned in close to his fiancée to fawn upon her.","“Li’er, let me help you! How do I get this ore stone out? Directly knock the entire piece off?”","Huang Yueli was dumbstruck for a moment, apparently not expecting that he would appear at this place.","“You... wait, why are you here?”","Li Moying saw that she finally was willing to look at him straight in his eyes as he couldn’t help but gave a smile, “Why can’t I be here?”","Huang Yueli frowned, “Haven’t I said this earlier? The ancient records mentioned that only ninth grade fire attributed innate talent practitioners could get close to the Extreme Fiery Obsidian Stone mine. Could there be a recording error in the ancient records?”","Li Moying’s lips curled slightly, “The ancient records didn’t record it wrongly.”","“Then how did you.....” Huang Yueli was stunned as she swiftly regained her senses, “Wait, don’t tell me you also have ninth grade fire attributed innate talent!”","Li Moying gave a soft laugh, “Why? You are a complete attribute ninth grade talent so why isn’t it possible that I have ninth grade fire attributed innate talent?”","“But, but....” Huang Yueli’s eyes grew wide.","Li Moying didn’t say anything wrong. The talents under the heavens were not just confined to her and Li Moying’s innate talent was so abnormal, so whatever happened was considered as normal..."]},{"number":1427,"title":"Chapter 1427 - Rare Treasure appears (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, she still found it strange!","“But I have a Flame Spirit Physique, rumoured to be a rare innate talent physique in God Realm so that was why I have a complete attribute ninth grade innate talent. Then you.... could it also be another kind of Spirit Physique?”","Huang Yuelu kept thinking and found this to be the most possible case as she pursued it in curiosity.","Her sudden large eyes were bright and crystal clear, as she stared intently at Li Moying, making that man’s heart swayed.","However, he shrugged his shoulders, “I don’t know!”","“Don’t know??”","Li Moying replied, “I’m not like you, after your rebirth you adopted an ancient spiritual beast as a spiritual beast and even obtained God Realm’s cultivation method. After I woke up, I had no memories from my past life and was totally clueless about my own innate talent. I only know that ever since my Master brought me back to Celestial Light Sect, my cultivation speed has always been extraordinarily fast, even faster than in my past life! Moreover I could acquire whatever attribute Profound Skills easily, but I still prefer thunder attributed cultivation methods.”","Huang Yueli was dumbstruck, “So you are majoring in thunder attributed cultivation methods now purely because of the influence from your past life, liking the thunder attribute the most?”","Li Moying replied, “You can put it in that way...”","Huang Yeuli stared at him for half a day before spitting out the words, “Abnormal pervert!”","She thought that her own innate talent was already ridiculous enough and had not expected that her own fiancé would actually be even more ridiculous than her by ten thousand times!","In this way, his complete attribute innate talent was likely much higher than ninth grade?","Was this possible? Was it something which humans could possibly derive at?","Just as Huang Yueli was in a daze, she suddenly sensed a burst of scorching breath nearing her.","Li Moying leaned in and secretly kissed her. Discovering her still shocked expression, he was feeling rather delighted in his heart.","This was the first time his Li’er had actually forgot totally about the armament refining materials and just used all her might to stare at him, displaying an extreme admiration expression towards him.","He had met tons of women who admired him but only Huang Yueli’s faze made him felt so complacent.","“I know you like a pervert like me but didn’t you say you wanted to gather these ores? Still not going to grab hold of time tightly? In another four hours or lesser, the sky is going to turn dark.”","Hearing Li Moying words, Huang Yueli abruptly realised, “Ahhhh, I actually forgot my ore stones!”","She turned her head backwards as she immodestly told Li Moying, “Since you are not repelled by it, then don’t be lazy and come over to help! See those faint white patterns on those black obsidian stones? It looks unclear but against the sunlight, you can see the silver strands. Follow those patterns and inject fire attributed Profound Energy and the ore will be separated and dropped down. Then place all the pieces into your space! That’ll do! Quick, you’re not allowed to be lazy!”","After she finished instructing him, she totally ignored Li Moying and continued to busy herself with digging ores.","Li Moying followed behind her without any complaints despite the hardships and criticism as he helped her dig the entire hill empty.","After they finished digging the ores, Huang Yueli finally left in satisfaction.","But halfway on their route, she suddenly appeared slightly disappointed.","“This time we have gained quite a bit... this Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region seemed a little too safe and a little too quiet! Not only are there not many dangers, there aren’t many chances as well. Other than the picturesque scenery, it didn’t seem as though there’s any special points.... Hadn’t Green Cloud Sect’s people said that this was a mystic region which was passed down from several thousand years ago? Could they be lying to us?”"]},{"number":1428,"title":"Chapter 1428 - Rare Treasure appears (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1428: Rare Treasure appears (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If these words of hers fell onto those disciples who had entered the mystic region, they would absolutely throw up blood on the spot!","Because Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already collected many treasures on their way.","For example the Extreme Fiery Obsidian Stone mine, that was priceless and just one small piece of ore in Sky Emperor City’s auctions would be auctioned at an astonishing heavenly price!","Whereas this kind of ore mine, Huang Yueli had already dug several of it in the past few days.","To ordinary disciples, even if they picked up a piece of eighth grade ore was already considered as a huge chance!","Li Moying on the other hand had smoothly killed several eighth grade magical beasts and removed its magical beast core. He also passed the assessment at another underground palace which the forefathers had left behind, obtaining an entire set of heaven grade upper level cultivation methods.","Just casually walking around was a huge chance.","But eighth grade magical beasts to ordinary disciples were absolutely a life and death huge crisis! There was a ninety nine percent chance that they would lose their lives if they met with it!","In the end, in Huang Yueli’s words, it was “both safe and no chances around”.","However, Li Moying understood what she was thinking, “That’s right, this place is indeed a little too quiet. Perhaps it is because we had been travelling around the outer boundary. The real chances in the mystic regions are usually in the centre. Only, are you sure that you want us to proceed to the centre region?”","Huang Yueli hesitated for a moment, ” We can get a little closer towards the centre but not really enter it. After all, our abilities this time round aren’t really adequate...”","She was a little unreconciled but she had no choice but to consider the practicability of the problem.","In the past when she and Mu Chengying entered mystic regions, both of them were both at ninth stage realm cultivations and their potentials were simply tyrannical so naturally they had nothing to fear.","But this time, they were just at seventh stage realm and fifth stage realm. The disparity in their abilities was indeed a little too large and if they just ran in abruptly, it wasn’t just a risk, it was to send themselves to death.","The both of them were conversing when they suddenly heard a burst of thunder like loud sound in the sky.","At the same time, far away in the mountains, a bolt of blinding bright light shone, lighting up the entire sky until it turned as bright as daylight!","That bolt of strong light lasted briefly and after a few breaths, it started to dim.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, “Quickly look over there! This kind of abnormality, a rare treasure must be appearing! Let’s go over quickly to take a look!”","Li Moying nodded as he chased up to her.","Their footsteps were rather fast but there was no way to use transportation tools such as flying ships to replace their legs and as they were very far away from the location where the bright light shone, they practically had to travel at least half of the mystic region. Hence although they tried their best to rush over, they also spent roughly one and a half days’ time.","By the time the both of them had reached the anticipated location, they saw quite a number of people who had gathered nearby.","Other than a few minority, a large portion of Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect’s disciples had already appeared at the ground level of the mountain.","Everyone were disciples of a large Sect so they had more or less heard of the strange occurrences which might appear when a rare treasure appeared. From the strange occurrences that had happened, their first reaction was — there’s a huge chance!","Hence everyone rushed over to this place and those who couldn’t come were either trapped somewhere or they were just too far away so they hadn’t arrived.","As the ground level of the mountain was very near the entrance of the mystic region, many of them had been lingering nearby, not daring to travel further away hence they had all reached pretty early.","After they arrived, they saw the ground level filled with people, and very naturally, they segregated into two groups according to their Sects."]},{"number":1429,"title":"Chapter 1429 - Rare Treasure appears (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1429: Rare Treasure appears (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","By the time Huang Yueli and Li Moying arrived, both Sects had been in a stalemate for quite a period of time.","They already heard the argument coming from the ground level when they were still quite a distance away.","“This cave dwelling is obviously discovered by our Celestial Light Sect disciples so what right do you Green Cloud Sect have to stick a pole into, thinking of snatching the treasure?” Luo Jiyun’s voice was heard.","Immediately following that, Fang Shaoning’s cold laughter was heard.","“What a joke! You had indeed discovered the cave dwelling but have you successfully entered it? Have you gotten the rare treasure in it? All the treasures in this Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region don’t belong to anyone so the one with the most ability gets it! You don’t have the ability and can’t enter and yet you’re not allowing others to enter?”","Luo Jiyun was obviously upset by that, “For you to know that there’s a treasure here is all because our people had activated the array on the outer boundary isn’t it? If not for this, there wouldn’t be that blinding strong light at all!”","“So what about it? You guys can’t enter and activated the array which could only mean that you’re all useless! Since you don’t have the ability then stop wasting time! Scram to one side and don’t make us deal with you!”","Fang Shaoning was totally immodest as he spoke.","Originally when they were outside the mystic region, although the two Sects were having a competing relationship, but due to reputation, they couldn’t openly provoke the other party nor attack them.","But now that they were in the mystic region, there were no outsiders around while the temptation of the rare treasure was placed right in front of them.","This round, both Sects had completely tore their faces as they prepared to let their fists do the talking!","Luo Jiyun also realised that talking reason was useless as he was so angry that he started trembling, “You all.... simply bullying others intolerably!”","Fang Shaoning gave a chilly smile, “Mister Luo, you’re not young anymore so how could you so be naïve? Whoever’s ability is stronger will obtain more resources, this is originally Soaring Heavens Continent’s survival rule! We are bullying intolerably? It’s obvious that Celestial Light Sect has more people but unfortunately your potential is so weak. If I were you, I would not have the face to stay on any further! Quickly scram!”","Hearing such intense arguing, Huang Yueli turned her head in astonishment as she exchanged glances with Li Moying and the both of them quickly hastened up their footsteps.","When they got nearer, they discovered that the scene had evidently just turned into a battle ground.","Green Cloud Sect’s people were much lesser while Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were much more. However, the majority of those who were laid on the ground with serious injury and not being able to get up were mostly Celestial Light Sect’s disciples.","Even Luo Jiyun sustained a heavy injury as the blood on the wounds on his body kept flowing.","It was obvious that even though Green Cloud Sect’s numbers were lesser, but their overall combat abilities were much higher than Celestial Light Sect’s.","Green Cloud Sect’s total combat ability was on a higher rung and included the fact that the two Sect’s top battle powers were not present.","On Green Cloud Sect’s side, other than Leng Yi Feng alone, the other top experts in their Sect were all present.","But Celestial Light Sect was short of quite a number of people. Li Moying, Huang Yeuli, Murong Fei, Li Lingchuan were all not present. Even Mo Yi, Mo Er and the rest had not arrived in time so there was only Luo Jiyun alone who pitifully tried to hold up the scenario, so he totally couldn’t hang on for long.","Luo Jiyun was ridiculed by Fang Shaoning so much that even his nose turned crooked!","The problem was he couldn’t find any words to rebuke at all!","Because what Fang Shaoning said was the truth.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were at least double of Green Cloud Sect’s but in the earlier intense battle, Celestial Light Sect was totally not their match as they were beaten pants down."]},{"number":1430,"title":"Chapter 1430 - Rare Treasure appears (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1430: Rare Treasure appears (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Celestial Light Sect was short of top levelled talented practitioners and no matter how many ordinary disciples they had, it was of no use.","But if they wanted to make Luo Jiyun leave like that, he wouldn’t feel resigned at all!","This cave dwelling was discovered by him and a few other Celestial Light Sect’s disciples. In order to enter it, they tried various methods and in the end they accidentally triggered the mechanism hence attracting so many people.","They had already wasted four to five days time here and was just one step away from success but now someone else had stuck their leg in to pick up the advantages! How would they feel reconciled?","Luo Jiyun clenched his teeth as he stared at Fang Shaoning, “You... Fang Shaoning, don’t be too complacent for now! Earlier that burst of bright light was earth shattering so it’s not possible that only you guys saw it. The top experts in our Sect are definitely on their way here. If Eldest Senior Brother appears, he will definitely not let you off!”","Fang Shaoning heard what he said and couldn’t help but start bursting out in laughter.","“Hahaha, Luo Jiyun, your joke is very funny! Young Sect Master Li’s ability is indeed strong enough but he hasn’t reached yet so he must be trapped somewhere. This Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region is so big so who knows what could have happened? Moreover speaking, by the time he arrives, I’d have gotten the treasure in the cave dwelling so where would he go to find me?”","Green Cloud Sect’s other disciples all started laughing.","“Isn’t that so? This bunch of Celestial Light Sect trash only knows how to rely on Li Moying alone! Leaving Li Moying, they’re no different from a homeless dog!”","“Unfortunately this is the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, not Celestial Light Sect! Would Li Moying be able to rush over to save your life?”","“Rather than waiting for Li Moying to arrive, why not you guys kowtow to us now. Perhaps we might even leave those treasures left over for you!”","Fang Shaoning said, “Alright, stop the nagging. If you’re not going to leave, then I’d really not maintain this politeness anymore!”","Luo Jiyun clenched his teeth tightly but in the end he was still prepared to leave.","He himself wasn’t afraid of a life and death struggle but so many of his comrades were seriously injured so he simply couldn’t disregard their life and death.","Just as Luo Jiyun was about to turn around and leave, he suddenly saw from the corner of his eye, in the frontal right direction of the forest, two figures walked out slowly.","His eyes immediately widened with astonishment as he froze there and then.","“Why are you not leaving? Need us to send you off?” Fang Shaoning totally didn’t detect anything amiss.","Luo Jiyun suddenly gave a cry of surprise as he shouted out, “Eldest Senior Brother! Sister-in-law! You’re finally here!”","For him to see their timely appearance now, Luo Jiyun was simply so touched that he was going to cry.","Fang Shaoning and the rest had their backs facing Li Moying originally so they didn’t notice his existence.","But on hearing Luo Jiyun’s screech, everyone’s faces started to reveal a shocked and fearful expression!","As the saying went, a man’s name, a tree’s shadow.","They had not even seen a fragment of Li Moying’s shadow and just from hearing his name, they were all so scared that their sweat started trickling down.","“You... don’t even think of scaring me! How could Li Moying suddenly appear out of nowhere so coincidentally?”","Fang Shaoning thought something was amiss and immediately calmed himself down, ascertaining that it must be Luo Jiyun’s scheme to get out of this difficult situation.","However, the last note of his sentence had just fallen when a familiar mellow man’s voice rang from behind his back.","“How do you know that it is not possible for this Lord to appear here?”","That biting cold, mighty, unexcelled voice sounded so familiar that no one would ever get it wrong.","Green Cloud Sect’s disciples all abruptly had a change of colours as their complexions turned extremely pale in an instant!"]},{"number":1431,"title":"Chapter 1431 - Rare Treasure appears (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1431: Rare Treasure appears (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Earlier when they ridiculed Luo Jiyun, all of them were extremely arrogant as though they weren’t afraid of Li Moying appearing.","But now that they saw Li Moying appear, all of them felt extremely terrified!","Because everyone present had witnessed with their own eyes how powerful Li Moying was. They knew that even if all of Green Cloud Sect’s people present were to combine their forces together, it might not even be enough to give him a smack!","Only Leng Yi Feng was able to receive two or three moves from Li Moying but unfortunately he wasn’t around.","Furthermore, Li Moying was cold blooded and overbearing by nature so if they were to offend him, no matter what method they used, there was absolutely no way that he would show mercy on them!","Li Moying and Huang Yueli walked side by side out of the forest.","A pair of good looking couple intimately walked over. In terms of looks, they were almost perfect which was an eye candy.","But to the Green Cloud Sect, they didn’t even have the courage to look at them straight in the eye as all of them lowered their heads, wishing that a large hole suddenly appeared on the ground, letting them all hide inside!","To let Li Moying witness how they bullied and suppressed his Junior Brother, what was the consequence of this... it really made one don’t dare to think further!","But when Celestial Light Sect’s disciples saw the both of them, they all started cheering!","“Young Sect Master, Young Sect Master is finally here!”","“Great, we are finally saved!”","“Look at those people from Green Cloud Sect, aren’t they too comical? Earlier weren’t they acting stuck up? Didn’t they ask us to scram? Now that Young Sect Master is here, let’s see who it is that will scram!”","“That’s right, dare to call us trash! In Young Sect Master’s eyes, aren’t you all trash too?”","Hearing Celestial Light Sect’s disciples’ ridicules, Green Cloud Sect’s people totally didn’t dare to rebuke.","Not that they didn’t want to, but because..... Li Moying was right here!","Even though he hadn’t made a move or even used a little bit of his Profound Energy, but just at the moment when he spoke out, the situation had completely reversed.","Li Moying’s frigid gaze shot towards Fang Shaoning, “Mister Fang, how have you been? Just a month ago you were having a battle with my fiancée on the arena stage which made me had a deep impression of you. I’d not expected that I’d meet you so quickly in the mystic region?”","Fang Shaoning was originally still trying his best to stay strong as he stood straight upright. But on hearing his words, his knees went weak as he almost knelt down!","Li Moying’s meaning was very obvious, he wanted to settle the debt of almost seriously injuring Huang Yueli on that day!","Only, before he was able to settle old debts, he had once again fallen into Li Moying’s hands.....","“Li.... Young Sect Master Li...I... I didn’t intentionally.... You should know that on the arena stage, everyone is acting on the Sect’s benefits. I had not realised the severity of my moves and as I was overly agitated during the tournament, I was in a daze. I can apologize to Miss Bai...”","Saying that, Fang Shaoning shot up like an arrow towards Huang Yueli and with his hands clasped into a fist, he bowed towards her.","“Miss Bai, I’m wrong. I had dealt with a heavy hand by mistake on the arena stage so if there’s any places which I had offended you, I seek your understanding for that.”","He bent his waist low, as he showed his attitude, waiting for Huang Yueli to accept his apology.","From what Fang Shaoning thought, battle between practitioners was bound to result in slight injuries. He had already apologised on his own, so if Huang Yueli refused to accept, that would be something unacceptable.","Whoever knew, his apology was already out but Huang Yueli didn’t make a sound nor any response.","In this way, Fang Shaoning was instantly embarrassed.","Because he didn’t receive Huang Yueli’s acknowledgement, so he couldn’t stand up straight, otherwise what kind of apology was that counted as?"]},{"number":1432,"title":"Chapter 1432 - Rare Treasure appears (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1432: Rare Treasure appears (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But maintaining this posture of bending the waist, even for high levelled practitioners, it was an extremely tough matter.","Besides that the ache was secondary, to be left in the cold by someone like that in such a humiliating posture, it was absolutely leaving his face onto the ground for them to step on!","Fang Shaoning only felt a fiery sensation on his face as he almost burned up.","But now that matters had come to such a pass, under Li Moying’s frigid cold stare, he didn’t dare to stand up straight nor did he dare to turn tables with Huang Yueli.","A quarter of an hour went by and Huang Yueli still didn’t make any sound to accept his apology.","By now, Celestial Light Sect’s disciples had all started laughing.","“Great job Junior Sister Bai! Show him some colours!”","“That’s right. The last time at the arena stage, he obviously had the intention to kill you, what’s called accidentally mishandled? Why don’t you go lie to a ghost!”","“Correct, if apologizing is of use, then what’s the use of having constables around?”","Fang Shaoning was so angry that his chest started to hurt, and a slight taste of blood could be tasted in his mouth.","Huang Yueli waited for a while more before she opened her mouth indifferently, “Master Fang, why so modest? I hadn’t put the matter regarding the arena stage in my heart so you need not specially apologize for it.”","Fang Shaoning was simply going to faint from anger.","Didn’t put it in her heart? Then still left him in the cold like that?","This was simply having it both ways!","However before he opened his mouth, Huang Yueli continued, “But my own matters, I can forget about it. However you had defamed our Celestial Light Sect and even injured so many Celestial Light Sect’s disciples, this matter cannot be let off easily like that!”","Fang Shaoning clenched his teeth, “Then... Miss Bai, what do you want me to do?”","Huang Yueli laughed, “I’ve always been magnanimous and won’t force my requests on anyone. If you’re really regretful, then apologizing to all those poor disciples whom you had injured earlier will do. Earlier when you apologized to me, your attitude was rather earnest so you must use the same kind of attitude towards them. I believe that they will forgive you!”","Huang Yueli was beaming and her tone was gentle, the words which she spoke out were courteous and polite without any fiery power to it, neither did it consist of any sense which made things difficult for him.","But every single one of those present understood the meaning in her words. All of them were trembling in fear, secretly thinking that this method of hers was just too vicious!","Fang Shaoning saw black and almost fainted.","Actually, to apologize to Huang Yueli, although he did feel humiliated, but it was still acceptable. After all, Huang Yueli had once defeated him directly on the arena stage, which meant that her innate talent and ability was far above his!","To bow one’s head low towards the strong wasn’t an embarrassing thing.","But what Huang Yueli wanted now was for him to apologize to those ordinary disciples who were injured by him?","What kind of joke was that. These people were all defeated by him and couldn’t even take on one move from him. What right did these trash had to deserve his apology? Towards these kind of lowly trashy people, it was a waste of effort to even beat them up and there was no reason for the strong to apologize to the weak!","Moreover, Huang Yueli requested for his attitude to be as earnest as earlier.","How to be earnest? Surely he needed to be left in the cold by so much trash? And to bend his waist and lower his head towards these trash?","This was even more unbearable than taking his life!","Fang Shaoning simply couldn’t endure it any further, “Miss Bai, please don’t bully others intolerably! To fight over treasures in mystic regions had always been based on one’s own ability! This is the rule in Soaring Heavens Continent! Who can they blame when their abilities are so weak?”"]},{"number":1433,"title":"Chapter 1433 - Rare Treasure appears (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1433: Rare Treasure appears (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli heard that, she shot a glance at him and her lips curled up slightly.","“You’re talking to me about rules? Since that’s the case, then let’s handle this according to Soaring Heavens Continent’s rules!” She paused and continued, “Master Fang should know what is the general outcome for the party who is on the losing end of fighting for treasure in mystic regions right?”","When Fang Shaoning heard that, he suddenly thought of something as his face turned pale.","“You.... you’re not thinking of...”","Huang Yueli smiled as she continued, “You’re the one who said to handle this according to rules.”","Quite a number of Green Cloud Sect’s disciples all understood the meaning in her words as their complexions turned even paler.","But Luo Jiyun was totally puzzled, “Lil Sister-in-law, what do you mean by that? What’s the outcome for those who failed in fighting for the treasure?”","Huang Yueli smiled, “What else? In order to prevent those people who failed from intentionally leaking out news of the treasure, eliminating them is the entire Soaring Heaven Continent’s common way! For someone like him who dares to make impertinent remarks, just burying him alive in a pit is considered as showing mercy!”","Fang Shaoning abruptly had a change of colours, “Bai Ruoli, you.... don’t even think just threatening me like that and I’d be afraid! Do you have the guts to do so? We have so many people here and they’re all Green Cloud Sect’s disciples! Can you kill us all? Aren’t you afraid that when the matter is exposed, our Sect Master would blame you for it?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, “But, if you’re all dead, how would the matter be exposed?”","“But there are so many of us, how could you possibly...”","Fang Shaoning’s words were by his mouth when he suddenly saw the cold faced Li Moying behind Huang Yueli as he immediately shuddered, not daring to speak any further!","Huang Yueli indeed couldn’t possibly kill them all, but.... Li Moying indeed had this ability to do so!","Moreover, he had always been fearless, resolute in his massacres! If he were really to eliminate them all, he would absolutely be efficient in not leaving any person alive!","Li Moying gave a cold humpf as he slowly walked towards Huang Yueli and opened his mouth, “Do according to what Miss Bai said, otherwise...”","His voice was very soft but when it fell onto Green Cloud Sect’s peoples’ ears, it sounded like a demon’s voice from hades.","Especially when he spoke, his surrounding might was also unleashed at the same time and in an instance, an intense suppressing feeling caused everyone present to be unable to breath as their legs went weak. Those practitioners with weaker cultivations instantly couched onto the ground, not able to climb up at all!","Fang Shaoning was appalled as he didn’t dare to say anything more.","He immediately walked to the front of Luo Jiyun as he suddenly bowed, clenching his teeth as he said, “Master Luo, I’ve offended you earlier so please be magnanimous to forgive me.”","Luo Jiyun took a good look at Fang Shaoning who had acted as though he was on a world above others earlier on and now how the tables have turned to suddenly bow humbly before him and seek his forgiveness. His mood was suddenly lifted as the humiliation and embarrassment which he felt earlier instantly disappeared into thin air!","“Fang Shaoning, aren’t you extremely complacent earlier? Did you think that my Eldest Senior Brother was not able to reach here in time?”","Fang Shaoning’s anger~ if he knew earlier that Li Moying was on his way here, he would have applied oil to his feet as he slipped away quickly, so how could it be possible that he still remained here?","But now, nothing he said mattered anymore!","“Yes, it’s all my fault! I’d like to ask Master Luo for your understanding!” Fang Shaoning almost crunched his teeth.","Luo Jiyun then waved his hand, “Forget it, next time just remember to use your brain before you talk because not everyone is as easy going as me.”","After Fang Shaoning was taunted for a moment, he felt extremely stuffed.","But he had no choice but to reply, “Thank you Master Luo!”"]},{"number":1434,"title":"Chapter 1434 - Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1434: Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When this sentence was spilled out, Fang Shaoning felt that he was especially wretched!","Other people slapped his face and he still thanked them for it!","This, to a naturally arrogant talented practitioner was a huge humiliation!","However, things had not come to an end. Luo Jiyun was just the beginning. Moreover, Luo Jiyun’s character was kind and he did not intentionally make things difficult for him. It was those other direct disciples from Celestial Light Sect who were the toughest to handle as many of them were meaner in their words than Luo Jiyun.","If it was usual times, Fang Shaoning would have exploded from anger long ago and would absolutely tear these insolent things to shreds.","But now with Li Moying and Huang Yueli around, he could only swallow his anger in silence!","The only comfort was after Huang Yueli took a look around, she suddenly opened her mouth, “Why is Master Fang the only one apologizing? It seems that he is not the only one who beat them up right? Looks like some people prefer to be buried alive?”","Green Cloud Sect’s other disciples originally thought of hook winking them as they kept their heads low, not even daring to breathe loudly.","In the end, they had not thought that Huang Yueli actually didn’t forget about them.","Helplessly, the other disciples could only follow Fang Shaoning to line up and apologize to the others.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were extremely excited!","Indeed, following Young Sect Master around was different. No matter which peerless talent was present, as long as the Young Sect Master was around, they only had the fate of bending down! He was really the peerless genius in the South Sky Region!","Momentarily, many of them started to envy Mo Yi and the rest. No wonder they were practitioners with such cultivations but were willing to follow Li Moying around to be his Shadow Guards. Following this kind of Master was simply too shiok!","Some of them even started to have thoughts that if they had the chance to follow Young Sect Master around, it’d be great!","If they didn’t follow Young Sect Master, following Miss Bai was not a bad idea as well!","The fluctuating sounds of apologies did not consolidate Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s thoughts on these people.","Huang Yueli’s gaze had always been on the entrance of the cave dwelling as she frowned slightly before she started to ponder deeply.","This was a lavish and spacious cave dwelling. Just the residence door itself was ten meters tall, five to six meters wide, looking very stylish.","Whereas on the top most area of the door hung an inscribed board with some illegible words on it.","“Wu Ding.... Looks like the religious name of the owner of this cave dwelling should be Wu Ding.” Huang Yueli took a long look at it before she could tell what the words were.","This kind of early historical words left behind in the ancient times were only recognised by those practitioners who had broad knowledge.","Li Moying hooked her waist as he brought her into his embrace asking in a mellow voice, “How is it? Can you tell anything from this? How should we enter from here?”","In terms of battle to awe the entire scene, naturally Li Moying had the greatest ability but when it came to opening the mechanisms of cave dwellings, his Li’er was a professional at it.","Huang Yueli muttered softly, “This sage Wu Ding should be someone with an extremely powerful existence in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The mechanisms that he set up around the cave dwelling are almost all eighth grade and above! Even in ancient times, the armament masters who could set up eighth grade mechanisms were not commonly found. Furthermore, in the outer boundary of this cave dwelling is an extremely strong protection array.....”","Li Moying smiled as he said, “It sounds like it’s very difficult to manage but my Li’er will definitely have a way, right?”"]},{"number":1435,"title":"Chapter 1435 - Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1435: Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli raised her chin coquettishly, “This.....”","She wanted to say something when she suddenly heard a shuffle of hurried footsteps.","Immediately following that, a man’s voice rang,”Stop, all of you stop! What are you doing? Fang Shaoning, you actually bow to these Celestial Light Sect’s trash? Green Cloud Sect’s face has all been thrown away by you!”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged glances as they turned back together.","Leng Yi Feng came travel-worn as he walked out of the forest in quick steps, grabbing onto Fang Shaoning’s elbow.","“What are you doing! The few of you, stop immediately!”","Fang Shaoning stopped his bowing actions when he saw Leng Yi Feng’s appearance but his face still bore a terrified and tensed expression.","“Eldest Senior Brother, that... Young Sect Master Li.....”","“What? Li Moying??”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already walked towards the cave dwelling and were standing at a blind spot and only under Fang Shaoning’s pointing out did he finally see them.","Li Moying gave a cold humpf as he said, “Mister Leng, my apologies, you’ve arrived too late! This cave dwelling belongs to the Celestial Light Sect already.”","Leng Yi Feng was so furious that he could only clench his teeth. When he saw the bright light, he knew that a rare treasure was going to appear so he didn’t bother about the plan to scheme on Li Moying as he rushed over at the first moment.","But too bad he was still too late. Li Moying had snatched it first!","With Li Moying around, things were so evident and he didn’t possibly have the chance to pick up any advantages!","Leng Yi Feng wasn’t resigned to leave and on turning his head back, he saw a lot of his Junior brothers and junior sisters with ashen faces as he asked loudly, “Young Sect Master Li, you’re wrong in saying that! There’s not only Celestial Light Sect’s people here, there are plenty of Green Cloud Sect’s disciple’s here too! As the saying goes, those who see it have a part. So we should have a share in the treasures in the cave dwelling as well!”","Fang Shaoning and the rest originally didn’t have any more hopes with regards to the treasures but in the end when Leng Yi Feng finally arrived, they started to have some hopes again.","Leng Yi Feng’s ability wasn’t Li Moying’s match but as his status was special, Li Moying wouldn’t kill someone from the Leng family right?","Perhaps he might even give Leng Yi Feng some face, distributing some over to Green Cloud Sect!","Fang Shaoning was the first to react, “Eldest Senior Brother, we are just too pitiful! Earlier we had a chance to enter the cave dwelling but in the end when Young Sect Master Li brought his fiancée along, he immediately chased us away and forced us to bow and apologize!”","His words were obviously toppling black into white, hinting that Li Moying wanted to snatch the treasures in the cave dwelling.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples immediately disagreed as they all started hooting.","“Fang Shaoning, you’re too shameless! This cave dwelling was obviously discovered by us first and the ones who wanted to snatch the treasures are you guys! If it wasn’t for Young Sect Master who had arrived on time, we would have really been plundered by your gang of robbers! How dare you fabricate such stories?”","“That’s right, who’s forcing who? Even if you were forced to apologize, it was because you deserved it!”","Of course Leng Yi Feng knew that Fang Shaoning’s words had a problem but he continued along with his flow.","“Young Sect Master Li, you’ve also heard this. Celestial Light Sect to have done this... isn’t it a little too dishonourable!”","Li Moying replied coldly, “Since we’re already here in the mystic region, what’s the talk about being honourable or not? Leng Yi Feng, surely you’re not such a naïve person right?”"]},{"number":1436,"title":"Chapter 1436 - Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Leng Yi Feng said, “Our two sects had always been in a cooperative relationship and we’re different from the other powerhouses’ relationship where they have open and hidden battles! With rare treasures, should we mutually discuss the distribution of it? You wanting to hold it all for yourself, what’s the difference between snatching over it?”","“Indeed, there’s no difference.”","Leng Yi Feng had not imagined that Li Moying would readily admit to it so he was stunned for a moment.","However, immediately following that, Li Moying said icily, “What can you do if I want to snatch?”","What can you do if I want to snatch??","Light fleeting words but it was sonorous.","In an instance, it made Leng Yi Feng’s face totally red as he couldn’t say a single word!","This was a real blue strong practitioner. Under absolute advantage in terms of ability, any attempts on flowery words was useless. Even if he obviously wanted to snatch and to monopolize it, who dared to say a no word?","This was just too arrogant!","But Li Moying indeed had the capital to be arrogant!","At this moment, Leng Yi Feng truly felt that although he was a direct descendant of the Leng family, and was considered as the chosen one but in front of Li Moying he was as small as a grain of sand!","Li Moying said coldly, “Bring along your Green Cloud Sect’s people and scram!”","Leng Yi Feng felt humiliated, especially in front of Huang Yueli who was the person whom he admired and to be slighted by his love rival, it made him extremely unbearable!","But Leng Yi Feng had no other choice but to self-hypnotise himself: No matter how powerful Li Moying was, how wild and arrogant he was, he could only be rampant for this short moment! After their plan succeeded, when Li Moying entered the center region, by then he’d be a dead man! Even his fiancée would be taken in by himself!","After self-hypnotising himself for a moment, Leng Yi Feng finally calmed down as he prepared to bring his men to depart.","Just at this moment, Fang Shaoning popped out by the side as he urged, “Eldest Senior Brother, we... we might not need to leave! We can still discuss this.....”","Leng Yi Feng shook his head, “Forget it, it’s impossible.”","He was the only one in Green Cloud Sect who had crossed hands with Li Moying so many times and he knew that once Li Moying decided on something, it was impossible to change his mind.","However, Fang Shaoning suddenly turned towards Li Moying as he shouted, “Young Sect Master Li, I apologize for the earlier matter that had happened but you cannot chase us away! Because without us, you can forget about entering this cave dwelling!”","Li Moying wasn’t able to reply in time but Huang Yueli had already gave a cold laugh filled with disdain.","“That’s interesting. We can’t enter this cave dwelling but you guys can?”","Fang Shaoning replied, “Miss Bai, I know you’re a certified armament master and you probably have in depth knowledge regarding mechanisms. But it’s not possible that you can’t tell that there’s not only mechanisms around the cave dwelling but also high grade array formation! You need the coordination of an array master before you can enter the cave!”","Huang Yueli’s brows rose, “Array skills? So what about that? Did you think that a mere array can stop me?”","Fang Shaoning’s face suddenly showed a meaningful smile.","“Miss Bai, did you think that you’ve brought along a talented array master along so there’s nothing to fear? Such a pity because you’re wrong! The only person who can decode the array in your Celestial Light Sect is already in our Green Cloud Sect’s team!”","Huang Yueli went into a blank, “What do you mean?”","Fang Shaoning shouted to the back, “Alright, stop hiding, you don’t have anywhere to hide now anyway!”","A figure nudged out from the tree behind shaking with fear and trepidation."]},{"number":1437,"title":"Chapter 1437 - Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Everyone’s eyes fell onto that person as the crowd started to gasp.","“Murong Ni.... Isn’t that Murong Ni? Why is she together with Green Cloud Sect’s people?”","“Strange, when did she reach this place, how come we didn’t see her earlier? Was she hiding behind the tree since earlier?”","“Surely it’s not possible right? Murong Ni is the Sect Master’s daughter!”","Hearing the fluctuating discussions, Murong Ni felt her face burning up as she was embarrassed to the max.","She had not imagined that things would have developed to such a state.","Just a few days ago, she had been left behind by Murong Fei and while she was travelling and exploring the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region alone. As her ability was really just too low, she had already met with danger several times within the same day and almost lost her life!","Luckily, Fang Shaoning, who happened to pass by, had saved her.","Fang Shaoning originally didn’t want to bother about this but the desperate Murong Ni boasted that she was South Sky Region’s most incredible array talent. She indicated that she was willing to join their team, to help Green Cloud Sect’s practitioners break through the array formations in the mystic region.","Whereas the younger generation of Green Cloud Sect was indeed lacking a talented array master. That was why Murong Ni was able to smuggle into Fang Shaoning’s team, gaining their protection.","This time, on seeing the strong light from the faraway rare treasure, the entire group of them hurried over and Murong Ni was one of them among them but she had not expected that so many of Celestial Light Sect’s people were here to get hold of the treasure as well. When the disciples from both Sects met, they started fighting for no apparent reason.","Luckily she reacted in time and hid herself otherwise if anyone saw her, she would become Celestial Light Sect’s traitor.","After that, things became more and more intense. So Murong Ni totally didn’t dare to reveal herself.","She originally thought that she could hide until the end and while no one noticed her, she could slip away quietly.","Whoever knew that Fang Shaoning, in order to gain a share of the rare treasure from Li Moying’s hands, he actually sold her off without any hesitation, forcing her to appear in front of everyone.","Murong Ni was now feeling extremely melancholic.","Huang Yueli’s gaze stopped on her face for a short moment and spoke with a non-smiling smile, “Mister Fang, you really feel that.... Murong Ni is able to help decode the array formation outside the cave dwelling? Don’t forget, this array formation is left behind during ancient times and it’s not something that ordinary people can decode.”","Fang Shaoning was brimming with confidence, “Of course, Murong Ni is a third rank Array Master. You Celestial Light people should be clearer on this than me! How rare it is to have a seventeenth year old third rank Array Master, surely I need not say more on this right? If she is unable to decode this array formation, then there would be no more hope for anyone else!”","Huang Yueli gave a cold laugh in her heart as she questioned, “How do you guys want to do it then?”","Fang Shaoning thought that she had conceded and hurriedly added, “Celestial Light Sect’s ability is stronger, no doubt about it but our side is the crucial point to opening the cave dwelling! So the rare treasures in the cave dwelling should be split up into half each for both Sects!”","Huang Yueli had not even responded when the other disciples already started crying out angrily.","“Half? You still want half? Do you know what is called shameless?”","“Young Sect Master’s one finger and he will be able to crush you all to death, you still have the cheek to split the rare treasure?”","“Isn’t that so? You guys really think you’re something?? We’re telling you, forget about it!”","Fang Shaoning didn’t have a change of expression as he said, “This is a matter of benefits so surely Young Sect Master wouldn’t not think clearly right?”"]},{"number":1438,"title":"Chapter 1438 - Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“If you’re not willing to cooperate with us, then you won’t be able to get those treasures in the cave dwelling as well then we’d all have wasted our time today! This cave dwelling obviously has some heavyweight rare treasure and if we just miss it like that, perhaps we might regret it for life! The correct choice would be for both our Sects to cooperate together.”","Leng Yi Feng gave Fang Shaoning a thumbs up glance as he spoke up for him as well, “That’s right, this is originally a reciprocity and mutual benefit matter so why does Young Sect Master need to hesitate? Of course, your abilities are much stronger so we don’t mind getting lesser. How about we split sixty-forty, how about that? We’re showing enough sincerity right?”","Li Moying looked at their delighted looks as he almost burst out laughing.","Who or what gave these two fellows that kind of self-confidence! They actually felt that they could threaten him!","How could his Li’er not match up to Murong Ni?","He had such an intelligent young fiancée, so he wouldn’t be afraid of anyone’s threat at all!","However, when Li Moying was about to open his mouth, he suddenly saw Huang Yueli casting a signal to him with her eyes.","He was stunned for a moment, not knowing what his fiancée had in mind but he still obediently shut his mouth.","Huang Yueli looked at Murong Ni, “Murong Ni, you’re Celestial Light Sect’s disciple and Sect Master Murong’s beloved daughter! You really want to stand on Green Cloud Sect’s and betray your own Sect? You have to think through this clearly!”","As expected, Murong Ni started to reveal a hesitant and struggling look as she frowned, “I...”","Fang Shaoning saw that and immediately spoke out loudly, “Murong Ni, have you forgotten what you told me earlier? You said no one in Celestial Light Sect cares about you and as long as I am willing to help you, you can help me in anything! Furthermore you promised that you will follow me back to Green Cloud Sect, are you regretting it now?”","Murong Ni hesitated and didn’t say a single word.","Fang Shaoning spoke out again, “You think that it’s a good thing if you return to Celestial Light Sect now? Originally Li Moying and Murong Fei didn’t want to bring you along for experience learning and now that the others have ascertained that you’re Celestial Light Sect’s traitor, even if you return, no one will treat you nicely! Perhaps you might not even survive to leave the mystic region alive!”","“But it’s different if you follow me. So don’t do anything which you will regret!”","Murong Ni clenched her teeth as she said, “I.... of course I will stand by Master Fang’s side! Bai Ruoli, stop trying to play the part of a good person! If it wasn’t for you who dominated Eldest Senior Brother, not allowing him to take care of me, how would I possibly have come to such a state? For me to act in this way is all because of you!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but jeered, “Murong Ni, you’re really funny! Practitioners who come out on experience learning all relied on their own selves! You don’t even have the courage to go on experience learning alone, you still have the cheek to claim that you’re a practitioner?”","Murong Ni gritted her teeth, “Stop talking about those useless major principles, Eldest Senior Brother is deceived by you! Today is Celestial Light Sect suffers any losses, it’s all your fault!”","Huang Yueli’s expression turned colder by the minute, “I’ve seen shameless people but I’ve never seen anyone who is as shameless as you! Turning black into white, don’t you feel guilty at all? Moreover, did you think that... you can threaten me? A third rate array master who can’t even set up a third tier array even though looking at the array formation drawing, what gives you the self-confidence to say that?”","Murong Ni’s expression changed immediately upon hearing that!","Right now, she suddenly recalled that this young lady in front of her also knew array skills and further.... Her level of mastery in array skills seemed to be third rank and above!"]},{"number":1439,"title":"Chapter 1439 - Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1439: Celestial Light Sect’s traitor (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Just a few months ago in the Dark Moon Forest, Murong Ni had indeed witnessed Huang Yueli’s mastery in array skills.","Only thing was, recently Huang Yueli had shone too much in terms of armament refining skills and cultivation’s innate talent hence most people had forgotten that she had other areas of shocking performance.","Murong Ni’s small trickery, in front of Huang Yueli, was really not enough!","Murong Ni suddenly recalled this and instantly pressed the panic button.","That’s right, this wretched lass was so incredible so actually... they totally didn’t need her!","Murong Ni then realised that this pit was dug by Huang Yueli. She intentionally misled her into thinking that she was very important, purposely luring her to say out the words of betrayal towards Celestial Light Sect!","Now Huang Yueli’s motive had already been derived.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples looked at her as though they were looking at a disgusting cockroach and she couldn’t dismount the tiger anymore!","It was apparently too late for her now to change her words saying that she didn’t had the intention to betray Celestial Light Sect. But the minute Green Cloud Sect’s people found out that Huang Yueli’s array skills mastery was higher than hers, then she would completely become a waste at Celestial Light Sect’s side, so she definitely would not be able to get her previous position!","The more Murong Ni thought, the more frightened she got as sweat continued to drip down from her forehead.","But Fang Shaoning totally didn’t know what she was worried about as he kept sneering, “Miss Bai, your armament refining skills and cultivation innate talent is indeed very strong but you really shouldn’t go treating yourself as someone great! Array skill is also a difficult art and not any simpler than armament refining! A third rank Array Master is considered as an exceptionally outstanding talent! You have the cheek to say that she is a third rate Array Master?”","Huang Yueli’s brows rose, “Oh? Really? Then it means I’m the one who is ignorant and ill-informed and I’ve belittled Miss Murong?”","Murong Ni’s heart was palpitating wildly.","The more Fang Shaoning believed in her ability, the more frightened she was of being exposed!","Right now he had praised her to such a high level so when she fell down, her fall would be terrible!","Perhaps after Fang Shaoning realised that he was fooled by her, he might even convert his embarrassment into anger, turning around to deal with her instead!","What should she do? What should she do now? What should she say to make her not suffer from a miserable ending?","Just as Murong Ni’s heart was burning like a furnace, Huang Yueli spoke out again.","“Alright, since the few of you from Green Cloud Sect had said that.... Moying and I had done some observationS earlier and in order to open up this cave dwelling, we indeed require the participation of an Array Master, so it seems that we have no choice but to cooperate with you guys!”","Hearing her say that, Leng Yi Feng and Fang Shaoning both looked towards Li Moying.","“Young Sect Master Li, what do you say?”","Li Moying took a sideward glance at them, “Hasn’t my Li’er already said so?”","The both of them were stunned.","The both of them asked because they felt that although Huang Yueli was Li Moying’s fiancée, but in terms of ability and status, she naturally couldn’t be compared to Li Moying himself. The person who could make decisions in Celestial Light Sect was definitely Li Moying and whether to cooperate or not, Huang Yueli’s words don’t count at all. They still required Li Moying’s consent.","In the end, they had not expected Li Moying to have such a response.....","Could it be that in his heart, Huang Yueli was already able to represent him entirely?","Such a powerful and arrogant man like him actually placed his fiancée in such a high status?","This really made them feel hard to believe.","After some time, Leng Yi Feng responded, “Alright, since we’ve come to a mutual understanding, then we shall follow according to what we discussed earlier, to open the rare treasure ***...”","“Wait a minute, I’m not done talking yet!”"]},{"number":1440,"title":"Chapter 1440 - Heaven has no eyes (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1440: Heaven has no eyes (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli stopped him from continuing as she continued to add on, “We can cooperate but you have to prove that you are useful. Otherwise you cannot expect us to let you have the advantages for free right?”","Leng Yi Feng frowned slightly, “This.... Miss Bai’s meaning is.....”","Huang Yueli said, “Very simple. Since you claim that Murong Ni can decode the array outside the cave dwelling, then let her come out and have a try! If fact proves that she is really able to decode the array, then when we all enter the cave dwelling, we can share the treasures inside with you. But if she didn’t manage to decode it... and after that we Celestial Light Sect manages to open up the cave dwelling, then we will not split any benefits with you guys.”","This was a reasonable request so Leng Yi Feng immediately nodded his head to represent that he agreed with it.","“Can, this is the right thing to do.”","He totally had not realised the motive Huang Yueli had when she said these, only feeling that she was just saying a load of rubbish. From what he thought, if Murong Ni had no way, then there was no way that the other people in Celestial Light Sect could open up the cave dwelling so the question of splitting up the treasures wouldn’t exist at all.","After both parties came to an agreement, all of them looked towards Murong Ni.","Right now, she was the most crucial character on whether the two Sects were able to come together for a cooperation and if they were able to enter the cave dwelling, which was the main point which everyone was concerned about.","Murong Ni had yearned for everyone’s attention on her, commanding public respect and support for the longest time ever.","But this time, she didn’t have the slightest feeling of excitement or agitation. On the contrary, she was entirely stiff to the max, totally not knowing what she should do!","Decoding an advanced historical array, how could it be that easy?","Based on her mere third rank Array Master standard, it was completely impossible for her to complete this difficult task!","Only, if it were usual times, everyone would be able to understand if she wasn’t able to decode it.","However right now, Huang Yueli made use of public opinion to coerce her, which was equivalent to placing her on the fire to roast, totally in a difficult position!","Celestial Light Sect’s people had completely turned tables with her.","Whereas Green Cloud Sect’s people had placed all their hopes on dividing the rare treasures onto her!","If she were to say that her ability didn’t match up at this juncture and that she couldn’t do it, then what was the outcome going to be??","Murong Ni’s forehead was filled with perspiration but she could only brace herself as she walked to the side of the cave dwelling, starting to check on the situation of the surrounding array.","Since things came to such a pass, she really had no way to retreat hence the only thing she could do was to force herself to try it out!","She walked one round around the cave dwelling’s walls, carefully observing the walls and floor’s array patterns.","As she looked, she suddenly discovered something as her eyes instantly lit up!","Originally she had completely lost hope but after really observing it, she realised in excitement that the array protecting the cave dwelling’s surroundings was actually nto extremely advanced!","Furthermore, this array looked rather familiar, as though there was no difference between the arrays which she had read from a historical array ancient record recently.","Murong Ni originally didn’t believe that there was such a good thing so she suppressed her excitement in her heart as she retrieved an array board from her realm ring as she surveyed the surroundings several rounds, as she kept on deducing and calculating.","Lastly after repeated verification, she finally heaved a sigh of relief.","It seemed that there was always a way out! Probably even that little slut Bai Ruoli had not expected that this array outside the cave dwelling was that simple, and in fact it so coincidentally happened to be something which she had once seen before?"]},{"number":1441,"title":"Chapter 1441 - Heaven really has no eyes (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1441: Heaven really has no eyes (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“What’s the matter? After taking such a long time, how is it? Can you decode this array or not?”","Fang Shaoning had turned impatient since some time ago but he also knew that the process of deduction from an Array Master was very complicated and they needed to maintain a state of concentration hence he didn’t dared to disturb Murong Ni.","Now on seeing Murong Ni suddenly standing up, he finally couldn’t help himself from asking.","Murong Ni gave a smile on her face, “Mister Fang, Mister Leng, I’ve not let down the trust you had in me! This array... I happened to come across it some days ago in a historical ancient manual and although the method to decode it is a little complicated but I should still be able to do it!”","Fang Shaoning and Leng Yi Feng were extremely overjoyed, “That’s great, that’s really too great! Miss Murong, your array skills innate talent is indeed very high, to be able to decode this historical array easily!”","Murong Ni was secretly feeling delighted when she heard that as the smile on her lips couldn’t be suppressed.","On the contrary, Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were bearing despondent expressions as all of them were infuriated.","“Heaven really has no eyes! How did Murong Ni really find the way to decode this array? Was her array skills mastery really that high?”","“Murong Ni had always bore the name of an array skill talent in South Sky Region, so this isn’t some surprising matter at all.”","“But she is immoral. For a little bit of benefits, she even betrayed her own Sect! Why did this kind of person become an array skill talent? Heaven really has no eyes!”","“Ai, we had finally gotten some resources but now we have to split half to these sort of people. Just thinking about it makes me feel unresigned!”","No matter how Celestial Light Sect’s disciples scolded her, but Murong Ni was feeling delighted as she didn’t feel upset at all!","On the contrary, on seeing the disciple’s angry expressions, she assumed that they must be feeling regretful! Who asked these people not to protect her, to bring her along on experience training, sending the treasures right to her? She chose the side which could let her gain more, which was just and right!","She raised her chin as she looked at Huang Yueli, “Miss Bai, really thankful to you! If it hadn’t been for your help to raise the conditions for cooperation for both sides, I don’t even know that my array skills standard was actually that high!”","Hearing that, Celestial Light Sect’s disciples started sighing.","“Ai, Miss Bai had really miscalculated this time! She had not expected Murong Ni to really be able to decode the array right? This time she had really moved the rock to smash on her own toes! Are we really going to split half of the treasures to Green Cloud Sect?”","“That’s right, it’s just too infuriating! If we had known earlier, we wouldn’t have agreed to some cooperation with Green Cloud Sect! I rather not have the treasure for myself than to let those villains from Green Cloud Sect benefit from it, especially for that traitor Murong Ni!”","Murong Ni looked at Huang Yueli in delight, assuming that she would be angrier than those ordinary disciples.","But Huang Yueli’s face hung a faint smile which was totally out of her expectations.","“Really? Looks like you’re really sure of it? Then I shall first congratulate Senior Sister Murong!”","Murong Ni saw her look and her heart thumped hard, subconsciously feeling that something was not right.","Huang Yueli’s look.... Seemed a little too peaceful! She totally didn’t look like someone who’s plot had failed!","She then turned her gaze towards Li Moying.","Li Moying’s expression was totally unreadable to her. He totally didn’t take notice of anyone else. That pair of seductive peach blossom eyes were fixated tightly onto Huang Yueli as his expression was gentle, and he would caress the young lady’s hair every now and then."]},{"number":1442,"title":"Chapter 1442 - Heaven has no eyes (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This... how did it become like this?","Could it be that.... there really was some plot?","Murong Ni shook her head as she tried hard not to let her mind wander.","No, it shouldn’t be like that! She coincidentally read on this historical array and she would definitely be able to decode it successfully!","Leng Yi Feng urged, “Since you know the way, then hurry and start decoding it! We can save more time and enter the cave dwelling earlier.”","Murong Ni had no time to let her thoughts wander as she only nodded, moving upwards in a hurry.","Decoding an array was a complicated piece of work and rough judgement to decode was one thing. But when they really started to work on it, it was another thing.","Even though she had read the relative records on the ancient manuals and knew the decoding train of thought, but it still required a huge amount of calculation and deduction.","Murong Ni held on to the array board as she went round the cave dwelling’s outer walls numerous times as her forehead creased tightly, uttering to herself.","After spending close to two hours, she finally drew out a piece of brick from the surrounding walls, shifting it to some other location.","Following Murong Ni’s action, the entire cave dwelling flashed another bright light, so bright that it pierced everyone’s gazes.","Fang Shaoning was feeling joyful, “How is it? Is the array considered to be decoded?”","Murong Ni shook her head, “Not yet, it’s still too early. This is just one tenth...”","Fang Shaoning’s face turned black as he didn’t imagine that decoding an array was such a troublesome matter and wasted so much time.","Leng Yi Feng had once seen Array Masters decoding arrays and knew what Murong Ni said wasn’t wrong as he hurriedly stopped Fang Shaoning, “Alright, you quietened down a little and stop bothering Miss Murong from decoding the array!”","Just like that, Murong Ni spent a long time deducing continuously as her face started to turn paler and paler!","Because the more she deduced, she realised that the complexity of this array had far surpassed her calculations and every single time she decoded a step, the next step was an even harsher and undecodable situation which she had to face, and very soon it started to exhaust her concentration!","In the end, she finally could not hold on as her head suddenly felt dizzy and was about to fall.","“How is it, have you finally decoded it all? How much time more?” Fang Shaoning had completely lost his patience.","Leng Yi Feng also felt that Murong Ni’s condition wasn’t quite right as he started to look impatient as well.","“Miss Murong, what’s the current situation now? You’re the one who said it yourself that this array was simple and you would definitely be able to decode it. Are you intentionally dragging the time to fool with us?”","Anyone could tell the threat in his tone and Murong Ni naturally knew it even more clearly.","She quivered as she felt a chill, suddenly regaining some consciousness.","That was it, if she really couldn’t decode the array, then would she really become the object of despise to the two Sects? She had already betrayed Celestial Light Sect so if Green Cloud Sect were to not want her then she would really be finished!","Murong Ni was feeling extremely anxious and had no way to quieten down her heart to think carefully. She had already made so many mistakes in her own deduction and yet she had not detected it at all.","Finally, she forcibly came out with a conclusion.","Murong Ni didn’t have the time to carefully think if the answer was right or wrong as she stretched out her hand on the wall, lifting up the last brick.","A loud “Boooom” reverberated!","Instantly the entire cave dwelling’s exterior was enveloped by circles of blue light and in this blue ray of light, the cave dwelling’s entrance opened up on the two sides.","But the main entrance had not opened up completely, only separating slightly, as it revealed an entry which only allowed one person to pass through at a time."]},{"number":1443,"title":"Chapter 1443 - Heaven has no eyes (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Murong Ni saw this, she was so excited beyond herself!","She simply couldn’t believe that she really did it! She actually decoded this historical array!","She had not expected that her last action without taking time to think through carefully actually let her hit the first prize, gaining success in one shot!","Leng Yi Feng and Fang Shaoning exchanged glances as they revealed an overjoyed expression.","“You’re truly a rare array skill talent which can only be found once in every few centuries, even such an advanced historical array can’t stop you! You’re just too incredible!”","“It’s Green Cloud Sect’s honour to have been able to invite Second Miss Murong to join our team!”","Green Cloud Sect’s disciples were all feeling pleasantly surprised.","On the other hand, Celestial Light Sect’s side was filled with sorrow as each one of them felt extremely frustrated.","Murong Ni saw their expressions and felt even more complacent!","Hmpf, how dare they belittle this Young Miss, how was it now? Feeling regret? But.... it’s all too late!","She was just about to say something to taunt them so as to gain back her face but Fang Shaoning gave her a gentle push on her back.","“You can say whatever you want later, we have to grab hold of time and enter quickly!”","Murong Ni raised her head as her eyes met Fang Shaoning’s gaze, immediately understanding what he meant.","That’s right, now was the most crucial time of all and every second counted!","The entrance of the cave dwelling was only that big and that meant that the first batch of people who went in couldn’t be that many. Whoever went in first would have a longer duration to seek the treasures!","Don’t think that the two Sects had agreed earlier on distributing the treasures equally, but the minute they really enter the cave dwelling, who would be so silly as to hand out the things which they have taken, and wait for equal distribution? How could that be possible?","Of course it belonged to whoever had grabbed it first!","Because of that, the most important thing now was to hurry in and grab the treasure!","Murong Ni regained her senses as she couldn’t care less about taunting Huang Yueli as she turned around and dashed towards the entrance of the cave swelling at the first chance!","Green Cloud Sect’s people were originally nearer to the entrance of the cave dwelling and now under Leng Yi Feng’s commands, all of them ran into the cave dwelling, striving to be the first and fearing to be the last!","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples had not expected them to be so sinister and originally they had yet to react. So by the time they realised that Green Cloud Sect’s people had played dirty and wanted to rush over but it was all too late.","A large half of Green Cloud Sect’s disciples had already entered in and the rest of them, under Leng Feng Yi’s incitation, had blocked the cave dwelling’s entrance. The entrance was only this wide and it was tough for two people to squeeze in simultaneously. Celestial Light Sect’s people were blocked on the outside so it was impossible to cut the queue to enter!","Luo Jiyun’s face turned totally black as he cried out flustered and exasperated, “Fang Shaoning, your Green Cloud Sect is really shameless! You actually disregarded the agreement and snatched the chance to run in!”","Fang Shaoning laughed heartily, “Since when had we gone back on the agreement? Mister Luo, please touch your conscience when you speak! Our original agreement didn’t mention who went in first or last, so your Celestial Light Sect can also enter first if you wanted to isn’t it? Isn’t it all because your actions are too slow?”","Luo Jiyun almost fainted from hearing that, “Too despicable, too shameless! Green Cloud Sect is also a large Sect so how could there be such despicable disciples like you guys!”","“What despicable? This is called relying on your own skill! Talking to me about virtues in front of treasures? You look like you’re not very young but how could you be so naïve? Fang Shaoning gave a cold laugh several times and on seeing that most of his comrades had already entered in as he hurriedly joined in as well!"]},{"number":1444,"title":"Chapter 1444 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1444: Huang Yueli’s array skills (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Luo Jiyun was really infuriated as he shot upwards and wanted to chase after Fang Shaoning tightly towards the cave dwelling to stop them.","But he had just started moving when a figure dashed out from the side, blocking right in front of him.","“Junior Brother Luo, what’s the hurry? Keep calm and don’t get too excited.”","Luo Jiyun lifted up his head to realise that it was Huang Yueli as he could only stop in his tracks.","But the anxiousness in his heart had not reduced, “Little Sister-in-law, it’s already come to this so please stop blocking me! Haven’t you seen it for yourself? Those shameless fellows from Green Cloud Sect actually didn’t keep to their promise and intentionally entered before us! What shall we do if they snatched the treasures first?”","Actually all of the other disciples were burning with anxiety and upon hearing that, they immediately started to echo the same thing.","“That’s right, Junior Sister Bai, we have to hurry and enter as well!”","“Although there’s a lot of treasures in the cave dwelling but they would definitely take whatever they see so if we’re slow, there’d be nothing left!”","“That’s right, Green Cloud Sect’s bunch of wretched people are simply too sinister! Junior Sister Bai you shouldn’t have agreed to split the treasures with them equally earlier! They are totally up to no good!”","All of them were extremely worried and if it hadn’t been for Huang Yueli to stop them on their way, they were itching to rush in.","The minute they thought of the rare treasure in the cave dwelling falling into the hands of Green Cloud Sect, that made everyone filled with irreconciliation!","However, Huang Yueli was totally not influenced by them as her delicate little face did not show a single bit of urgency. Instead her lips curled up as she laughed softly.","“Senior Brothers and Senior Sisters, I’ve already said this earlier, keep calm and don’t get too excited... relax, the real rare treasure isn’t something which the fastest person can get. Moreover speaking, how do you know that Green Cloud Sect’s people had really entered the correct cave dwelling and not.... A trap?”","Everyone was stunned.","“Trap?”","“What do you mean?”","Just as everyone was bearing a blank look, a loud shocking explosion was suddenly heard from the cave dwelling’s direction!","“BOOMMMMM —!!”","The ground vibrated vigorously and black smoke started to surge out from the cave dwelling’s top.","Miserable screams were heard and following the bubbling airflow, Green Cloud Sect’s disciples who had rushed over to the cave dwelling were all thrown out!","The explosion was just too intense and although Huang Yueli was a distance away from the cave dwelling, she could feel the aftermath of the explosion charging towards her from her back!","She wasn’t able to evade in time as her small face turned slightly pale.","Damnit! She had not expected that they were still too near. If she had known earlier, she would not be nosy and came out personally to stop them!","Just as Huang Yueli thought that she would really be injured, a black image flashed by.","A strong arm hooked onto her waist and pulling at her, he drew her to one side as he successfully saved her right before the airflow struck her.","Huang Yueli rested into Li Moying’s arms as she was still in a panicked state, “Mo... Moying, luckily you’re here.....”","The large palm which grabbed her slender waist suddenly tightened as he heard the young lady’s pained cries and he berated her in a bad mood, “So stupid, why were you standing in such a dangerous place for? Did you really think that you are still in the ninth stage realm??”","Huang Yueli buried her face onto his chest, rubbing him as she acted as though nothing happened, “Boo hoo, you’re so fierce! I’m so scared yet you’re still scolding me!”"]},{"number":1445,"title":"Chapter 1445 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1445: Huang Yueli’s array skills (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The corners of Li Moying’s lips kept twitching as it was obvious that this lass was faking it but he was still stirred up by her soft cries of pain as he felt his heart ache.","“What’s the matter? Let me take a look, are you injured?”","Saying that, he didn’t wait for Huang Yueli to reply as his palm started to pat her from top to bottom as he checked her body to see if she had sustained any injuries.","Huang Yueli’s face flushed red immediately, this man really didn’t bother about the current situation! They were in public and he... he actually did this??","She hurriedly pushed him away, “Nothing, I’m fine. Just merely had a shock. Alright, let go of me! So many people are looking at us!”","Li Moying suffered some domestic violence punches from her and forcibly stopped. But he wasn’t very assured as he frowned and stared at Huang Yueli, “Really alright? If you’re injured, you must tell me, you’re not allowed to hide it from me!”","Huang Yueli nodded her head earnestly to guarantee, “I’m really fine! Rest assured!”","Li Moying then heaved a sigh of relief as the huge arm on her waist didn’t shift away. It merely relaxed a little but he still locked her in his arms.","Huang Yueli struggled for a while and stopped, only pouting her lips allowing him to do as he wished.","Li Moying turned around and looked towards the direction of the cave dwelling.","Right now, the exploding sound had stopped and the black smoke above the cave had dissipated by a large amount.","Earlier there was such an intense tremor which could be described as earth shaking and mountains swaying. The several thousand year old trees nearby had all fallen onto the ground but this luxurious beautiful cave dwelling remained standing and motionless, without even a crack on the walls. It seemed as though nothing had happened earlier.","But the surrounding walls of the cave dwelling were Green Cloud Sect’s disciples who had fallen everywhere.","All of them without any exception had all been expelled from the cave dwelling. Moreover because of that earlier explosion, all of them had sustained heavy injuries as they laid limp on the ground, unable to climb up at all.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples crowded around them as they discussed with shock.","“This.... what happened?? Hadn’t they entered the cave dwelling successfully earlier? Why did they get expelled out?”","“Hahaha do you even need to think? It must be because the array had not been decoded and that entrance was just a trap so they all fell for it!”","“That’s right, who asked them to be so complacent earlier, how about now? It’s so hilarious!”","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were all rocking with laughter as they all heaved a sigh of relief, but at the same time they were also terrified at the bottom of their hearts.","“Luckily, we didn’t enter! Otherwise we will end up the same as them!”","“Right, earlier I almost chased after them to run it, luckily Junior Sister Bai stopped us... wait, does that mean that she had already seen through something?”","“Makes sense, otherwise why would she purposely stop us?”","“But isn’t that too ridiculous? Muring Ni can’t even decode the historical array so how could she possibly find out the secret behind this?”","“Probably just.... coincidence?”","The crowd looked at each other in dismay as they felt that there was more to it that meets the eye.","Huang Yueli had once again saved everyone in Celestial Light Sect and this was something which all of them acknowledged. But how did she save them, this was what made all of them unable to comprehend!","Surely it couldn’t be that her level of mastery in array skills was stronger than Murong Ni right? This simply could not be justified because Murong Ni was a publicly acknowledged number one array skills talent in South Sky Region! Since young there had been many famous Array Masters who appreciated her innate talent and were snatching to take her in as their disciple."]},{"number":1446,"title":"Chapter 1446 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","How could Huang Yueli possibly be more talented than Murong Ni?","Her armament refining skills and cultivation innate talent was already so strong and if she really had that high level of mastery in array skills, how would anyone else be able to live?","Just at this moment, those disciples from Green Cloud Sect who had fainted all started to regain their consciousness.","Leng Yi Feng’s cultivation was the highest and he was the first to regain consciousness.","The minute he opened his eyes, he discovered that he was lying on the ground and was not able to go into shock when he felt a wave of intense pain emitting into his brain cells. His internal organs seemed to have shifted places which made him go into so much pain that he could only moan out loudly.","“Ah.... This... what is going on?”","Shouldn’t he already be in the cave dwelling selecting the treasures?","He still remembered that the moment right before he lost consciousness, he had discovered a large quantity of eighth tier and above Profound Armaments as he was so excited and was indecisive on which one to select but in the end.....","His memories immediately returned to him as Leng Yi Feng recalled that sudden explosion as his expression turned extremely gloomy!","Fang Shaoning had also regained consciousness and he turned his head back blankly. Upon meeting Leng Feng Yi’s gaze, he immediately understood what happened.","“Damn! Looks like the array had not been decoded? We have all been tricked by that wretched slut Murong Ni!”","It was exactly because he was the last few to enter hence his injury was not as serious and he could still forcibly stand up.","Fang Shaoning walked to Murong Ni who was still unconscious as he grabbed her collar and shook her vigorously, “Murong Ni, still pretending to be dead! Get up right now! Wake up!”","Murong Ni awoke in dizziness as there was a complete blank on her face, followed by a sharp cry of pain.","“Argh..it’s so painful, ugh... why can’t I move? What happened?”","Fang Shaoning was extremely upset as he gave her a tight slap. Immediately Murong Ni’s face became swollen as the corners of her lips flowed out blood, totally dazed from the slap.","Fang Shaoning berated her in exasperation, “What happened, you still have the cheek to ask! Didn’t you say that you’re sure that you can decode the array? Wasn’t it you who said you’ve succeeded? Why is it that so many of us have entered the cave dwelling but we were all expelled out and all of us sustained such heavy injuries?”","“What? How could that be possible?”","Murong Ni was stunned as she slowly recalled the situation at that time while her complexion started to turn paler and paler.","At the end, she had completely lost all colours of blood!","Recalling the entire process of development, how could Murong Ni still not understand?","She was just feeling that her luck was simply too good as she simply just drew any piece of brick which decoded the array. But as she was too excited, she had not thought of the possibility of a trap appearing!","Right now recalling that, she had not decoded the array successfully, but instead... she was misled! Not only had she not brought Green Cloud Sect’s people into the cave dwelling, she had caused them to suffer a huge loss!","Fang Shaoning laughed coldly, “Aren’t you the one who made yourself out to be so incredible? Aren’t you nicknames South Sky Region’s number one array skill talent? This is your potential? It’s simply a joke! No wonder Li Moying wasn’t willing to bring you along because you’re basically just a scammer. Whoever brought you along will get into bad luck!”","Murong Ni heard that and immediately forgot the pain on her body as she anxiously tried to explain for herself.","“Fang... Mister Fang, this is merely... merely an accident.....”","“Accident? One word accident and you caused so many of my Green Cloud Sect’s people to suffer such a terrible state, you still have the cheek to say so? You sure you’re not a spy sent over by Celestial Light Sect?”","“I... I’m not, how could I possibly be a spy?” Murong Ni shook her head vehemently in denial."]},{"number":1447,"title":"Chapter 1447 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, Fang Shaoning had no mood to continue listening to her.","All he knew was trusting Murong Ni was the gravest mistake that he had made! Just because of Murong Ni’s boasting, it caused so many Green Cloud Sect’s disciples to sustain such heavy injury and losses!","One must know that Green Cloud Sect’s top rated battle power had all entered the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region this time round and after the explosion in the mystic region, many of them had sustained a very serious injury which needed at least ten days to half a month in order for them to recuperate!","But this was the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region! Danger lurked all around the ancient mystic region and they had to face various dangers everyday so where would they find the luxury of the time to rest and recuperate?","Even if they were able to find a safe spot to make slight adjustments, but they were only in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region for a month. Now that there’s only ten over days left, surely it could not be that they were going to spend the last ten over days to recuperate?","This was a total waste of their opportunity in entering the ancient mystic region for experience training!","Needless to say, there were many Celestial Light Sect’s disciples who were keeping a watchful eye on them, just waiting for them to run into bad luck!","This time round, Green Cloud Sect’s top experts were all injured whereas Celestial Light Sect’s people were all perfectly fine.....","Thinking of this, Fang Shaoning suddenly jolted as he turned around.","He saw Huang Yueli and Li Moying standing side by side not too far away and Li Moying’s hand was placed on his fiancée’s waist as the both of them had a unruffled expression, occasionally casting glances at them as though they were watching a huge joke!","Fang Shaoning was so infuriated that he almost fainted!","Leng Yi Feng was also extremely upset because he was the one who led Green Cloud Sect’s disciples in. Now that so many of Green Cloud Sect’s disciples were seriously injured, he had to bear the responsibility for it!","Leng Yi Feng’s gaze fell upon Murong Ni as anger arose from all directions!","“Murong Ni, you’re indeed the spy sent over from Celestial Light Sect! You’ve caused us so much harm to Green Cloud Sect so I will absolutely not let you off! All the disciples from Green Cloud Sect will not let you off!”","Murong Ni suddenly had a change of colours, “I... I really didn’t do it intentionally, I really didn’t.....”","But no one believed her.","Or perhaps it could be said that it wasn’t important if she was a spy or not. Green Cloud Sect had suffered such a huge loss so all the disciples were bearing fire inside, as they needed to vent out on someone.","Murong Ni originally wasn’t part of their Sect and now that she was the main culprit in creating this mess, she naturally became the object of everyone’s fury!","Sensing the vengeful gazes radiating from all around her, Murong Ni’s body turned icy cold.","Right now, she finally felt extremely remorseful!","Why did she go rely on Green Cloud Sect? Green Cloud Sect’s people were obviously using her and the minute she was of no more use, they immediately turned their backs on her!","Murong Ni had no other way but to look towards Li Moying as she begged mercifully, “Eldest Senior Brother I beg you, please save me! I know I’m in the wrong and I promise I will never betray the Sect in future. Please, on account of my father, please save me! Otherwise Green Cloud Sect’s people will definitely torture me to death! Eldest Senior Brother!”","Li Moying’s eyes flashed a cold glint.","He had not spoken out when the ordinary disciples from Celestial Light Sect already started to cry out in fury.","“Young Sect Master, please don’t be soft hearted and forgive her!”","“That’s right, Murong Ni is simply too shameless! Earlier she claimed loudly that she will stand on Green Cloud Sect’s side and now? Now that she can’t continue staying there, she wants to return to Celestial Light Sect?”"]},{"number":1448,"title":"Chapter 1448 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1448: Huang Yueli’s array skills (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“That’s right, it’s impossible for such a good thing to happen under the heavens, did she think that we’re all fools or what?”","“Young Sect Master, you’re so brilliant and wide, surely you will not fall for this slut’s trick right?”","Murong Ni betrayed her own Sect and almost helped Green Cloud Sect to snatch away the treasure in the cave dwelling.","These acts had already made Celestial Light Sect’s disciples hated her to the core!","Even if she was Sect Master Murong’s biological daughter, no one was willing to forgive her!","Murong Ni was stuck in between a rock and a hard place as she was so anxious that her tears kept flowing, entreating piteously, “Eldest Senior Brother, I really realised my mistake, please give me another chance! Bai Ruoli, I’ve already been tricked by you to such a miserable state, are you still unwilling to let me off?”","Huang Yueli looked extremely innocent as she replied, “I trick you? Since when had I tricked you? It was obviously your team members who pushed you out to decode the array and I’d also given you a chance on accord that we were from the same Sect, specially giving up the chance to you. But your mastery in array skills is just too bad, so who can you balme?”","“But.... But.....”","Murong Ni was unable to give a convincing explanation to defend herself but she subconsciously sensed that today’s matter definitely had something to do with Huang Yueli. But she didn’t know how Huang Yueli managed to scheme her? Could it be that she really saw through this historical array? Moreover she intentionally dug a pit for her to jump in along the way?","Wasn’t the difficulty just too high?","The last time when they were in the Dark Moon Forest, Huang Yueli was merely a first stage realm practitioner and due to cultivation restrictions, she could only come out with the standard of a second or third rank Array Master.","So Murong Ni always had the wrong impression that Huang Yueli’s array skills were on par with hers and even if she was slightly better at it, there was a limit to it.","Hence she thought that if she herself was not able to see through the array, Huang Yueli would naturally not be able to do so as well.","Huang Yueli didn’t explain further as her lips curled showing a friendly attitude, “Alright, Mister Leng, Mister Leng, I’m sure both of you still remember our previous agreement right? If Murong Ni was able to decode the array and prove her value, then we will split the treasures with you equally. Now that she had failed in the challenge, so there’s no point in the cooperation between us right now. We won’t cooperate with weaklings so please hurry up and leave right now!”","She was so quick to issue the marching off orders which made Green Cloud Sect’s disciples both embarrassed and discomfited!","The party which was chased off like dogs due to inability was actually something which was happening every day in Soaring Heavens Continent.","But as West Sky Region’s number one Sect’s disciples, this was the first time many of them had suffered such humiliation!","Usually, they were the ones who chased other people away!","Leng Yi Feng’s expression was especially discomfited. To be seen in such a silly sight in front of the lady he liked and his love rival really was much worse than killing him!","He was really not resigned to it as he had not nudged at all.","Li Moying spoke out icily, “Why? Still trying to renege on here? Do you really want me to chase you all off personally? Not that it’s impossible but I’m afraid that you won’t be able to take it!”","Everyone shivered all over.","Leng Yi Feng asked with much difficulty, “Young Sect Master Li, don’t be like that... if a talented Array Master like Murong Ni isn’t able to decode the array, then the only way to enter would definitely be by brute force to decode the array! At this kind of timing, one more person means one more battle power so you will still need us! Isn’t it too early for you to say to not cooperate right now?”","Li Moying casted a glance at him as he replied coldly, “Who told you that.... I’m using brute force to decode the array?”"]},{"number":1449,"title":"Chapter 1449 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1449: Huang Yueli’s array skills (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Leng Yi Feng had totally not expected him to give this reply as he immediately went into a daze.","“You.... these words... what do you mean?”","Everyone present stared at him in astonishment.","Li Moying lowered his head as he looked at his fiancée in his arms as he asked softly, “Li’er, can you decode the array now? Or do you want to take a break first?”","His gaze and tone was extremely gentle, as though he had changed from an icy, emotionless top expert into a gentle and caring lover in a split second.","Even Huang Yueli was dazed by his bewitching peach blossom eyes, feeling that she was going to be bewitched by this man.","She shook her head, “No need.... Earlier we’ve already watched such a long show so if I still don’t move, my body will start to rot.”","Saying that, she pushed Li Moying aside gently as she walked towards the cave dwelling’s entrance directly.","Green Cloud Sect’s disciples all started to tremble when they heard what she said!","So they had excitedly ran into the array, assuming that they had gained a huge advantage but in Huang Yueli’s eyes, it was a monkey show?","“Hmpf, this Bai Ruoli is just too arrogant! She thinks that she has Li Moying behind her and no one dares to ruffle her feathers?”","“Wait a minute, why did she walk towards the cave dwelling’s entrance, could she be trying to decode the array?”","“What joke is that, she wants to decode the array? You must have seen wrongly! Bai Ruoli isn’t even an Array Master!”","“But, she... she really walked over....”","Under everyone’s astonished gaze, Huang Yueli walked to the cave dwelling entrance.","She raised her head and looked around, almost without any hesitation, as she stretched out her hand and drew out a piece of brick from the wall.","“What... what is she doing?”","The crowd looked at each other in dismay, with a dazed look on their faces!","From her stance, it bore some similarities to what Murong Ni was doing earlier, like she was decoding the array?","But if this was true, shouldn’t she be observing carefully around the surrounding walls first? How was it possible for her to just take out one piece of brick immediately? Earlier even the array skill talent Murong Ni observed for two hours before she made a move!","Luo Jiyun saw Fang Shaoning’s shocked look as he couldn’t help but laughed coldly, “Such ignorance! Little Sister-in-law is just decoding the array!”","“Decode the array? How is this possible? This is a historical array which had been around for several thousand years and she just made a move without taking a careful look, heaven knows what the consequence will be? Perhaps it might be even more terrifying than the explosion earlier!” Fang Shaoning totally didn’t believe his words.","Luo Jiyun gave a cold laugh, “Such lack of knowledge! In front of a true blue array skill talent, what is a historical array?”","“Array skill talent? You’re referring to Bai Ruoli? Isn’t she an Armament Master? How did she turn into an Array Master?”","Luo Jiyun replied disapprovingly, “Very strange eh? Little Sister-in-law is exactly this kind of genius!”","“But... no, this is impossible... you’re confusing me!” Fang Shaoning still refused to believe because this was simply out of his imagination.","Luo Jiyun didn’t bother to explain further.","His Sister-in-law’s innate talent was indeed heaven defying. It’s very normal for others not to believe based on empty words but seeing was believing so the truth would prove everything!","After Huang Yueli drew out the first brick, her feet immediately started to shit as she revolved several meters around the walls of the cave dwelling and suddenly stretched out her finger. Before anyone could react in time, she had already drawn out the second brick!"]},{"number":1450,"title":"Chapter 1450 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1450: Huang Yueli’s array skills (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Following that, she continued to move as she walked around the wall and she continuously started to strike, sometimes pulling out a brick and sometimes using Profound Energy to draw out a marking!","While she was doing these, her feet kept on shifting without pausing and she had completed everything at one go.","Right until she went one entire round did she finally stop.","Everyone was in a daze while looking at her movements, not knowing what she was up to.","Actually Leng Yi Feng and the rest had a faint premonition but in the deepest depths of their hearts, they totally didn’t dare to believe that there was such a thing so they had been telling themselves – this was impossible!","Huang Yueli clapped her hands and said, “Alright, I’m finally done!”","Her words had just landed when a layer of dim light appeared on top of the cave dwelling which was different from the earlier eye piercing bright ray. This layer of light was extremely soft but radiated with an extremely strong penetrating power as it lit up a large area in the surroundings.","The image of the cave dwelling in the light became much clearer.","At the same time, the cave dwelling’s entrance had opened up completely as it revealed a neat and tidy pathway, extending all the way inside.","This scenario looked totally different from earlier when Murong Ni decoded the array.","With such comparison, anyone could tell that this was the correct sign of the array being decoded!","Luo Jiyun rubbed his eyes as he cried out in astonishment, “So.... There was a layer of mist around the cave dwelling. No wonder it looked dusty earlier. I thought it was because the cave dwelling had been here for too long hence it was layered with dust and cobwebs!”","Huang Yueli laughed as she said, “These kinds of buildings are specially constructed with a special kind of material and with the support of arrays, as long as the effect of the array does not disappear, the exterior would not change due to the passing of time. Look, doesn’t this cave dwelling look somewhat different from earlier?”","Luo Jiyun was enlightened as he nodded his head furiously.","After the mist dissipated, the exterior walls of the cave dwelling seemed to have been refurbished as though it had been painted with a new coat of paint as every piece of brick reflected the sun, looking extremely dazzling.","The entire cave dwelling looked even more luxurious and it was easy to tell that several thousands of years ago, just how magnificent this cave dwelling was and how powerful and highly positioned of a top expert was the owner of the cave dwelling.","Luo Jiyun rubbed his palms as he cried out excitedly, “That’s great, let’s hurry in quickly! This Sage Wu Ding doesn’t seem like a simple person so there’s definitely great stuff inside!”","He turned his head back and was about to call out for the Celestial Light Sects’ disciples whom he was on better terms with to go in together but in the end he saw everyone’s dazed expressions on their faces.","“What’s the situation?” He went into a blank and immediately realised what happened as he couldn’t stop laughing, “Why are you all in a daze for? Can’t you tell that the array outside the cave dwelling had already been decoded? Why are you still wasting time here for?”","“But, this... this... I feel that I must be dreaming.”","“This array is really decoded? This... This is just.....”","“Junior Sister Bai really is.... really is an Array Master??”","“How could that be possible? How could there be such a ridiculous genius under the heavens! Forget it that her cultivation innate talent is that abnormal, she’s also an armament refining genius, ok we can deal with that. But why is it that she can also decode a historical array?? Even such a talent like Junior Sister Murong had failed earlier!”","This person had spoken everyone’s thoughts and instantly, it caused a lot of people to echo together with him."]},{"number":1451,"title":"Chapter 1451 - Huang Yueli’s array skills (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1451: Huang Yueli’s array skills (8 )","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Everyone’s astonished gazes shot towards Huang Yueli, feeling that they must be dreaming as this was totally unrealistic!","This kind of matter... was simply unheard of! Did this kind of genius really exist?","Or could it be that they were only dreaming?","Huang Yueli’s lips curled upwards as she said, “Just a small trick. Although this is a historical array but it is just a very commonly seen invisible array. Only thing was the one who set the array had great ideas and added in many variations in the small details hence it was slightly more confusing. In actual fact it’s not difficult to decode an array.”","Huang Yueli had casually explained with a. few words but did not mention that no matter how simple this array was, it was still an eighth tier array.","However, she didn’t bother if anyone believed her or not as she immediately urged, “Alright, stop wasting time, let’s all enter right now!”","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples had all woken up from the initial dream as they started jumping up jubilantly, rushing towards the cave dwelling’s entrance.","Murong Ni was completely devastated when she saw this as her eyes rolled back and fainted right there.","As the saying went, comparing people made one dead while comparing goods would result in it being dumped!","Originally although she had failed in decoding the array, she could still blame it on the fact that it was due to the array being too advanced.","But now that Huang Yueli had really decoded the array successfully, that was a real slap on her face! And it even sounded real loud!","Murong Ni was nicknamed as South Sky Region’s number one array skill talent? Hadn’t she boasted that she would be able to decode the array? In the end, she had duped all her team members.","On the contrary, another person had easily decoded the array and this person wasn’t even an Array Master, but an Armament Master!","“Damn, what’s the situation right now? Bai Ruoli said that this is a simple array so why can’t you decode it??” Fang Shaoning howled utterly discomfited but looking back, he realised that Murong Ni had already fainted.","He furiously kicked Murong Ni flying as she crashed into a tree and her head happened to knock against a tree branch as blood started to flow.","Fang Shaoning was still not appeased as he said to Leng Yi Feng, “What should we do now! It’s all my fault for believing that trash Murong Ni’s words. Now Celestial Light Sect’s own people have decoded the array so we gain nothing to split now!”","Leng Yi Feng clenched his teeth tightly, “Isn’t it too early to say that they have decoded the array? Earlier we also thought that we had succeeded but in the end, we were expelled out? Perhaps their success is merely a false image!”","These words were obviously a blatant lie to their own selves but what Green Cloud Sect’s people needed was exactly this kind of mental comfort.","Someone else immediately echoed, “Right, it’s definitely this way! That Bai Ruoli isn’t even an Array Master so how could she possibly just decode the array like that?”","“That’s right, have you seen her running around in that manner earlier? This isn’t decoding the array, it’s more like dancing isn’t it? Casually jumping around a few times and drawing some imprints and she could decode the array? Could it be any simpler? Is she bullying us that we haven’t met an Array Master before?”","“Normal Array Masters would take out their array board when decoding arrays, carefully deducing, considering all the changes in the array before they made a move! Her moves earlier means that she had decoded the array? That would be like seeing a living ghost! I think the Celestial Light Sect is going to be in big trouble this time round and their outcome will definitely be much worse off than us!”"]},{"number":1452,"title":"Chapter 1452 - Ample rapport (1)","paragraphs":["They intentionally said it loudly for Celestial Light Sect’s people to hear.","As expected, some disciples started to waver as they stopped in their tracks, not daring to move forward.","Fang Shaoning saw this and suddenly a scheme came to his mind as he leaned in close to Leng Yi Feng, speaking softly, “Eldest Senior Brother, let’s be patient and wait a while. After those from Celestial Light Sect have all entered, they would not leave anyone to guard the entrance. Even if there was someone, as long as it wasn’t Li Moying himself, they won’t be able to stop you. By then we can sneak in behind them. Although we’re not able to split most of the loot, but at least it’s much better than getting nothing at all.”","Leng Yi Feng hesitated, “This... isn’t this too contemptible?”","As a direct descendant of the Leng family, he bore the pride of a large family’s and this was","equivalent to being a thief so he really couldn’t lower himself to do it.","Fang Shaoning replied, “At this kind of timing, what’s there to talk about being contemptible or not? Entering the mystic region’s priority is to gain benefits! Moreover speaking, most of the top experts from our Sect are heavily injured and if we don’t take the opportunity to gain some advantages, what shall we do later on?”","Leng Yi Feng slowly nodded his head.","Although both of them were whispering, but as Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s soul trace was exceptionally strong, they still heard what they said.","Li Moying couldn’t help but sneered coldly, totally ignoring them as he walked into the cave dwelling directly.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips as she saw that most of Celestial Light Sect’s people had already entered and she stood by the entrance of the cave dwelling and drew out an array pattern in mid-air with her right hand!","Following her actions, the cave dwelling’s entrance started to close up slowly.","Fang Shaoning and Leng Yi Feng were originally planning happily, waiting to sneak into the cave dwelling to pick on the left-overs.","Whoever knew that before they had the time to be delighted, the cave dwelling’s door started to close up!","“Oh no! How did this happen? Bai Ruoli is going to close up the entrance!”","“Heavens, how is this possible? Wasn’t it said that she had not decoded the array successfully? Why is it that she can open or close this array to her liking, this... what kind of level of mastery in array skills does she have? It’s too scary!”","“We’re finished, the door is about to close so that means we totally cannot enter!”","Leng Yi Feng and Fang Shaoning exchanged glances as he howled, “Everyone quickly squeeze in right now, we’re not going to make it if it’s too late!”","Saying that, the both of them rushed over!","Leng Yi Feng was indeed the number one man among the younger generation of Green Cloud Sect. His speed was extremely swift like a bolt of lightning as he rushed into the cave dwelling in an instance.","Although Huang Yueli had displayed her array skills, but the opening and closing process of the array was rather slow and this door had not completely closed up when Leng Yi Feng directly charged in!","Fang Shaoning’s speed wasn’t any slower as well as he followed closely behind, also charging in.","After they entered the cave dwelling successfully, the first thing they did was not to race against time to search for treasures but they both struck out a move towards Huang Yueli at the same time!","They were very clear minded that as long as they were able to control Huang Yueli, this array would not be able to shut fully so now that the entrance was half closed and the entrance was rather narrow but they were still able to squeeze in.","Huang Yueli was fully concentrated on the array!","Controlling a complicated eighth tier array to the current fifth stage realm first level, was absolutely not an easy thing so she required an extreme amount of concentration, so that she did not make any mistake!"]},{"number":1453,"title":"Chapter 1453 - Ample rapport (2)","paragraphs":["Because of that, Leng Yi Feng and Fang Shaoning’s attacks were something that she couldn’t go up against.","Or even, she totally could not respond to it.","In a split second, surging Profound Energy had reached her chest and was about to deal her with a heavy strike!","However Leng Yi Feng still bore tender and protective feelings for her hence he wasn’t too vicious in his attack but Huang Yueli was in the middle of performing and if she was interrupted, it would definitely result in an extremely serious backlash, and her meridians would definitely be damaged.","On seeing that she was about to be hit, Huang Yueli’s face did not show any signs of shock.","Instead, she totally didn’t attempt to evade it as she stood calmly at her spot, drawing out lines and lines of array patterns without any mistakes, her hands not even shaking at all!","“Bai Ruoli’s reaction is really slow. Still controlling the array at this point of time, she’s really looking for her own death!” Fang Shaoning laughed coldly to himself.","But before he could finish laughing, a stroke of purple lightning flashed past the air.","This bolt of lightning descended from the sky and was rough and bright as though it was going to split the entire cave dwelling into two!","Following the lighting was a thunderous sound, as the ground started to shake.","The two of them had an abrupt change of expression as they anxiously retreated to evade but the speed of the lightning was simply too fast and before they had time to react, it was already too late.","“AH—!”","Fang Shaoning gave a blood curdling shriek and was struck directly by the lightning on his chest. He turned into a charred black colour as his body was still smoking and he was expelled out of the cave dwelling.","Leng Yi Feng’s reaction was much faster but he was still struck by the lighting on his shoulder. His arm immediately lost all senses as he was sent flying out as well while spitting out blood in mid-air, as he fell onto the ground.","Only thing was he had not fainted so he could still see who was the person who had attacked him!","Leng Yi Feng’s eyes peeled wide to stare at the man who appeared suddenly beside Huang Yueli—","“Li Moying!”","Hadn’t he already entered the cave dwelling? Why did he return to protect Huang Yueli? Moreover his attack speed was so fast and sudden but Li Moying could still react in such a short amount of time, with tremendous force to cause such serious injury to the both of them with just one move!","What kind of ability was that??","Under Leng Feng Yi’s terrified gaze, Li Moying stood on the right side behind Huang Yueli, displaying a guard’s posture, protecting her.","Li Moying shot a glance towards Leng Feng Yi as he gave a chilly laugh, “Dare to make a move to attack my woman, did you really think I was dead? Trying to make use of the confusion to enter the cave dwelling to split a cup of soup? You’re daydreaming!”","Saying that his sleeve flicked and a burst of severe Profound Energy was unleashed!","Leng Yi Feng lost the chance to react as he was swept away just like leaves being blown away by the autumn wind, flying out of the boundary of the cave dwelling.","At the same time, Huang Yueli had finally completed all the array patterns as the cave dwelling’s entrance started to shut steadily under her control.","From the start to the end, the movements on her hands had not stopped and there hadn’t been a moment of slowing down as she was neither fast nor slow in her steady and accurate actions.","As though the two people who popped out and dealt her with a murderous hand had totally not appeared!","She was absolutely certain that her fiancé was right by her side and would be able to ensure her safety at any one time so she was totally unguarded all because.... there was totally no need for that!"]},{"number":1454,"title":"Chapter 1454 - Ample rapport (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","They had ample rapport, same as in their past lives.","After Huang Yueli shut the entrance, Li Moying then stretched out his hand to hold hers, as their fingers locked tightly.","“Let’s go, those irritating houseflies are already gone so let’s hurry in now!”","Huang Yueli gave a smile as she nodded, walking alongside with him into the cave dwelling.","The rapport between the both of them didn’t need them to say a single word and they could mutually understand each other.","When she required protection, this man was always this reliable, forever enabling her to feel at ease.","The entrance was tightly shut and towards those outside, this was a scene which made them lose all hope.","Leng Yi Feng was kicked away like a dead dog by Li Moying and after being thrown out of the door, he clutched his chest as he struggled to prop up himself. But all he saw was that pair of lovers who walked side by side, disappearing behind the door.","Leng Yi Feng was so infuriated that he spat out a mouthful of blood!","This simply was... bullying intolerably! Li Moying actually used such a way to humiliate him! Whereas he... had been humiliated several times but did not have any chance to go against him!","Ever since meeting Li Moying, he had been subjected to unimaginable torture. He could not match up to Li Moying no matter in what aspect, each and every single time he tried to challenge him, it would always end up in a miserable ending. Furthermore, the ending was more miserable than the previous!","On the other hand, Li Moying was forever calm as he stood at the top. Even till now, Leng Yi Feng couldn’t tell what was the upper limit of Li Moying’s potential. He seemed to be a man with no limits! At any one time, he was able to display abilities which had surpassed one’s imagination!","Not only that, he was the perfect candidate who gathered both ableness and beauty in one!","For example Huang Yueli, a young lady with shocking innate talent in cultivation, armament refining as well as array skills, she was probably the one and only super existence in the entire Sky Emperor City. All the heirs to the top powerhouses in Sky Emperor City were fighting over to marry her.","But this young lady was only faithful towards Li Moying as her gaze was forever on Li Moying!","Leng Yi Feng felt that he was about to go crazy!","Luckily this time he had already thought of an idea for Li Moying to never leave the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region forever!","Thinking of this, Leng Yi Feng then forcibly controlled himself. Yes, Li Moying was going to be a dead man soon so he need not be frustrated, he only needed to endure it this one time.....","Leng Yi Feng clenched his fist tightly as he vowed to heavens: Li Moying, the day you leave the cave dwelling would be the day of your death and shattered reputation!","...","Inside the cave dwelling, Li Moting and Huang Yueli walked to the main hall’s courtyard.","Entering to take a look, Huang Yueli revealed a slight astonished expression.","Because Celestial Light Sect’s disciples who had entered this place had all gathered in the courtyard and none of them had grabbed the chance to go search for treasures.","This made Huang Yueli rather surprised as the rare treasure towards the ordinary disciples who entered the mystic region for their very first time had a huge attracting power, something which she was very clear of.","She had thought that these people would separate on their own ways the minute they entered the door!","When everyone saw them walking there, they started to crowd around them in both excitement and agitation.","“Miss Bai, you’re finally here, we’ve all been waiting for you!”","“Yes, you... you’re too incredible, you even know array skills! Your array skills mastery is even higher than that of Murong Ni! Just what kind innate talent is that??”","“Really too heaven defying, simply unimaginable!”"]},{"number":1455,"title":"Chapter 1455 - Ample rapport (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“If it hadn’t been for you, we’d be finished this time round. Not only are we not able to enter the cave dwelling, we would also have been schemed by those shameless fellows from Green Cloud Sect!”","“Junior Sister Bai, I’ve already decided that from today onwards, you’d replace Young Sect Master and become my most adored idol!”","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were all crowding around Huang Yeuli, expressing their heart felt adoration and praises.","Because it wasn’t the first time that Huang Yueli had saved Celestial Light Sect during a crucial moment.","Last time, after they had ascertained the quota to the mystic region, it was the same scenario on the arena stage.","Everyone thought that Celestial Light Sect had failed completely and no matter what they weren’t able to turn tables around.","When Huang Yueli went on stage for the challenge, no one thought that she would emerge as the ultimate winner so no one held any high hopes for her.","However, the final result was that she had used her own ability to create one miracle after another, pulling strongly against a crazy tide to win the final victory for Celestial Light Sect.","This matter happened yet again and this accumulated the prestige and status of Huang Yueli in Celestial Light Sect’s disciples’ minds to a shockingly high degree.","Li Moying saw the mass disciples’ attitude and his lips curled up slightly, feeling extremely delighted in his heart.","Although Huang Yueli was his fiancée, but this kind of status would only made Celestial Light Sect’s disciples treat her with courtesy but not worship or respect her!","In Soaring Heavens Continent, only those who welded truly powerful abilities were able to win the respect from others which came deep down in their hearts.","So Huang Yueli obtaining the current status was all based on her own ability, conquering everyone!","This made Li Moying felt extremely proud. His Li’er was forever that powerful, that outstanding and no matter where she went, she was the object of everyone’s admiration but unfortunately, she was his, totally devoted to loving him only.....","As a man, Li Moying felt that his vanity was satisfied to the max.","But...","Li Moying quickly frowned.","Those disciples who were crowded around Huang Yueli were extremely agitated and they got closer and closer, squeezing her into the crowd and someone even touched her hand.","Li Moying’s face immediately turned ugly as he stretched out his long arm and curled it around Huang Yueli’s waist, bringing her into his embrace and successfully blocking out the passionate people who were around her.","“Alright, Li’er already understands your intentions. Right now we’re still in the cave dwelling and there’s a limit to the activation of the array so everyone quickly grab hold of time to seek for treasures. If you continue dilly dallying and miss the timing, then don’t blame us for not reminding you!”","“I repeat once again, you’re not allowed to break out into a fight over the distribution of the treasures since we’re all from the same Sect. We must talk things over to settle this and if there are any private fights between you guys and it falls onto my ears... I will absolutely not let it go.”","“If you understand, then you are dismissed!”","Li Moying’s expression was cold as he made it clear to everyone and with a wave of his hand, he wanted to dismiss these unimportant people!","It really was enough, Li’er was his! He allowed others to express their adoration and respect towards his fiancée but these people kept on revolving around her so he simply couldn’t take it!","He and his fiancée wanted their own romantic couple’s world alright? This bunch of unreliable fellow really don’t know how to watch the signs!","Li Moying’s black face was indeed intimidating.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples totally didn’t dare to object after hearing him say that."]},{"number":1456,"title":"Chapter 1456 - Ample rapport (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1456: Ample rapport (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","On seeing everyone being dismissed, Huang Yueli went into a blank as she turned towards Li Moying.","“Moying, you just let them go off like that?”","Li Moying’s mood was originally not very good and upon hearing Huang Yueli said that, he got even unhappier, “Otherwise what should I do? Don’t tell me you want to hang around with so many attendants around?”","Huang Yueli finally heard that his tone was filled with unpleasantness as she raised her head to take a look at him and laughed out.","“Of course I don’t mean that... alright, they’re all from your same Sect so why do you have to be jealous.....”","They had merely surrounded her for a slightly longer time, seriously, he had to even be jealous over this.....","Saying that, Huang Yueli raised her voice, “Senior Brothers and Senior Sisters, everyone please wait a while.”","The crowd stopped in their footsteps in surprise as they turned around to look at her, “Junior Sister Bai, what other instructions do you have for us?”","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “Earlier when I entered the door, I saw the decoration and structure of this cave dwelling. The first room in the east chamber should be a pill refining room. Second room is a storage room and there should be quite a number of medicinal pills. Based on Sage Wu Ding’s cultivation, the pills should at least be seventh level and above. The first room in the west chamber should be for armament refining and there should be a storage room on the side as well. Other than that, in the south courtyard, there should be three other depots. So you guys can spend some time exploring these places.”","She thought for a moment and said, “Right, in order to prevent fighting, everyone ought to distribute the duties and split up into several groups. Each group will search a room and all the treasures will belong to that group. First distribute it and there’s no room for regrets later on.”","She had said that to prevent Celestial Light Sect’s disciples from arguing and fighting over the treasures, causing internal strife.","Although Li Moying had already passed down his instructions, he was after all a man and his thoughts weren’t meticulous enough. Moreover he was too lazy to arrange so carefully. After all based on his ability and prestige, with a few words of warning and no one would dare to create any trouble.","Huang Yueli knew that just saying these weren’t enough. Even if they couldn’t fight on the surface, it was still very easy to cause conflict.","Hence she took the extra step to do the arrangement for the disciples.","Hearing her words, originally those disciples who were like headless flies all found their direction as they started to discuss seriously.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli’s face popped out a smile as she automatically held Li Moying’s hand, leaving the front courtyard together.","Li Moying was tugged by her moving forward but he was still scowling, “You’re rather concerned about those insignificant people, even giving them the idea on how to distribute the treasures.”","Huang Yueli knew he was jealous but she blinked as she intentionally put on an innocent look, “Yi? I’m just doing that out of consideration for you, the Young Sect Master, that’s why I helped them with the distribution method! Don’t tell me that you’re afraid that the treasures would be snatched away by them and you won’t be getting anything?”","Li Moying gave a cold harrumph as he stretched out his arm and brought her into his arms, lowering his head as he whispered into her ear.","“What does it matter if the treasures are all snatched away? What I hate is..... your attention being snatched away by them!”","Huang Yueli laughed out as she raised up her arms and hooked them around his neck, then tipping her toes, she leaned in close to the man and her pink lips was just less than an inch away from him as she whispered, “How could that be? In my heart, of course my future husband is the most important..... If they weren’t disciples from your Sect, I can’t even be bothered!”"]},{"number":1457,"title":"Chapter 1457 - Ample rapport (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1457: Ample rapport (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The young lady in her arms put on an evident smile which was out to please him as her lips curled up slightly and her fair little face seemed especially alluring and tempting.","Li Moying’s gaze darkened as he ferociously tightened his arm, bringing her petite stature in a circle as she fell into his arms, then lowering his head, he plundered the tender pink in front of his eyes.","Their breathes were linked and were harmoniously blended together.","As they knew that the occasion wasn’t right, so Li Moying didn’t kissed her too deeply, only exchanging a gentle and lingering light kiss.","Not long after, he released the young lady in his arms, his expression apparently relaxed by quite a bit.","Huang Yueli’s face flushed with a shade of red as she subconsciously gazed to her left and right, putting on a guilty look.","What place was this and this man just kissed her upon disagreement. If the others were to see them, how embarrassing would that be.....","Luckily everyone was too impatient to go search for the treasures so no one would be so free to specially notice the duo who were hiding in the corner. There wasn’t even a passer-by in sight around the surroundings.","Li Moying saw her bashful look as his mood really lifted up as he said, “Alright, where shall we do now? Isn’t Grandmaster Huang going to bring me to seek treasure?”","Huang Yueli intentionally replied, “I’ve already distributed all the treasures out, so there’s none for you left!”","Li Moying’s brows rose as he smiled, “Still trying to bluff me? It’s not my first time on an experience learning trip with you. Since when would a little money grubber like you be so kind hearted? The best things are definitely left for yourself, isn’t that so?”","Huang Yueli gave a humpf, “Those are meant for me, not for you!”","Li Moying totally didn’t mind what she said as he continued smiling, “Isn’t yours mine as well? In our home, the wife calls the shots so the treasures will naturally be managed by you. As long as you occasionally give me some pocket money, after all surely you won’t want to see your husband die of hunger right?”","Huang Yueli rolled her eyes at him coquettishly, “You make it sound as though I’ve always been mistreating you! As though I’ve never shared anything with you!”","Even during her past life, the best piece of Profound Armament which she refined was not her Belle under the Moon but was the Clear Sky Dark Clouds Sword which she had specially refined for Mu Chengying then. As she had almost exhausted all of her blood essence and Profound Energy after refining that sword, she had to recuperate for a year plus before she recuperated to her peak.","Speaking of that, she had really not accepted too much money from this man and instead, lost money by wasting a lot of ninth grade materials on it!","Recalling this, she must have really liked him a lot then? Otherwise she totally could not imagine that she would do such a losing business!","Li Moying knew this very clearly so he eagerly leaned close to her, “Yes, yes, yes, my wife treats me the best!”","“Don’t you talk rubbish, who is your wife, we’re not even married yet!” Huang Yueli complained.","Li Moying laughed, “Sooner or later you’d be mine.”","This overbearing declaration had exchanged for two white eyeballs without any accident.","Li Moting’s guess wasn’t wrong. Huang Yueli had indeed carefully observed the cave dwelling’s layout and knew the location of where the rare treasure could possibly be located.","This was not entirely based on Profound Energy or soul trace, but based on her expertise as a ninth rank Armament Master. In order to guarantee the cave dwelling’s safety and nature of concealment, the distribution of the layout and structure of the mechanisms in the cave were extremely meticulous so only she alone was able to find out the exact situation in the first moment.","Li Moying’s cultivation was much higher than hers but in this aspect, he totally could not be comparable to her at all."]},{"number":1458,"title":"Chapter 1458 - Li Moying’s thunder attribute (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1458: Li Moying’s thunder attribute (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was in the front leading the way while Li Moying followed behind her closely.","The both of them walked past the front courtyard and towards the back of the corridor, finally stopping in the front of an extremely ordinary room door.","After Huang Yueli stopped, her face revealed a grave expression.","“If I’m not wrong, the bright ray which was caused by that rare treasure should be in this room.”","Li Moying couldn’t help but frowned, “But even if it’s me, just standing here now, I also can’t sense the situation inside the room.....”","Senses towards treasures were mainly related to soul trace and Li Moying’s soul trace was extremely powerful. By right they were just separated by a thin wooden door so it shouldn’t be possible that he couldn’t sense the rare treasure inside.","Huang Yueli’s expression turned even graver, “But the entire cave dwelling’s best spiritual spot is right here. In order to maintain the array outside the cave dwelling from operating normally, an important treasure must be placed inside so that it can maintain the entire array’s Profound Energy balance. If even you can’t sense it.....”","Her slender brows creased slightly, “That could only mean that this room has been set up with an extremely powerful invisible array. Either.... This room’s rare treasure itself had the attribute of concealing itself. But if it’s the latter, then things will be rather difficult to handle.....”","Ordinary treasures naturally couldn’t conceal itself. The higher grade the treasure, the more powerful imposing manner it would emit and even if it was a distance far, far away, one would still be able to sense it.","In order to conceal it, it would entirely depend on the various methods which the treasure’s Master had exerted.","If a piece of treasure was actually able to conceal its own presence, that would only meant that this piece of treasure had already developed its own spiritual nature which meant that the rare treasure in this room was at least a half God relic!","Li Moying stared at her little face as he asked, “Then what should we do?”","“No choice, now that we’re unable to use our soul trace to sense the interior, we can only attempt to decode the entrance’s mechanisms and array to first open the door and then check out the situation inside. As usual, I’ll be responsible for opening the door and you’re responsible for protecting me.” Huang Yueli raised her head as her gaze met the man’s sight.","Li Moying nodded in head in seriousness, “Rest assured, I’ll protect you well.”","Hearing this man’s words always made her feel assured.","Huang Yueli revealed a smile as she hurriedly coughed to hide it.","“Alright, then I’ll start!”","The minute she finished her words, her expression immediately turned solemn as her gazes were slightly congealed while she concentrated fully.","Her right hand rose up and drew out an incantation gesture in mid-air as her fingers turned and flew, throwing it out towards the middle of that room’s door.","Immediately following that, strokes after strokes of incantation gestures were like flowing water as it went on continuously. Her footsteps also kept on changing along with the variations, coordinating with the movements on her hand.","Her sleeves fluttered as she maintained an elegant and calm pose, as though she was dancing.","Li Moying stood behind her on her right as his eyes were fixated on her dancing figure, his gaze profound yet calm.","His Li’er was indeed very beautiful. Just looking at her decoding the mechanisms was indeed an eye candy, making him unable to shift his eyes away.","But he also knew clearly that all these were just a presentation only. Huang Yueli wasn’t really dancing but executing an extremely dangerous mission."]},{"number":1459,"title":"Chapter 1459 - Li Moying’s thunder attribute (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1459: Li Moying’s thunder attribute (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although on the surface it looked easy without any effort.","But in reality, it just took one wrong step and the mechanisms and arrays would be activated immediately. What happened to Green Cloud Sect earlier would occur to them as well!","Furthermore, there were only the two of them and the room in front of them was specially used to store the rare treasure so the array’s might could only be strong! Moreover, extremely strong!","Huang Yueli herself was the array decoder and the risk she had to take on was the largest. If anything were to happen, she would be the first to face the music, suffering a serious backlash!","So she could not afford to make any mistake.","Li Moying knew that his little fiancée excelled in this aspect but he still wasn’t at ease and he had been cautious and anxious all the while.","Even if Huang Yueli had usually easily succeeded ten thousand times but it just needed that one failure for her to be heavily injured and that was something which he couldn’t afford to happen.","Luckily, Huang Yueli’s decoding process this time round was extremely smooth and no accidents of any sort had happened.","She had struck out several incantation gestures consecutively and plotted out the array patterns. After one hour later, the Profound Energy fluctuations on her had evidently become weaker. Apparently with her fifth stage realm cultivation, she wasn’t able to take on the exhaustion liability of decoding this kind of advanced array.","But at the same time, the array’s intensity was slowly becoming weaker as it became less threatening gradually.","Finally, after a flash of ray shot past, the room door suddenly opened up without any breeze.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief, “That’s great, it’s finally open. This array is simply too complicated, I’m so tired.... Ah!”","Her eyes abruptly turned wide while she was talking halfway.","A blue purplish lightning suddenly zipped out from the room and with lightning fast speed, it seemed like a bolt of flash as it suddenly charged towards her.","But Li Moying’s reaction was even faster.","Just at the instance when the blue light appeared, he had already grabbed the Amethyst Light Sword with his backhand while the other hooked around Huang Yueli’s waist, pulling her back and throwing her to one side.","As the situation was pretty urgent, Li Moying’s actions seemed rather rough.","Huang Yueli was thrown aside by him as she almost fell down. She stumbled for several steps before she forcibly steadied her body.","She hurriedly turned back to take a look and upon one gaze, she gave off a shocked expression.","That bolt of purple light that zipped out ferociously from the room had turned into a huge virtual image in the middle of the courtyard, reflecting a magical beast’s state.","This magical beast was several feet tall and it’s eyes gave off a lightning kind of eye piercing lightning ray as the scales on its entire body gave off a dazzling yet cold phosphorescent glow, making it look exceptionally dangerous.","“This is... the Qilin Spiritual Beast??”","Huang Yueli was overwhelmed with amazement as her face changed colours. The first time she recalled was when they first activated the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, they had seen the totem of a Qilin spiritual beast on the empty grounds at the mystic region’s entrance.","Whereas this, was exactly the same as the carving which they had seen earlier.","Huang Yueli’s face turned pale as the imposing manner which was emitted from this Qilin had already reached the grade of a matured spiritual beast.","Just as she was in a daze, Li Moying had already started to engage in a battle with this Qilin.","His peerlessly handsome face was even colder than usual as his gaze was deep set and grave. His Profound Energy had entirely been adjusted as it kept on taking in the thunder attribute profound energy from several miles within the radius, gathering towards his body."]},{"number":1460,"title":"Chapter 1460 - Li Moying’s thunder attribute (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Momentarily, the entire courtyard was filled with invasive thunder attributed profound qi.","A spiritual beast Qilin, adding on to the suppression of Li Moying’s profound energy gathered in this small space and the feeling of suppression was something which was indescribable with mere words!","Even Huang Yueli was starting to not be able to take it as her complexion slowly turned pale as her chest started to throb with a dull pain.","But she wasn’t willing to retreat nor could she leave this place because Li Moying was still engaged in the battle with the virtual image of the Qilin so she absolutely would not retreat alone.","But in order not to drag Li Moying down, she hid herself behind a pillar and worked up her cultivation method trying to resist against that one man and one beast’s suppression while concentrating fully on the battle, hoping to get a chance to aid Li Moying.","Just as this moment, Qilin raised up its huge paw and an extremely severe lightning struck towards Li Moying.","That lightning was extremely thin and it looked like a glowing embroidery needle but it was exceptionally bright, so bright that just another look more at it would result in instant blindness.","Huang Yueli anxiously widened her eyes because based on her experience, she naturally could tell that this bolt of lightning had not become so thin because it was weak. But rather it was because all the profound energy was compressed within such a small space hence the minute one was struck, the consequences would be dire.","Even for a genius like Li Moying would probably be heavily injured.","The courtyard’s space was really too small and Li Moying wasn’t able to evade in time so he could only raise his sword to meet it but as the distance between both party’s profound energy wasn’t very huge, he was still sent flying as his body crashed against the wall. That bolt of lightning struck his chest directly and entered his body.","Huang Yueli was so shocked that she immediately jumped up. Such a powerful thunder attributed profound energy directly entering his body, how would that do? If something bad was to happen, his internal organs and meridians would be scorched until it broke up into inches.","She clenched her teeth as she immediately wanted to rush over to help.","But just at this moment, the surroundings of Li Moying’s body appeared a layer of faint purplish light, enveloping him right in the middle.","Li Moying who should have been coughing up blood from the serious injury did not show any pain on his face. On the contrary, he gave an astonished and shocked expression.","He stretched out his hand to cover the chest area where he was struck and couldn’t help but went into a blank.","Just as this moment the Qilin immediately pursued over as it continued to make its moves.","Huang Yueli had already dashed out by half a footstep when she suddenly stopped. Looking at Li Moying’s lively looks, it seemed that... he was alright? What was going on?","Just within this short moment, Li Moying and the spiritual beast Qilin had changed several rounds.","Li Moying’s senses were originally grave but as time went by, he was dealing with it with much ease.","Huang Yueli was also very anxious right from the start and she slowly started to calm down, at the same time she was able to tell that something was not right.","Ancient spiritual beasts each led in their own regions and all the spiritual beasts had attributes.","For example Huang Yueli’s little phoenix was of the fire attribute so apparently this Qilin’s virtual image was of thunder attribute.","Extremely coincidentally, Li Moying was also of the thunder attribute.","Among the same kind of attributed practitioners, as they could mutually take in part of the other party’s profound energy, so the damage they could cause was normally much lower as compared to normal circumstances.","Moreover, under the circumstances where their cultivations were close, the one who gained victory would normally not be the one who had a stronger cultivation but.... the one who was more outstanding in terms of attribute innate talent!"]},{"number":1461,"title":"Chapter 1461 - Li Moying’s thunder attribute (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli should have known this point much earlier but right from the start she had assumed that the Qilin spiritual beast’s thunder attribute innate talent would definitely be higher than Li Moying’s because it was after all an ancient spiritual beast!","But the scenarios which happened later on made her rather stunned.","Because the person who slowly gained an upper hand, was actually Li Moying!","This meant to say that Li Moying’s thunder attribute innate talent was above the ancient spiritual beast’s!","What kind of innate talent was that? What kind of potential was that?","Even if Huang Yueli self-admitted that her innate talent had surpassed most people and that she had been through huge waves but just the thought alone left her trembling in fear!","Wasn’t Li Moying a little.... too perverse?","At this moment, Li Moying and the Qilin spiritual beast were entering the end of the battle.","Li Moying had based his innate talent to deflect most of the Qilin’s damage and even in this abundant thunder attributed profound qi environment, he kept on absorbing the energy from the surroundings to build up his own power.","Under this kind of huge pressure battle to improve himself, his speed became faster and faster as his moves were getting more and more precise and overbearing.","Huang Yueli’s eyes grew wider and wider because Li Moying seemed as though he was entering the state of advancement again!","It had only been half a year since he advanced into seventh stage and right now he was going to breakthrough to seventh stage realm sixth level!","According to this speed, he would be able to break through to the ninth stage realm in under two years!","Even when he was in his previous life, the speed of advancement was much slower, and was totally incomparable.....","Li Moying’s imposing manner was getting stronger and stronger whereas the Qilin spiritual beast’s power was gradually becoming weaker and weaker under his attacks.","Roughly after two hours, Huang Yueli could see from her naked eyes that the virtual image of the Qilin was becoming more and more illusory and blurry.... This was the display that its energy was becoming weaker and weaker and that meant that its battle power had already dropped drastically.","Huang Yueli heaved a long sigh as she knew that they should be able to get past this stage.","Indeed, Li Moying’s last consecutive moves lit up the sky in dazzling rays, making one become blurry eyed and lastly a sword glint stabbed viciously into the Qilin’s heart!","With a “Peng” sound, the purplish lighting which enveloped the Qilin’s virtual image was completely shattered by him!","The virtual image turned into specks of thunder attributed energy as it slowly dissipated into the sky.","Li Moying’s face revealed a smile as he kept his sword.","Huang Yueli immediately pounced towards him as she anxiously checked on him from head to toe, “Moying, are you alright! Earlier I was really scared to death. That was an ancient spiritual beast!”","Li Moying shook his head and laughed, “No need to worry, that was just a virtual image of the spiritual beast thoughts being trapped here. It had been so many years and it could at most preserve ten percent of its actual ability! Plus the compatibility of the attribute, dealing with it wasn’t especially difficult.”","Huang Yueli stared at him, “Do you think I’m a fool? Using these words to coax and lying to me! You really think that I couldn’t tell that you almost got into trouble initially! Look at all these wounds on you.....”","She used her hand to rub Li Moying’s largest wound on his chest, making that man suck in a deep breath of cold air immediately.","Even though he was able to neutralise most of the thunder attributed profound energy which had caused damage but those electric currents still caused damage to his physical body and that was something unavoidable.","Now, there were numerous external injuries on his body and some of these malicious wounds were still bleeding.","But it merely looked serious on the surface only."]},{"number":1462,"title":"Chapter 1462 - Li Moying’s thunder attribute (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1462: Li Moying’s thunder attribute (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","To a practitioner, this standard of external injury was easily healed.","Seeing his little fiancée getting so worried and anxious, Li Moying was touched but he also found it a little comical.","“Alright, alright, stop being so tense. The injuries I’ve suffered in the past were much heavier than this and you were never that tensed! Now what happened?”","Huang Yueli retorted angrily, “That... how could that be the same??”","The smile in Li Moying’s eyes grew deeper as he leaned in closer to her speaking out softly, “What’s not the same?”","Huang Yueli felt her face burning up due to his closing in and at the same time felt embarrassed from his question.","Not the same, of course not the same.","She hated this man in the initial stages in her past life, feeling that his character was too overbearing and he didn’t know how to respect her. Furthermore, he was extremely full of himself, thinking that since he was the number one top expert in Soaring Heavens Continent, then she must marry him?","So during that time when he was injured because of her, she would silently say that he deserved it!","But not too long after, her feelings underwent a change.....","Li Moying saw her silence and roughly guessed the thinking in her mind as his lips gave off a gentle smile, slowly leaning in closer to her.","Just as their lips were about to meet, Huang Yueli suddenly regained her senses as she subconsciously pushed him at his chest area.","“Ssssssss——”","Li Moying immediately gave a sharp cry as his expression became twisted from the pain, “Li’er, you... are you trying to murder your own husband!”","Huang Yueli realised that she had done something wrong as she bit her lips in embarrassment. Earlier she got a little too worked up and had forgotten the fact that Li Moying was still injured. Especially the wounds on his chest area were not just a little, so this push probably made that man want to throw up blood right?","She hurriedly retrieved medication pills from the Sky Phoenix Ring and stuffed it into his mouth while explaining, “This Blood Inducing Pill is most effective for treating excessive bleeding symptoms! And this Nine Karlgren Intermittent Ointment is for applying on your external wounds. Quickly apply some, it’s really very effective. If it’s purely an external wound, you’d recover completely within three days, not leaving any scars behind!”","Looking at his own fiancée’s anxious expression, Li Moying felt a warmth rising in his heart.","Huang Yueli did a basic first aid treatment on Li Moying’s wounds and later on as she still wasn’t rest assured, she kept asking him on his condition.","Li Moying hurriedly replied, “Rest assured, I’m really fine and I won’t take my own body as a joke! First stop busying yourself. Now that the secret room’s door is finally opened, shouldn’t we be taking a look inside to see what’s hidden in it?”","“Ah right, treasure!” Huang Yueli jumped up only to recall that she had forgotten the most important thing!","She hurriedly turned around and ran towards the secret room.","Li Moying looked at her departing figure comically as he shook his head.","How would his little money grubber miss any chance usually to make money from the treasures? But now because of the fact that he was injured, this young lass had completely forgotten about the treasure which was within reach and had been intertwining on that little injury of his.....","He especially liked this arrogantly pampered hypocrisy!","After the Qilin’s virtual image had been crushed by Li Moying, the secret room’s door had opened up entirely.","Although Huang Yueli was anxious to see what was inside but she was after all an experienced practitioner so she remembered that she had to act carefully and cautiously.","As she walked, she kept on checking the distribution of the surrounding mechanisms, ruling out the various dangers that could possibly exist."]},{"number":1463,"title":"Chapter 1463 - Li Moying’s thunder attribute (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1463: Li Moying’s thunder attribute (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying was especially reassured while he followed behind her as the two of them walked into the room.","This secret room looked extremely ordinary on the exterior but upon walking inside, they discovered that its space was much bigger than what they had imagined.","The place nearer to the door had two vertical rows of altars raised high up and each row laid sixth pieces of Profound Armaments in order.","These Profound Armaments were all ninth tier upper grade armaments and the six pieces were a set. One was for increasing attack power while the other was to increase defence.","Huang Yueli walked to the front and when she saw these, her eyes instantly lit up!","To tell the truth, the refinement of ninth grade Profound Armaments was a difficult process for each piece and in the past hundred years or so in Soaring Heavens Continent, only she was able to refine it.","Needless to say, ninth grade Profound Armaments set was to refine all six pieces into an entire set. The amount of Profound Energy exhausted was not a mere simple six folds but at least a total of twenty to thirty folds!","This astonishing exhaustion was something that even Huang Yueli could not afford. So she could at most refine a three piece set of ninth tier lower grade armament and that was already a top range quality Profound Armament within Soaring Heavens Continent.","Whereas for now, appearing right here was a six piece ninth tier upper grade Profound Armament set! If one could equip oneself with those at the same time, it would probably exhibit the same effect as a half God Relic!","The value of it was something which didn’t require more talking.","“That’s great, I knew it. For a large clan like the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the things that they left behind in the mystic region must be good stuff! We haven’t made a wasted trip this time round!”","Her mood was extremely good and she stretched out her hand to pick up the Profound Armaments on the alter one piece after another and after observing it for a moment, she blatantly kept it in her own space, not leaving a single piece for Li Moying.","Li Moying totally treated as though nothing had happened as he smiled lightly standing behind her. Seeing her moving excitedly to explore around the place, he kept his security senses tight just in case some accidents happened and he was still able to react in time to protect his Li’er.","Huang Yueli kept all the Profound Armaments carefully and turned back to take a look at him, asking curiously, “Why? You let me keep it all away? Aren’t you going to ask me what I want to do with it?”","Speaking of that, these ninth tier upper grade Profound Armaments were all of the thunder attribute, the main reason probably being the fact that most of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were of thunder attribute!","So the most suitable person to use them was Li Moying. If Huang Yueli were to use them, she might not be able to exhibit even half of the effects at all.","Moreover speaking, when both of them entered the mystic region, Huang Yueli didn’t say anything as she just kept everything away. If it was another person, he would have had a huge fight with her over it long ago!","Even a biological father, son or brothers would turn into foes immediately!","Li Moying gave a disapproving smile as he replied, “You have your reasons for taking it. Perhaps after it went through your hands, the power of the Profound Armament would become even stronger and I’d be the one gaining the advantage.....”","Huang Yueli heard that and knew that this man’s heart was linked to hers as he could tell her intentions in one look.","Although she wasn’t able to use the ninth tier upper grade Profound Armament set, but as a ninth rank Armament Master, she was extremely interested in the structure and refining method of the Profound Armament so she was thinking of doing some research on it before giving it to Li Moying.","Besides that, Huang Yueli had collected some ancient methods to attach magic onto the ninth tier Profound Armaments and after she had treated it successfully, she would return it to Li Moying. The effects would definitely be much better than now.","She was thinking of that in her heart and did not say it out but she had not expected that Li Moying had already guessed her motive."]},{"number":1464,"title":"Chapter 1464 - This is your Mistress (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli felt very happy but she was still expressing her coquetry on the surface, “Who said I was going to give it to you? I’m keeping it for my own collection!”","Li Moying gave a warm and gentle smile, “Alright, alright, you can keep it as long as you’re happy. Anyway I am yours as well, all yours!”","Huang Yueli swept him a glance as she wanted to continue being arrogantly pampered but her lips uncontrollably rose up to an arc.","Just as the both of them were speaking, suddenly a soft whimpering was heard from the inner part of the room, sounding like a little kitten mewing.","In that quiet and serene room with such a strange sound being released, it made Li Moying and Huang Yueli stunned for a moment as they immediately shut their mouths up at the same time as they searched everywhere for the origin of the sound.","Very quickly, they noticed a small tall counter in the deepest part of the secret room. But due to the dim light inside, they could only faintly see the tall counter being covered by a scarlet red rug but unable to tell what thing was on the counter.","They exchanged a glance and saw the astonished look in each other’s eyes.","Huang Yueli said, “What’s that? It feels like... some kind of living thing? Let’s quickly head over and take a look!”","As she said that, she turned around and wanted to walk over but her wrist was held on tightly by Li Moying as he wrestled her back.","“Wait, what are you so anxious about? This secret room is filled with mechanisms so aren’t you afraid that there would be danger? I’ll head over first, you follow me.” Li Moying gave her a stare.","Huang Yueli replied disapprovingly, “I’ve already cleared all the mechanisms earlier and moreover speaking, I can judge by myself. I’m an Armament Master, and.... alright, you go first.....”","Li Moying gave her another stare and Huang Yueli felt rather guilty as she pouted and her voice grew softer and softer.","Li Moying let go of her as he headed up first.","This room was very deep inside so sunlight couldn’t reach in at all. It was virtually covered in pitch darkness in the deepest end.","Li Moying stretched out his arm as he casually waved his arm and a bright light lit up, instantly splitting into eight sparks, slowly separating out into the eight different directions as it hovered in mid-air.","This move made Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up!","To be able to grasp such good control of fire attributed elements meant that this man’s fire attribute innate talent was extremely shocking. Even though he couldn’t be compared to her, but he had at least ninth grade and above.....","Li Moying’s innate talent in this life was indeed much more powerful than in his past life....","Suddenly she heard that weak whimpering sound again as she turned her head urgently towards the tall counter.","This time with the aid of the sparks, they could distinctly see a small bundle under the red rug, as it kept on trembling. Evidently it was a living little thing.","Huang Yueli sensed something and observed the surrounding situation. After she made sure that there was no problem, she shot upwards like an arrow and lifted up the rug.","Underneath the rug laid a small little magical beast which curled up. It was only a foot long and its entire body was filled with fine scales. But its scales were still rather fine and soft and those little pieces were exceptionally dazzling. Under the surrounding fire sparks, it radiated with brilliant lights which was extremely beautiful.","Huang Yueli took a look and revealed a delighted expression.","“Wow, this is a little Qilin? It’s so pretty!! So adorable!!”","She stretched out her hand and wanted to carry the little Qilin but whoever knew that her slender fair finger was just about to touch that dazzling scale when she suddenly felt an enormous amount of energy exploding from that little Qilin!","She was caught unawares and immediately sent flying back from the shock!"]},{"number":1465,"title":"Chapter 1465 - This is your Mistress (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s body was sent flying back in a split second.","Li Moying had always been watching her in full concentration and alertness and on seeing this, he immediately moved!","His figure turned into a dash of brilliant light which was so shockingly fast and managed to catch hold of her before Huang Yueli crashed onto the wall.","Huang Yueli crashed heavily onto her own fiancé’s chest and she had yet to settle her shock when she heard the man’s dull moan from behind. She hurriedly turned over and asked anxiously, “Ah.... Moying, you... are you alright?”","“I’m fine, the one in trouble is you!”","Li Moying stared fiercely at her and on seeing her pulling back her shoulder pitifully, he was still not appeased as he couldn’t help but pinch her nose, turning it all red.","Huang Yueli hurriedly covered her nose, “Boo hoo, now you’re conducting domestic violence? I’m really so pitiful!”","“You’re pitiful? I’m the one who’s pitiful! I told you ten million of times that you must be careful! It’s merely just a little Qilin, what’s there to be excited about?” Li Moying replied her in an upset tone.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but rebutted, “What do you mean by ‘just’ a little Qilin! This is an ancient spiritual beast! Don’t tell me you don’t know what a young sapling of a spiritual beast means in Soaring Heavens Continent? I’ve grown until this big and only seen an ancient spiritual beast in drawings!”","Li Moying gave her a chilly stare, “You don’t even draw up a draft when you’re bullshitting, only seen it on drawings? Then what’s that stupid bird called Wang Cai?”","“Ughh...” Huang Yueli was speechless as she stomped her feet, “You’re intentionally picking on me! Anyway, other than Wang Cai, have you ever seen any other living spiritual beasts? Even if it’s Wang Cai, it’s merely just a spiritual body! Whereas this.... is a living ancient spiritual beast!”","She intentionally emphasized once again as she added, “Moreover, it’s so cute.....”","Li Moying was flabbergasted but he also understood that what Huang Yueli said was correct.","The sapling of an ancient spiritual beast, if he nurtured it properly, it would become a powerful aid in future!","Especially after their rebirths, no matter in terms of their cultivation or the backing behind them, it was totally incomparable to their past lives. They needed to resume back to the peak and to find out the mastermind who harmed Huang Yueli then, so powerful battle power was definitely required.","With this little Qilin, it indeed was doubling their power!","Li Moying hugged Huang Yueli and let her just, “Alright, let me do it! You worrisome young lass, move aside!”","Huang Yueli anxiously followed behind him, “You... be careful! Earlier I went to hug that little Qilin and had already observed carefully. There aren’t any special mechanisms in the surroundings so it’s the little Qilin’s spiritual power which expelled me! Although it had been sealed away for so many years, it’s ability is definitely not ordinary so you must be very... careful.....”","Huang Yueli had not yet completed her sentence when her eyes suddenly widened as it was filled with indescribable shock.","She saw Li Moying walk over to the tall counter in big steps. He first observed the surroundings and after hearing Huang Yueli mentioned that there weren’t any mechanisms, he directly reached his hand out towards that little Qilin.","His action was very gentle, very slow and moreover he had worked up his Profound Energy, preparing for a fierce battle at any point of time.","But reality was out of their expectations.","When Li Moying’s finger touched that little Qilin, he didn’t feel any resistance, or perhaps..... it could be said that he didn’t feel any Profound Energy fluctuations at all."]},{"number":1466,"title":"Chapter 1466 - This is your Mistress (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","He stretched out both hands as he directly held the little Qilin and lifted it up.","For the entire duration, the entire process was unexpectedly smooth and he totally didn’t show any signs of expulsion.","Huang Yueli was totally dazed upon seeing this scenario and after some time, she walked up and said in a dissatisfied tone, “What’s going on? How could it be like this? Why is it that you can hug it while I was being rejected in such a harsh manner!”","Li Moying replied, “Well....”","He was about to say something when he felt the little thing in his hand suddenly nudged.","Little Qilin’s body shook several times in his hand and slowly opened its eyes.","That pair of clear and lively crystal like eyes was bright and sparkly as brilliant lights radiated from it, merging as one with its gorgeous scales on its body.","“Wow...”","Huang Yueli was just about to exclaim that this little thing was just too adorable but she had not expected that immediately after the little Qilin opened its eyes, it turned its head towards Li Moying and stuck out its little tongue, licking Li Moying’s palm several times.","This obedient look was just too adorable.","Huang Yueli instantly forgot to lecture it as she stretched out her hand wanting to touch it.","Whoever knew, this time was exactly the same as previous. Her finger had yet touched the little Qilin when she felt a huge wave of energy coming at her! Luckily she was prepared this round and managed to retract her hand in time while retreating several steps, getting rid of that strength.","“This... what situation is this??” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened like full moons.","“Aw aw.....” Little Qilin raised its head and cried out in her direction.","Although she didn’t understand the Qilin language, but just from the tone alone, Huang Yueli could instinctively tell that this little Qilin was filled with disgust towards her...","Li Moying couldn’t help but laughed out.","Honestly speaking, he had never seen Huang Yueli putting on such a deflated expression in front of a spiritual pet. Because she had always been given the gift of attracting young saplings since her past life. She was especially able to gain various high levelled magical beasts younglings’ favourable impression and she would always receive various spiritual pets when she went on experience learning.","It was Li Moying whose nature was cold hence many young magical beasts were afraid of him. Those spiritual pets which were contracted by him were usually coerced by his power and not out of their own willingness, unlike Huang Yueli who had many spiritual pets coming over to request for her to accept them.","This was the first time that this little Qilin actually liked Li Moying so much, and on the contrary, hated Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli’s face turned black, “You still dare to laugh! What bewitching soup did you give this little thing??”","Li Moying hurriedly replied, “I’m innocent, I didn’t do anything at all.... there’s probably a reason why it doesn’t like you, probably because..... ah!”","He was talking halfway when he felt a sharp pain from his wrist as he couldn’t help but cried out in alarm.","The two of them lowered their heads and saw little Qilin after licking Li Moying several times, suddenly revealing its sharp fangs as it bit down hard on his wrist!","Little Qilin’s fangs were exceptionally sharp and in an instance, it had caused Li Moying to be injured.","A malicious wound appeared on his wrist as blood started to flow outwards.","Little Qilin leaned its head over and licked several mouthfuls of blood. At the same time, it’s body started to change evidently.","Seeing its body slowly turning huge, almost inflating to twice its length, the scales also obviously turning harder.","It raised its head and gave a loud roar resplendently!"]},{"number":1467,"title":"Chapter 1467 - This is your Mistress (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Roar——-!!!”","A bright voice broke the room’s silence and little Qilin’s scales gave off a blinding radiance!","Li Moying’s expression turned grave as he pursed his lips and his right hand gathered a dim blue purplish glow, drawing out a blinding mark in mid-air!","The speed of his movements was extremely fast and within three breaths of time, he had already struck out ten over incantation gestures!","Little Qilin followed his actions and moved its little head to the left and right, while giving off an “aw aw aw” cry on and off.","Lastly, it spat out a sliver of blood essence from its mouth, merging into one with the array pattern which Li Moying had drawn.","A bright light bridge connected between the man and beast. That light bridge only flashed once and disappeared soon after.","Following that, little Qilin seemed as though it had instantly exhausted all the energy within as its little brain drooped downwards, leaning against Li Moying’s arm, totally not moving as though it was asleep. It’s body size also started to shrink, returning back to the original size when Huang Yueli had just discovered it.","Huang Yueli was originally stunned but very quickly she realised was happening so she didn’t dared to move or made any sound, worried that she might interrupt this one man and one beast.","It was until now that she opened her mouth, “You... you actually contracted this little Qilin!! Moreover it automatically bit your skin to contract with you!!”","Li Moying’s lips curled into a smile as he kept caressing little Qilin’s scales on its back admiringly, “Didn’t you say that I’m so fierce and no young magical beast would like me? See, there’s still some little thing which knows my value, knowing that following a owner like me will give it a bright future!”","Huang Yueli seemed as though her pained spot was stepped on by him as she replied in an unresigned manner, “What do you mean? Earlier that was a coincidence, a coincidence! It must have been you who used some scheme or trickery to lure this little thing, otherwise how could it possibly only like you and not like me?”","Saying that, she reached out her hand for the third time, attempting to carry this little Qilin.","Whoever knew that the minute she closed in, little Qilin suddenly awoke and its little head rose up as it looked at her in full alert while giving off an “aw aw” cry, obviously threatening her not to come nearer!","Huang Yueli’s face turned green.","Li Moying couldn’t endure it and laughed, “I told you, it doesn’t like you!”","Huang Yueli gave him a stare while feeling extremely unhappy, could it be that she had no more charm left? Even a small animal didn’t like her and her fiancé kept on teasing her!","Seeing his little fox’s upset expression, Li Moying realised that he had gone overboard. As though he was really afraid that she was really angry, he hurriedly leaned over and said, “Li’er, really angry? I’m just joking around. This little Qilin doesn’t like you probably isn’t your problem but there’s a real reason to it.”","Huang Yueli asked curiously, “What? What’s the reason?”","Li Moying explained, “Do you still remember that when we first entered the mystic region, what the old fellow Cui Yuan Shan said? He said this mystic region was left behind by an ancient God clan Cloudy Qilin Clan and that this clam seemed to have some feud with the Sacred Phoenix Race.... According to the records in the ancient manuals, various God clans would rear a certain spiritual beast and this Qilin is obviously reared by the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It doesn’t like a young lass from Sacred Phoenix Race which is a very normal thing.”","Huang Yueli heard his explanation and immediately understood the reason.","When Cui Yuan Shan was introducing the situation in Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, he had really mentioned this matter."]},{"number":1468,"title":"Chapter 1468 - This is your Mistress (5)","paragraphs":["It wasn’t wrong to say that.","It was just that they didn’t know what feud had between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Race, that even a tiny spiritual beast wasn’t willing to see her?","Furthermore, the more she thought, the more unreconciled she felt.","This pretty little thing was discovered by her first! She merely wanted to caress it only, and it actually didn’t allow her to do so!","She felt very tired.....","Her despondent and disappointed expression looked a little pitiful.","Li Moying shook his head as he smiled, stretching out his hand to tease the little Qilin around his arm as he opened his mouth, “Little thing, do you see this beautiful sister? She’s your Mistress and if she doesn’t like you, neither will I. So you have to listen to her obediently, do you understand?”","Little Qilin’s two round eyes bore a shocked expression as it kept giving out an “aw aw” cry.","Spiritual beasts were excellent with human nature. It was easy to tell by just looking at little Wang Cai arguing with Huang Yueli every day.","Although Little Qilin was still young but understanding what Li Moying said was no issue at all. Hearing its new Master’s request, it was both upset and anxious, as it tried its best to stomp its little feet.","Huang Yueli totally couldn’t understand what it was trying to say and could only sense its extreme repulsion towards her. As she was feeling stuffed, she felt repulsive about everything that Li Moying did.","Li Moying quietly listened for a moment. After he and little Qilin had formed a contract, he was able to use his soul trace to communicate with it.","Not knowing what the man and beast communicated, Li Moying went silent for a moment and continued speaking, “No matter what, she’s my fiancée and your Mistress. If you still want to follow me around with the contract and leave this lousy mystic region, then you must respect her.”","Little Qilin drooped its head immediately, apparently not expecting its owner to be so overbearing!","It was an ancient spiritual beast with esteemed bloodline!","But it actually couldn’t be compared to a woman who made one disgusted??","However, circumstances were stronger than a man. Li Moying was now it’s real owner and no matter how it disliked Huang Yueli, there was no way it could go against its owner.","Li Moying raised his arm and carried little Qilin over to Huang Yueli.","This time when Huang Yueli stretched out her hand to touch it, although little Qilin still drooped its head with an unwilling look, but it had no choice but to control itself to lay flat on Li Moying’s palm, allowing Huang Yueli to caress it in any way she liked.","Huang Yueli originally was curious about how those beautiful scales felt like but on seeing little Qilin putting on such an unhappy expression, her mood suddenly came and directly carried that thing over and started all sorts of ravage, rubbing and rolling her between her hands, pinching and kneading it.","Li Moying knew that she was using this opportunity to vent her anger as he almost burst out laughing.","Huang Yueli was playing around with it when she suddenly cried out, “Right, this little thing still doesn’t have a name yet! I’m its Mistress so can I give it a name?”","Her eyes suddenly turned huge as she stared at Li Moying.","Li Moying originally wouldn’t reject her but since she put on a deliberate act of cuteness, it made his heart go soft as he immediately nodded his head, “Of course, what name do you want to give it?”","“About this.....” Her eyeballs rolled around.","Little Qilin suddenly had a bad premonition as it hurriedly struggled to climb away from her hand, crying non stop.","However, Huang Yueli had a tight hold over it as she continued, “Mn, look at its pretty scales which are gleaming with gold sparkles, it looks like it’s very good at inviting wealth..... let’s just gain a complimentary remark, call it IFa Cai!”"]},{"number":1469,"title":"Chapter 1469 - This is your Mistress (6)","paragraphs":["When little Qilin heard this name, it’s eyes opened wide as though it was struck by lightning as it looked at its owner in grief, hoping that he could help it gain back some justice to stop this abnormal bad woman.","Whoever knew.....","“Pffffft!” Li Moying directly spurted as he choked on his saliva.","Following that, the words he said directly shattered Little Qilin’s heart, “Alright, it’s really a good name. I express extreme like for it! Then in future.... Fa Cai will be the newest member in our family!”","He knew that little Qilin’s name wasn’t going to be any way nice but since the Phoenix was named Wang Cai 1 and the Qilin was named Fa Cai 1....which..... which was rather normal... right?","But no matter what it’s named, as long as he could coax his fiancée, what would a little sacrifice for the little Qilin matter?","Huang Yueli heard his compliments and her mood indeed lifted up. Especially when she saw the little Qilin bearing a pitiful expression as though it was about to faint, she felt especially pleasurable!","Hmpf, who asked you to go against me. There hadn’t been any spiritual pet which hadn’t been dealt with by this Sister! It was the same for a spiritual pet!","Huang Yueli ravaged little Qilin for a moment more.","Li Moying saw that little Qilin was just too pitiful and finally gave it a little sympathy as he carried it away.","Huang Yueli already had enough fun so she didn’t make any resistance.","He looked at Li Moying caressing little Qilin and suddenly, she seemed to have recalled something as she revealed a shocked look.","“Right, this little thing doesn’t like me but likes you so much. Could it be that.... you’re the descendant of this Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Li Moying was stunned, “Why would you think in that way?”","Huang Yueli was originally just letting her thoughts run wild and just spoke her mind but being counter asked by him, the more she thought, the higher the possibility she felt it was true.","“Don’t you feel that things just happened too coincidentally? You’re of the thunder attribute and earlier when we were at the secret room entrance, that Qilin’s virtual image could not even hurt you. Doesn’t that mean that your thunder attribute innate talent is so high that it’s enough to conquer the Qilin spiritual beast? But why do you have this kind of innate talent? There are only that many practitioner families in Soaring Heavens Continent but none of their innate talents are comparable to yours. Don’t you think you’re very ridiculous?”","“In the past I didn’t understand but now thinking of it, it is possible that it’s because you’re a descendant of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The Cloudy Qilin Clan rears Qilins and that already shows that the most powerful genius in the clan must have innate talent which could suppress the spiritual beasts in order to make them submit. If you have Cloudy Qilin Clan’s blood, then it is understandable for you to have such innate talent.”","“Moreover speaking, my Wang Cai also mentioned that the bloodline in you is extremely powerful, so much that even he feels fearful.....”","She slowly recollected her memories, feeling that all the bits and pieces of the puzzle were linking the same truth.","However after Li Moying finished listening, he shook his head, “This is merely your imagination. It’s virtually impossible to ascertain how it is in reality.”","“Why is there no way to ascertain?” Huang Yueli pointed at little Qilin in his arms, “Doesn’t this little thing here not know anything?”","Li Moying shook his head immediately, “Little thing’s age is too young. It said that it had just been born for a few days and was sealed here immediately. I’ve attempted to interact with it earlier but it doesn’t seem to know anything at all. It only said that the thunder attribute on me is extremely powerful, making it felt a sense of familiarity hence it made a contract with me.”","“Isn’t it obvious from what the Qilin said? What’s called familiarity? This little Qilin had never left the Cloudy Qilin clan’s turf since birth! Only Cloudy Qilin clan’s clansmen would let it feel familiar isn’t it?”"]},{"number":1470,"title":"Chapter 1470 - Something seemed to have happened (1)","paragraphs":["Li Moying frowned slightly, “This.....”","Huang Yueli could tell that he was wavering as she immediately added, “Now that we’re in the historical ruins of Cloudy Qilin Clan, perhaps we might be able to find some evidence to prove your bloodline! If you’re really a descendant of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, then perhaps there is some inheritance within the mystic region which only you, will be able to get! Just like the inheritance which I obtained in the Inheritance Tower!”","Huang Yueli was exhilarated as she spoke, apparently very excited and couldn’t wait to tug Li Moying along to search for the inheritance.","However, after Li Moying heard that, he replied in an expressionless look, “Li’er, I think you might have mislooked a very important matter. If I’m really from the Cloudy Qilin Clan..... then you’re from the Sacred Phoenix Race.”","Huang Yueli blinked as she asked puzzledly, “What do you mean?”","Li Moying replied, “Although we do not know what deep feud there is between these two clans, but even Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Qilin doesn’t want to see you. If we managed to go to God Realm one day, won’t the two of us be separated?”","Huang Yueli went into a blank for a moment and started smiling, “I saw.... you still say I’m thinking too much. I think you’re the one who thinks too much! It’s still too early to say if we can ascend to God Realm! In your past life, haven’t you spent several decades of time but still unable to breakthrough to the tenth stage realm? But...”","She suddenly bared her sharp little tiger fangs as she gave a crafty smile, “If there’s really someone who wants to separate us, what will you do?”","Li Moying looked at his little fox’s smile as his heart shook and pulled her into his arms.","He leaned in close to Huang Yueli’s lips and gave a deep laugh, “If there’s one such day... then we’ll elope! What do you think?”","“Elope? It seems so exciting eh?” Huang Yueli smiled sweetly.","Li Moying couldn’t help but leaned over and kissed her on her lips.","Little Qilin was clamped in between the two of them as it struggled furiously, using it’s short nails on its little claws to scratch against Li Moying’s arm but was totally unable to stop the intimacy between the two lovers.","As there was no one around and little Qilin had no beast rights, so Huang Yueli didn’t act as coquettish as usual as she stretched out her arms and circled it around Li Moying’s neck, obediently accepting his demanding kiss.","The two of them had never thought that Li Moying’s casual words would be realised one day in future.....","After a long time, Li Moying finally released the young lady in his arms.","Huang Yueli’s face was flushed red as she rolled her eyes at him, “Carry your Fa Cai properly! I’m going over to take a look if we’ve left out any treasures!”","She made a round in the secret room and discovered several bottles of eighth grade medicinal pills as she kept it away carefully.","Turning back, she discovered a small notebook in Li Moying’s hand as he was flipping the pages, reading it.","She curiously leaned closed to him, “What are you reading?”","Li Moying was reading as he replied, I found a notebook underneath the rug and it talks about some things to pay attention to when rearing a Qilin.”","Huang Yueli heard that and hurriedly replied, “That’s great, there’s actually a guide for rearing! Quickly keep it properly and adhere strictly to what the notebook says. Don’t even let Fa Cai be nurtured into a picky eater and lack of manners is a no-no, especially disrespecting its owner!”","As she was saying that, she gritted her teeth as she recalled that disobedient little Wang Cai.","Luckily she had stuffed him into the Sky Phoenix Ring. Otherwise if a phoenix entered the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s turf, he would turn the sky around!","Li Moying laughed as he shook his head, keeping both the little Qilin and notebook away."]},{"number":1471,"title":"Chapter 1471 - Something seemed to have happened (2)","paragraphs":["After verifying that nothing valuable was left, the both of them left the secret room.","There were at least a hundred and eighty rooms in the cave dwelling but Li Moying and Huang Yueli were people with extremely high sights so after they ransacked the most valuable treasures in the room, they weren’t interested in the leftovers and couldn’t be bothered to waste any time to enter room by room to check.","The minute they reached the cave dwelling’s entrance, Huang Yueli effortlessly activated the array as the both of them walked out together.","Outside the cave dwelling, there was no sight of Green Cloud Sect’s disciples anywhere. Thinking of it, it seemed that they knew they had no more chances to enter so they had all dispersed.","“Alright, now where shall we go?” Huang Yueli turned her head back as she asked.","Li Moying thought for a moment before replying, “We’ve basically taken a look at the eastern part of the mystic region so why not.... Let’s go for a tour around the west side.”","Huang Yueli had no objections and the both of them set off towards the west side of the mystic region.","...","Seven days later.","Seven to eight eye piercing light rays flashed past in the sky and a seventh tier Blood Feather Eagle was struck consecutively by the light rays, giving out a miserable shriek in mid-air as it fell head first onto the ground.","Huang Yueli kept applauding, “Moying, you’re just too amazing! Too handsome and suave! Now can I go and dig my ores?”","Li Moying nodded, “There shouldn’t be any danger so come on over.”","Huang Yueli hurriedly ran over as she retrieved some tools from her space and started scrapping on the mountain wall.","At this moment, a bright white light flashed across the sky from a distance away. The white ray disappeared in an instance but the area where the white light had appeared caused streams of uninterrupted white smoke.","When Li Moying saw this, his body immediately turned stiff.","“Li’er, something seemed to have happened...”","Huang Yueli’s back was facing him and she had not noticed the white ray flashing by as she turned her head back in astonishment when she heard that, “What’s the matter?”","Li Moying pointed to a distance far away, “Did you see that? That’s Celestial Light Sect’s flare signal! Further from the colour of it, it seems to be Jiyun’s flare signal! He must have met a life and death crisis!”","Before entering the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, Sect Master Murong had given each direct disciple a piece of signal flare. It was given so that if they met with a life and death crisis in the mystic region, they could ask for timely help from their same sect members.","But Huang Yueli always had her suspicions regarding the usefulness of this kind of signal flares.","Because if they were to meet with danger, it would be pretty good if their same sect disciples didn’t try to scheme that person, so how many of them would risk their lives to save another person? Moreover to waste their time seeking for opportunities in the mystic region?","Even Huang Yueli herself would not go save someone who wasn’t related to her.","So every since entering this place, Huang Yueli had specially collected the signal flares from Mo Yi and the rest of the practitioners whom she was closer with, remodified it and redistributed it back to them.","Those signal flares which had been remodified by her, when lit, would be different from ordinary signal flares. By the smoke, they could easily differentiate who was the owner of the signal flare.","Huang Yeuli followed the direction of Li Moying’s finger and her expression changed immediately, “That’s right, it is indeed Junior Brother Luo! What on earth has happened to him?”","Li Moying replied, “Jiyun had set his heart on experience learning properly. If it wasn’t some life threatening situation, he wouldn’t light up the signal flare easily. Looks like his situation is precarious so I must immediately head over now!”","Huang Yueli nodded her head, “Alright, the matter cannot be delayed any further, let’s head over now!”","Li Moying heard that and his footsteps halted, “You’re going along with me?”"]},{"number":1472,"title":"Chapter 1472 - Something seemed to have happened (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli casted a glance at him, feeling that what he asked was redundant.","“Of course, don’t tell me you want to leave me behind?”","Li Moying replied hesitantly, “I.... of course I don’t want to leave you behind. But a place which could leave Jiyun in a life threatening situation might be dangerous, so I’m worried....”","Huang Yueli raised her chin up as she replied unhappily, “Stop looking down on me! My ability is much stronger than Luo Jiyun! Moreover, I’m worried too. The more dangerous the place is, the more I cannot let you go alone! With such a high levelled Armament Master like me following you to battle, you should just feel glad about it! Alright, stop with the crap, do you wish to save Junior Brother Luo or not!”","Li Moying looked at her deeply in the eye.","Even though his heart was extremely unwilling but he knew that he could not stop her.","“Forget it, so be it if you must tag along. But, if there’s danger.... Forget it. Treat as though I didn’t say anything, let’s go!”","Li Moying originally wanted to tell her that if there was any danger, she should run off first but thinking that saying these were useless because there would be no way that young lass would run off first, so he might as well swallow back his words.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled upwards as she left alongside him.","The direction of the white smoke spiralling was on the other end of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region.","The two of them raced for the entire journey and the more they raced, the stranger they felt. Because Luo Jiyun’s position was much further than they thought and it was extremely close to the centre region of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region.","“Strange, why would Junior Brother Luo run off to such a central area? Hadn’t Sect Master Murong already reminded everyone before entering the mystic region that the more central the location is, the more dangerous it gets! Doesn’t he know his own ability? He still dared to run off everywhere?” Huang Yueli frowned.","Li Moying’s expression slowly turned grave, “This fellow.... He’s really too reckless! Perhaps he really ran into some huge trouble this time round! Don’t run off so quickly, follow right behind me!”","Huang Yueli knew her own limits and when she heard that, she slowed down her speed, letting Li Moying go ahead of her.","Li Moying became exceptionally cautious as he stopped speeding head first, but carefully observed the surrounding terrain.","The two of them ran for another twenty over miles.","Huang Yueli suddenly cried out, “Look! There’s the remains of a signal flare on the ground. That must have been left behind by Junior Brother Luo, he should have let out this signal flare from this area!”","Li Moying walked up quickly as he picked up the external shell of the signal flare then looking around everywhere.","There was no sight of Luo Jiyun anywhere.","But, he quickly noticed markings of a fight on the ground.","His pitch black brows creased together, “What on earth is going on? Jiyun was in a battle and let out the signal flare but in the end, he’s not here?”","Huang Yueli also pointed to those markings as she said, “The battle that happened here must have been extremely intense. Look at those big trees on the ground. The tree trunks are so thick but yet a lot of these trees have fallen onto the ground. There are many disoriented footprints on the ground and so much blood has been spilled.... Junior Brother Luo is probably heavily injured!”","Li Moying apparently understood this as well as his heart felt exceptionally heavy.","Among so many Junior Brothers and Junior Sisters, his relationship with Luo Jiyun was the deepest.","Because Luo Jiyun’s character had been the most naïve and his guts had always been the smallest. Since young he was always bullied by Murong Ni and the rest so Li Moying personally guided him a lot, forcing him to grow up slowly.","In Li Moying’s heart, Luo Jiyun was no different from his own biological little brother."]},{"number":1473,"title":"Chapter 1473 - Something seemed to have happened (4)","paragraphs":["Now, Luo Jiyun had met with danger and his life and death was unknown which really made him extremely worried.","But although he was worried, his rationality had not vanished.","Li Moying’s character was normally cold and stern so no matter what kind of situation he encountered, he was always able to maintain his calm. It would usually be matters concerning Huang Yueli’s safety which would make him lose control.","Right now, he observed the situation around him and very quickly he came out with a conclusion.","“The blood stains on the ground aren’t only Jiyun’s. Those blood stains over there are obviously left behind from magical beasts. Looks like Jiyun had provoked a high levelled magical beast! They should have ran off towards the east side, so let’s head over to have a look! Follow me closely!”","Li Moying pointed to the east side, indicating Huang Yueli to chase up to his steps.","Although he was worried about Huang Yueli taking the risk with him but the both of them had already reached this place hence leaving Huang Yueli at this place where the high levelled magical beast had been before, it was definitely not safe so it was much better to leave her beside him!","The two of them walked one after another following the blood stains as they chased over.","Huang Yueli utilised her Agility Dance Steps, following tightly behind Li Moying as her slender brows creased slightly.","She didn’t know why that there was an ominous premonition in her heart but somehow there seemed to be someone who was watching them.","But every time she returned, she didn’t see anyone but didn’t know if it was her misperception.","But at the very least, they had continued to head towards the east as they entered the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region’s central region’s boundary..... heading in further would be even more dangerous.","Luo Jiyun was just too unreliable! He had actually not chosen his path properly while he was panicky. Based on his cultivation, dashing into the central region would really be asking for death!","Moreover, as the two of them kept moving into the central region, the surrounding environment had undergone changes.","The trees around the surroundings were getting lesser and lesser, but even if there was, it was just a few shrubs which didn’t have much leaves.","A strange smoke started to condense in the air as their visions became more and more blurry. The situation outside one hundred meters couldn’t be seen clearly anymore.","Huang Yueli finally couldn’t help but tugged Li Moying, “Moying, the situation here is quite abnormal, are we really going to continue probing inside?”","Li Moying’s footsteps took a halt as he frowned, “The footsteps which Jiyun left behind are headed all the way east and the blood stains left behind are more and more obvious, which means that his blood stains are even more serious. If we can’t find him before tomorrow, it would absolutely bode ill for him!”","Huang Yueli said, “But if we continue heading inside, we will really be entering the central region. Each mystic region’s central region is extremely dangerous, so based on our current ability, we must be extremely careful before proceeding!”","Li Moying turned his head back and grabbed her hands gently, “I understand! But from the blood stains on the ground, Jiyun shouldn’t have gone far, at most another few hundred meters or no, he would definitely have fallen down. He should be somewhere nearby. So we won’t be entering too deep in.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head.","Right at this moment, suddenly, a faintly indiscernible moan was heard.","Their spirits were instantly lifted.","“It’s Jiyun! He’s indeed around this area!”","“Quick! We have to hurry over and take a look!”","Li Moying and Huang Yueli exchanged glances and hastened their footsteps as they sped towards the direction of the sound.","...","What they didn’t know were several pairs of eyes tightly fixed onto their backs, right behind them.","“Damn it, why did Bai Ruoli come over as well?” Leng Yi Feng couldn’t help but frowned."]},{"number":1474,"title":"Chapter 1474 - Something seemed to have happened (5)","paragraphs":["The target who Leng Yi Feng wanted to target was Li Moying alone but he didn’t want Huang Yueli to get seriously injured.","Although Huang Yueli had disgraced him in front of everyone right in front of the cave dwelling when she decoded the array, but in Leng Yi Feng’s heart, the one who should die was Li Moying because it was this man who incited Huang Yueli!","As for Huang Yueli, she was so young, so beautiful and had outstanding innate talent so for such a talented young lady, she naturally wasn’t in the wrong!","Not only did Leng Yi Feng feel that she wasn’t in the wrong, he was even more smitten by her because of her Array Master innate talent.","They originally thought that Li Moying would know that the central region was dangerous and considering Huang Yueli’s safety, she absolutely would not bring her along. In the end, whoever would have expected that the two of them actually appeared together at this place!","This made Leng Yi Feng feel flustered.","After all, his target this time was to get Li Moying dead and to get Huang Yueli into his hands, not to make her die!","If Huang Yueli got into an accident then the gains would not make up for the losses.","Li Lingchuan totally didn’t couldn’t be bothered about Huang Yueli’s life or death but seeing Leng Yi Feng anxiety, he advised, “Can’t you still tell? Li Moying brings Bai Ruoli along wherever he goes, so it’s very normal for them to appear together. It’s great in this way too. After we have finished dealing with Li Moying, you can show yourself and save her! This is the best chance to act as a hero to save the damsel in distress!”","Leng Yi Feng thought about it and replied, “Alright, I’ll take your advice! But this Li Moying is really a piece of s***! This is such a dangerous place and he still insisted on bringing Miss Bai along, he really doesn’t know how to treasure her at all. How could he let her take this risk! Miss Bai is really too pitiful for following such a man! I must save her from the fire!”","As the two of them were discussing this, Murong Fei walked over from not too far away.","She lowered her voice as she said, “Alright, I’ve seen it with my own eyes that Fifth Senior Brother fell down from the cliff and everything had been arranged! After the matter is done, don’t forget what you promised me!”","The two of them exchanged glances and hurriedly nodded as they patted their chests as a proof of guarantee.","“Relax, after they fall down from the cliff, Mister Leng will bring Miss Bai away! Then you can tell your Eldest Senior Brother that she’s already dead. I guarantee that Li Moying won’t be able to find Bai Ruoli and this secret would never be exposed so you can take advantage of this chance to win his heart!”","“That’s right, haven’t we agreed on this beforehand? Our motives are unanimous which is to separate the both of them forever! I want Bai Ruoli and you want Li Moying, to each our gains!”","After Leng Yi Feng and Li Lingchuan formed an alliance, in order to ensure the smoothness of the plan, so they made use of Murong Fei.","But they naturally weren’t so silly to tell Murong Fei that their real motive was to kill Li Moying.","They had been cheating her, making her think that their motive was to bring Huang Yueli away. It was Murong Fei’s wishful thinking that as long as Huang Yueli left, she would have a chance but she totally didn’t think that she would be tricked by them.","Now hearing the two men’s guarantee, she didn’t suspect them as a smile finally appeared on her lips.","Hmpf, this little slut tried her best to tangle around Eldest Senior Brother, even using the trick of climbing up his bed to get engaged to him, but so what about it? Wasn’t the person who had the last laugh still her, Murong Fei?","But wasn’t Bai Ruoli’s romance too prosperous? Even a young master from a large family like Leng Yi Feng, actually wanted to get her?"]},{"number":1475,"title":"Chapter 1475 - Saving a life (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","What was so good about that wretched lass?","Murong Fei thought about it hatefully and the more she thought, the more jealous she became!","Why was it that she had gained all the advantages!","Her innate talent was strong in every aspect and she was so beautiful. Not only Li Moying treated her with deep sentiments, even a respectable young master like Leng Yi Feng was intent on getting her.....","It really was an infuriating thing to compare between them!","Murong Fei’s heart suddenly arose a thought: If only there wasn’t a Bai Ruoli, if only she could completely disappear from this world.....","This thought sizzled and infested vigorously in her mind.","Moreover, this was a heavenly chance. The central region was such a dangerous place. She only needed to rig up a scam and she would be able to let this wretched lass die in this place!","If Leng Yi Feng were to bring Huang Yueli away, perhaps she might still return but if she really died..... then she would really not be able to fight with her!","The more Murong Fei thought, the more excited she got as she started to devise the evil plan in her mind....","Two men and one lady smiled while looking at each other and seemed as though they had derived an agreement.","But in actual fact, each of them harboured designs in their own hearts.","Right now, not too far away, a flash of fire light flashed across. Especially when several claps of thunder struck across the sky, it gave out a deafening sound as it made everyone jump up in fright.","“That’s great, Li Moying seems like he’s already hooked!”","“Quickly head over and take a look!”","The three of them carefully concealed themselves as they sneaked over.","...","Huang Yueli and Li Moying headed towards the direction where Luo Jiyun cried out, and after running for a few hundred meters, they suddenly stopped.","The two revealed a shocked expression on their faces.","Because right in front of them was a cliff!","As they were nearer to the central region, the surroundings were covered by the fog and they were totally unable to see far away so they had not noticed this earlier.","The angle of the cliff was practically vertical without any slopes so it was imaginable that if they fell down, they would directly fall into the depths of the valley.","What made one even more uneasy was due to the fog, they could only see the situation several hundred meters below. It was evident that the depth of the cliff was not a mere hundred meters. How deep it was below was totally unforeseeable, hence there was no way to make any useful judgement on the condition of the cliff below.","When Li Moying saw this scenario, he frowned and shouted towards the bottom of the cliff, “Fifth Junior Brother, are you below? If you are, make a sound to let me know!”","He had just said finished when a joyous voice was heard from below, “El.... Eldest Senior Brother, it’s... it’s really you!”","Luo Jiyun sounded very weak so his voice was breathless but this bit of voice to a practitioner was enough.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief because this voice sounded not too far away from them. It seemed that Luo Jiyun had not really fallen into the bottom of the valley.","Li Moying asked again, “How is your current situation? What position are you in? Speak clearly so that we can save you!”","Luo Jiyun panted while he talked, “I.... I fell down from the other end of the mountain path. Earlier I was pursued by a seventh tier magical beast and didn’t see the road in front clearly so I rolled down directly. Luckily for me, there was a large piece of rock by the time and it blocked my fall so... so I managed to retain my life. But... But my lower body is stuck in the rock totally immovable.... However I... I have no way to climb up.”","Li Moying replied immediately, “You don’t need to worry, I’ll bring you up!”"]},{"number":1476,"title":"Chapter 1476 - Saving a life (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying turned his head and took a glance at Huang Yueli, “Li’er, I’m heading down to take a look at the situation, you stay above.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head as she drew out a coil of rope from the Sky Phoenix Ring and said, “I refined this coil of Immortal Binding Rope some time ago. It is refined using thousand year old Fiery Spider Thread and cannot be severed by Profound Weapons which are fifth tier and below. Bind it around your waist before you go down, so if you meet with any trouble, I can try to find a way to pull you up.”","Li Moying smiled as he said, “Alright, then I’ll head down right now.”","Huang Yueli tied one end of the Immortal Binding Rope to a tall old tree and later stood at the front of the cliff as she watched the coil of rope untangled slowly, as it slipped down the cliff along the way.","Although the fog was so huge that she could no longer see Li Moying’s figure but she could still see from the tautness of the rope to figure out how deep he had gone.","Huang Yueli’s eyes were fixed on the rope when suddenly, an uneasy and confused feeling became more evident in her heart.....","Her premonition had always been accurate and she wouldn’t get uneasy for no reason.","Could it be that Li Moying would get into an accident?","...","Li Moying hung on to the cliff as he went straight down. After descending for one kilometre or so, he finally caught sight of Luo Jiyun.","He was indeed in the exact situation as what he had described, stuck in between two pieces of rocks, just short of falling down.","Luckily these two rocks were huge and looked rather stable which had impacted Luo Jiyun’s descent allowing him to preserve his life.","Although this was so, but Luo Jiyun’s condition was extremely bad.","There were all sorts of injuries and wounds on him and his blood kept spurting outwards, staining his clothes entirely red. As he had lost too much blood, his complexion had turned extremely pale, especially his lips which had turned white, looking no different from a ghost.","Furthermore, the worst of all was that Li Moying could sense that the fluctuations of Luo Jiyun’s Profound Energy was extremely unstable. This was the initial sign of heavily injured meridians and furthermore his cultivation had drastically dropped, descending by a total of two small realms.","This was a perilous situation and if he wasn’t able to save him out in time, and to get on with treatment to treat the damages on his meridians, it might have a detrimental effect towards Luo Jiyun’s future cultivation.","When Luo Jiyun saw Li Moying, he was so agitated that he cried out.","He choked as he called, “Eldest Senior Brother... you... you really came to save me!”","Frankly speaking, when Luo Jiyun was stuck in mid-air, he had already been waiting for four hours and in his heart, he had already lost all hope.","Although the signal bomb was thrown out, but he really didn’t have any hope that Li Moying would really make it in time to save him.","After all he had not chosen the proper path this time while he was in a panic and accidentally barged into the central region of the mystic region, and he had entered in too deeply!","To meet with danger in such a place was like destined to be a goner. Even if it was Li Moying, if he took the risk to come save him, it would be more or less of a dead end.","Luo Jiyun was feeling regretful that he had thrown out the signal bomb because when Li Moying appeared, while he was feeling touched, he was also extremely worried that he would drag Li Moying down!","“Eldest Senior Brother, you... you shouldn’t have come... this is the central region of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, it’s... it’s too dangerous! You... you’d better hurry on and leave!”","Li Moying’s expression sank, “What joke are you cracking? It was with great difficulty that I’ve finally reached this place, just to save you! You want me to leave just like that?”"]},{"number":1477,"title":"Chapter 1477 - Saving a life (3)","paragraphs":["“B... But.....” Luo Jiyun lowered his head, “Even if you managed to save me, I... it’s difficult for me to leave by myself. My leg has already been broken into several pieces and my meridians are heavily injured so I can’t even summon up any Profound Energy, can’t.... can’t get up this cliff. This place is so far away from the peak and even if Eldest Senior Brother you, want to pull me up, it’s.... it’s almost impossible right?”","When Li Moying heard that, his brows rose and he secretly felt a little fortunate.","When he descended, he had not expected Luo Jiyun to be so seriously injured, not even able to work up any Profound Energy. If he had met with this sort of ad hoc situation, it really wasn’t easy to deal with at all.","Luckily he brought along Huang Yueli’s Immortal Binding Rope so things were much easier.","He didn’t say anything and Luo Jiyun misunderstood his intention, “Eldest Senior Brother, I know.... that this matter isn’t easy. You’d better go on up first, don’t stay around here, it’s really very dangerous! I can sense that below this cliff, there’s a horrifying existence of something and moreover.... Sometimes they would fly upwards. I... my life would be ending here anyway so Eldest Senior Brother, please don’t be dragged down by me.....”","Li Moying frowned as he cut him off, “Alright, stop nagging. I said I can save you so there’s absolutely no problem! Why> Do you feel that your Senior Brother I don’t have the means to do so?”","Luo Jiyun hurriedly shook his head, “No, it’s not that... but....”","“Stop with the buts. Where are you stuck exactly, I’ll first think of a way to pull you out.” Li Moying said.","Luo Jiyun heard the resoluteness in his voice and he knew that once Li Moying had a decision, other than Huang Yueli, everyone else can forget about changing his mind.","He could only reply, “This stone on my chest is allowing me to remain stuck in between these two rocks. I don’t dare to move. If I move, this rock will nudge and if it falls, then I too will fall.”","Li Moying heard his description and without a change in his expression, he concentrated on sizing up the rock pile which was below Luo Jiyun.","Alas, the fog below the cliff was even thicker hence the sunlight totally didn’t reflect this area hence it was especially dark. He and Luo Jiyun were only ten over meters apart but due to the angle and light, he was still unable to clearly see the situation at Luo Jiyun’s side.","Li Moying’s finger flicked and a light ray flew out from his fingertip as it went around the cliff wall and flew towards Luo Jiyun, revolving one round around his body as it illuminated the surroundings allowing Li Moying to borrow the light to check things out clearly.","When Luo Jiyun saw that, his expression changed immediately and cried out urgently, “Eldest Senior Brother, don’t... quickly extinguish that light!”","Li Moying was stunned momentarily, “What?”","“Be... Below....”","Li Moying was just trying to comprehend the reason when he heard a roaring sound coming from the bottom of the cliff. Immediately a sinister looking magical beast came flying from below the rock, directly charging towards Li Moying’s direction!","This magical beast was radiating a blue purplish glow entirely and its body was thin but it had a pair of huge wings which spread out to a total of ten over meters. It’s two bronze bell eyes popped out from the side and looked extremely ugly.","Even Li Moying couldn’t recognise what magical beast that was! Even with his experience from both lifetimes, he actually had not seen it before.","Whereas this magical beast apparently belonged to one with the thunder attribute. The minute it saw Li Moying release a small bundle of lightning, it immediately pounced upwards as it swallowed it into its tummy in one mouthful."]},{"number":1478,"title":"Chapter 1478 - Saving a life (4)","paragraphs":["Li Moying’s thunder attribute Profound Energy was extremely pure and after the magical beast swallowed it down in one gulp, its eyes instantly appeared an expression which looked like it could have a sufficient meal.","The next moment, it turned towards Li Moying and its large eyes fixated on him, with an insatiable greed sizing him up, as though it was gauging what the taste of having him in its tummy would feel like.","Not long later, it seemed to have completed its evaluation as it suddenly charged towards Li Moying’s direction!","Luo Jiyun was shocked by this strange and powerful high levelled magical beast that his soul almost flew out as he went stiff entirely; his back drenched in sweat but yet still unable to move, worried that this magical beast would fly into a rage and swallow him alive at the next moment.","Whoever knew that this magical beast totally didn’t put its attention on him at all, instead it turned around and left.","Luo Jiyun had yet to heave a sigh of relief when he saw it pouncing towards Li Moying.","He cried out in inconsolable shock, “Eldest Senior Brother, be careful.....!”","However, the thunder attributed magical beast’s speed was shockingly fast like a bolt of lightning. Before Luo Jiyun had finished his words, it had already appeared right in front of Li Moying.","Li Moying’s eyes were slightly closed as his expression was chilly and there was no change in his expression, as though he had not sensed that austere energy which came charging towards him!","It was until the magical beast’s sharp beak was merely just an inch away before his wrist turned and suddenly struck out his sword!","The light amethyst sword was a half god relic and coordinated with Li Moying’s powerful thunder attributed innate talent, his destructive power was so strong that it was heaven defying. In just one strike, a dazzling thunder rainbow rushed up into the sky and instantly slashed into the magical beast’s huge body!","The magical beast was not able to evade in time and it’s right wing was slashed broken directly as blood started to spurt outwards.","“Ga Ga—–!!!”","It gave out several husky and mournful miserable shrieks which hurt Li Moying and Luo Jiyun’s eardrums. At the same time, the heavily injured magical beast grew even more infuriated as it charged towards Li Moying without a care for anything else.","But alas, it was heavily injured in its prime state so now that it had sustained such a heavy injury, all the more it wasn’t his match.","Li Moying struck out consecutively as he easily evaded its attacks.","Magical beast shrieked out miserably as it fell down to the bottom of the valley; its whereabouts unknown.","Luo Jiyun had been keeping an eye on the battle right from the start and his heart was just jumping behind his throat, worried that at the next moment, he would see Li Moying splayed with blood.","However, reality had surpassed his imagination. Li Moying had not spent too much effort and had defeated the magical beast, additionally giving it a fatal blow!","Heaven knew that this magical beast was at least seventh tier!","Seventh tiered magical beasts battle power was equivalent to a human’s eighth stage realm practitioner. Li Moying was merely in the seventh stage realm so this situation was equivalent to a cross realm battle.","In the end, he had not only won, but won so easily?? It seemed like it was just a matter of lifting his finger that easy. As though he had the ability to manage that magical beast even if it was stronger than him by several times.","What kind of situation was this??","He knew that his Eldest Senior Brother was strong, very strong, extremely strong.. but... but wasn’t this a little too heaven defying??","Luo Jiyun was still in a daze when Li Moying had already carefully stepped on the rocks and reached a place which was close to him.","“What daze are you still in? Let’s hurry and leave this place, give me your hand and I’ll pull you up.”"]},{"number":1479,"title":"Chapter 1479 - Saving a life (5)","paragraphs":["Luo Jiyun then recollected his senses as he lowered his head to take a look at those few pieces of stones which were holding him up, feeling uneasy about it.","“But, Eldest Senior Brother, I’m still worried.....”","“No need to worry, I’ve already checked out the situation on your side so relax. I can hold onto you, talk after you come up.”","Li Moying stretched out his arm and Luo Jiyun let go of his right hand which was grabbing onto the side of the rock fearfully, slowly stretching out his arm towards Li Moying.","Li Moying grabbed him and a powerful gust of Profound Energy surged in from Luo Jiyun’s arm’s meridians, instantly opening access to a few meridians which were blocked due to his heavy injury.","“AH——!!!” Luo Jiyun cried out in shock.","He only felt extreme pain from the overbearing Profound Energy which had invaded into his meridians as his entire body’s blood seemed as though it was burning. But at the same time, he sensed that his entire body was filled with energy and that abundance feeling of energy was something which he had never experienced even before he was injured.","This kind of pain and stimulated feeling was just too strange and Luo Jiyun suddenly felt a light and airy feeling.","Li Moying howled softly, “Cast away those few rocks and use your strength to step on those rocks at the bottom to climb up! Quick, this condition will not last too long otherwise your meridians will not be able to take it!”","It was after all an external force which was forcefully irrigated plus the fact that Luo Jiyun’s meridians were still severely injured, if time dragged on, his internal injuries would become much worse.","Luo Jiyun’s body shook as he hurriedly summoned up the Profound Energy in his body which Li Moying had injected, suddenly raising his power to shake away those few pieces of rocks which held him up!","In this way, his body lost support and fell down directly.","Luckily, Li Moying was holding on to him tightly from the top and Luo Jiyun followed the strength from his hand as he borrowed the strength from his feet to climb up the cliff!","“Clack clack.....”","His lower body had originally suffered a fracture and using strength forcefully right now was akin to using a file to rub in between his flesh and bones, causing Luo Jiyun in so much pain that he sweated profusely.","But he clenched on to his teeth tightly as he endured the pain and continued putting in strength.","Luckily the rock was rather stable so even if it endured both people’s strength, it was still rock solid.","The two of them heaved a sigh of relief.","Luo Jiyun was drenched in sweat totally plus the bones on both his legs had broken into several parts, there was no way for him to stand up as he totally laid limp on the rock.","Li Moying checked on the injuries on his body gloomily as he retrieved several bottles of pills from his realm ring, casting it into Luo Jiyun’s arms.","“Quickly take the medication. These pills, staunch bleeding and pain, grow flesh, replenish Profound Energy, everything’s there. Take three pills per bottle right now! And the green ceramic bottle is external ointment, apply it on your wounds first. This fracture of yours is simply too serious so we can’t treat it here. Take the medication first and after you feel a little better, we’ll head up immediately and find a place to treat your injuries.”","Luo Jiyun grabbed onto the bottle tightly and after he opened the bottle, his eyes opened up wide.","“These... these are all... sixth level medicinal pills!! Eldest Senior Brother, these... these are just too valuable? Sixth level medicinal pills! In our Sect, we need a huge, huge amount of contribution points before we can exchange for it and it’s virtually impossible to auction for these without several hundred thousands of high grade spiritual stones in the auction house!”"]},{"number":1480,"title":"Chapter 1480 - Saving a life (6)","paragraphs":["Luo Jiyun’s fingers were shaking as he looked at Li Moying in disbelief.","“Eldest Senior Brother, have you taken the wrong bottles? These are such valuable pills and you actually gave me the entire bottle??”","Li Moying threw an undisturbed glance at him, “Why talk so much rubbish when I ask you to eat? Sixth level medicinal pills take effect much faster so that you can hang on. Otherwise perhaps in the mid of the mountain, you might not be able to take it and faint. By then, how am I supposed to bring you away from here?”","“But... But.....” Luo Jiyun was still flabbergasted as he looked at Li Moying in a dishevelled look.","He understood what Eldest Senior Brother said but... these were all sixth level medicinal pills!!","Li Moying couldn’t help but shook his head as he said, “These pills are something which your Sister-in-law asked me to bring along for you. Don’t hate to part with these because all she has on her mind is to save you. If you still feel bad about it, then after you go up, thank you personally. In future when I’m not around, help me protect her properly, that will do.”","“Ah, these pills.... are from Sister-in-law? Armament Masters are just too rich!!”","Luo Jiyun’s expression was filled with astonishment when he heard that the pills were from Huang Yueli. He was filled with envy and admiration towards her.","Eldest Senior Brother’s fiancée was really.... too powerful! She could even freely give out sixth level medicinal pills, just how rich was she!","In the past he felt that this young lass from South Yue Kingdom was unworthy of his Eldest Senior Brother but recently everything about her made him feel that his Eldest Senior Brother... seemed to have linked up with a wealthy woman?? That was one of the advantages of being handsome!","Li Moying felt his hair standing from his gaze and asked curiously, “What are you looking at me for? Still not going to take the pills quickly?”","Luo Jiyun was grazed by his chilly glance as he lowered his head guiltily and grabbed the pills, stuffing it into his mouth.","Sixth level medicinal pills indeed had outstanding effects. Not long after Luo Jiyun had swallowed it down, his complexion seemed to have taken a better turn and the pain from his body seemed to have lessened.","While waiting for him to recover, Li Moying’s arms were crossed as he leaned against the cliff and questioned, “What on earth happened to you? I’ve obviously reminded you several times after entering the mystic region! The central region of the mystic region is the most dangerous part and even ninth stage realm top exponents aren’t guaranteed to be able to leave safely. You’re merely in the fifth stage realm so why did you run over here for? Don’t you want to live anymore?”","Luo Jiyun was berated by him, feeling both self-reproach and guilt as he didn’t dare to lift up his head.","“Eldest Senior Brother, it’s my fault. Not only have I gotten myself into trouble, I’ve even caused trouble to you and Sister-in-law to come and save me... But the situation then was rather chaotic so I had no time to hesitate, just thinking of saving the person...”","“Save the person? Li Moying’s brows rose in curiosity, “Save who?”","Luo Jiyun explained, “Right after I left the cave dwelling, I’d been searching for opportunities in the eastern region and later on, I met Third Senior Sister.....”","Li Moying’s brows uncontrollably creased together, “Murong Fei?”","Luo Jiyun nodded, “Third Senior Sister said that she had gotten a copy of a treasure map and knew that the place on the treasure map of a Cloudy Qilin Senior was not too far away. But if she headed there alone, she was worried that something might happen and so luckily she met me. So she wanted me to head over with her.”","“So you went along with her?”","“Ughh, right. I had not thought about the location of the treasure map at that time. In the end as we walked, we reached an area which was very near the central region. I was worried that we would get into trouble after trying to barge in but Third Senior Sister comforted me that she had the treasure map and the surroundings were very safe.....”"]},{"number":1481,"title":"Chapter 1481 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (1)","paragraphs":["Li Moying didn’t say a word as he waited for Luo Jiyun to continue.","Luo Jiyun continued, “Third Senior Sister’s ability and knowledge are much stronger than mine so I thought what she said would definitely not be wrong. Whoever knew that we had just reached the location of the marking on the map when an accident happened. A seventh tiered magical beast pounced out from the forest, charging directly towards Third Senior Sister....”","He raised his head and took a look at Li Moying cautiously.","“Our abilities could not match up and the two of us were not the seventh tiered magical beast’s opponent so Third Miss just turned around and escaped. In order to save her, I followed closely behind. But I’d not expected Third Senior Sister to not choose her way properly and actually ran all the way into the central region! I had totally not considered too much at that time so even though I knew it was the central region, I had no choice but to enter this place at that life threatening moment.”","“Later on, we were fighting as we were escaping for our lives and unknowingly, we reached the side of this cliff. I didn’t look where my feet were and fell down immediately. Luckily Third Senior Sister didn’t fall down as well but that seventh level magical beast was still pursuing after her so I wonder if she has escaped or not?”","Speaking to this point, Luo Jiyun seemed to recall something as he turned his head towards Li Moying.","“Eldest Senior Brother, when you... came over earlier, did you see Third Senior Sister? She... I wonder how is she right now? Later after we go up, can you go and save her?”","Li Moying swept a glance at him as the depth of his eyes was deep and cold.","“You’ve already turned into this state and you still want to go save her?”","Luo Jiyun continued, “Eldest Senior Brother, I know Third Senior Sister had been disrespectful towards Sister-in-law on several occasions and she was indeed too much but she is after all Master’s daughter so if she were to die in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, what would happen if Master blames it on us?”","Li Moying gave a cold laugh, “Even if she died here, she can only blame herself for it! Can she blame anyone else?”","Luo Jiyun advised again, “Furthermore, Third Senior Sister has a piece of treasure map in her hands and we haven’t got time to go search for the treasure so if we saved her, Eldest Senior Brother you wouldn’t end up with nothing as well.....”","Li Moying narrowed his eyes as he stared at him coldly.","Luo Jiyun felt a chill running down his spine from his stare as he sweated profusely speaking in fear and trepidation, “El... Eldest Senior Brother?”","Li Moying was so angry that he laughed as he looked at Luo Jiyun with a look which seemed as though he resented him for failing to meet his expectations, “I really want to split open your head to see if it’s filled with water inside? You’ve been sold and yet still helping the seller to count money?”","“Ah?” Luo Jiyun revealed a blank expression.","Li Moying burst out laughing, “How could anything ever happen to Murong Fei? She intentionally lured you over and caused you to fall down the cliff! What could have happened to her? She’d probably gone off to celebrate somewhere! As for what treasure map, it’s just a lure to hook you yet you’re still thinking of going to search for some treasure? You’d better first try to think of a way to get out of here!”","Luo Jiyun still didn’t quite understand what happened as he stood in a daze and after pondering over it for a while, he started to become clear on what had happened.","“You.... what you mean is that... Third Senior Sister lied to me? Why would she lie to me?”","“This is very hard to say. From the looks of it, there’s a ninety nine percent chance that she’s trying to lure me over to save you! Now that both of us are stuck in the central region, if we can’t get out, who will be the biggest beneficiary?”","Li Moying said to this point and his brows suddenly creased as he felt alarmed.","He suddenly recalled that when he came down to save him, he had left Huang Yueli alone on the top of the cliff!","Whereas it had not been the first attempt which Murong Fei tried to kill Huang Yueli. Yet now Li’er was all by herself....."]},{"number":1482,"title":"Chapter 1482 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (2)","paragraphs":["This absolutely gave her the chance to take advantage of the situation!","Could it be that Murong Fei’s target was actually Li’er?","Li Moying instantly became anxious as he raised his head up towards the mountain and shouted, “Li’er, are you there?”","The fog around the cliff was very thick and he couldn’t see the situation on the top of the mountain so his heart was pounding hard.","Luckily not too long later, Huang Yueli’s voice was heard coming from the top.","“I’ve been waiting for you guys! Have you found Junior Brother Luo? The fog is getting thicker and the sky is turning darker too. It’s too dangerous in the central region because we don’t know what will happen at night. While the sky hasn’t turned dark entirely, hurry and get up here!”","Her voice was emitted from such a high place and although it sounded a little blurry but he could still tell that her condition was quite well. Her tone was peaceful, not sounding like she was being pursued by someone.","Li Moying heaved a long sigh and immediately frowned again.","Looked like Murong Fei’s target wasn’t Huang Yueli? Then why did she do that?","The more he thought, the more uneasy he got as he turned back and looked at Luo Jiyun, “How is it? How much have you recovered?”","Luo Jiyun had a despondent look on his face, apparently he had not recovered from the shock from being cheated by Murong Fei.","He had a kind character, always assuming that all of them were from the same Sect and Murong Fei was a lady so no matter how jealous she was, she couldn’t possibly breed hatred from love, or even harming one’s life....","In the end, he was just too naïve.","Hearing Li Moying words, he suddenly recollected his senses as he replied in a hurry, “I’ve recovered about twenty percent of my Profound Energy, only... my legs still wouldn’t move... it might be hard for me to climb up... Eldest Senior Brother, why not you go up first. The day is indeed turning dark and little Sister-in-law is not safe alone by herself.”","Li Moying’s brows lifted and he was just about to say something.","Suddenly he felt a burst of intense Profound Energy fluctuation attacking from behind him.","Luo Jiyun’s expression changed abruptly as he cried out in shock, “Eldest Senior Brother, behind you!”","Li Moying’s reaction was extremely swift as he immediately turned around, evaded, pulled out his sword and stuck out, all at one go!","The Amethyst Light Sword suddenly flashed past and struck the sneaky magical beast which had charged an attack behind his back!","“Ga Ga—!! Ga Ga—!!”","Miserable shrills were heard amidst the sinisterly bitter wind.","After Li Moying had seen the situation in front of him clearly, his pupils suddenly contracted.","This time, the magical beasts which flew upwards from the bottom of the valley had at least seven to eight of them as they all had pitch black forms. Other than the seventh tiered magical beast that resembled an eagle, which had been killed by him, there were several other different shapes of flying magical beasts, most of the species which he had never seen before.","Moreover, in this batch of magical beasts, the lowest tiered was sixth tier and the highest had already reached eighth tier!","In actually fact, if there was only one eighth tiered magical beast, he wasn’t afraid.","But now there were so many magical beasts which surrounded them. Moreover from the saturation of the fog below the cliff, it was unknown to how many other magical beasts were there hiding there....","This situation made Li Moying feel an immense feeling of crisis!","Luo Jiyun was scared out of his wits as his complexion turned pearly white while his entire body started to tremble.","“These.. these magical beasts would gather.... gather over the minute they sense Profound Energy fluctuations. I met one when I first fell down and was almost killed by it! It must have been that magical beast which you killed earlier which caused the intense fluctuations which is why so many of them were attracted over.....”","These magical beasts’ eyes were all drooling as though Li Moying was some scrumptious meal."]},{"number":1483,"title":"Chapter 1483 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (3)","paragraphs":["Li Moying faced so many high levelled magical beasts but he wasn’t the least flustered. The expression on his face turned graver as he started to work up the Profound Energy throughout his body, accumulating the power while waiting, like a taut bow.","The magical beasts seemed to sense the dangerous imposing manner which was extruding from him as they didn’t dare to make any unnecessary movements momentarily.","Both sides were at a standstill for a period of time and Luo Jiyun almost forgot to breathe as his heart was beating so fast that it almost jumped out.","Suddenly, the magical beasts seemed as though they had observed enough and losing their patience, they cried out “Ga Ga” several times and all of them pounced towards Li Moying at the same time!","Dark shadows in the sky were about to drown Li Moying’s body completely in a blink of an eye!","Under the enclosure of the huge wings from those magical beasts, Li Moying’s body seemed so tiny, as though it would be crushed to dust any time!","Luo Jiyun was so scared that he daren’t look, faltering as he shut his eyes.","But at the next moment, he heard miserable cries from the birds, ringing throughout the entire valley!","Luo Jiyun hastily opened his eyes as he saw bolts of lightning descend from the sky, turning the dark sky as bright as broad daylight! All the lightning converged into a piece of blue purplish lightning as it carried a powerful aura, gathering into a huge light ball in Li Moying’s hands.","Luo Jiyun’s heart was alarmed as he trembled in fear while looking at that light ball. Just looking at it alone, he was able to sense the shockingly terrifying energy contained in it.","Those flying magical beasts which were charging towards him sensed danger and their speed suddenly decreased as it flapped its wings hovering still in mid-air, as though it didn’t know if it should continue or proceed ahead.","However, Li Moying didn’t give them any chance to hesitate as the light ball in his hands had accumulated a vast amount of energy in an extremely short span of time!","Following that, his eyes were like electricity as he gave a sharp shout, throwing out that light ball towards that group of magical beasts!","The light ball shot to the front at an extremely swift speed, shocking those magical beasts so much that it all dispersed while escaping, but it was....too late for it to escape now!","The light ball had exploded in the middle of the magical beasts and the thunder attributed energy which was contained in it exploded in an instance!","A “Boom” sound reverberated and followed that were sharp cries and miserable shrieks from those flying magical beasts, as well as....","Luo Jiyun sniffed and somehow felt that he smelled the fragrance of roasted meat.....","Among the eight flying magical beasts, the two which were in the front were instantly heavily injured as it shrilled in shock while it fell into the valley.","Although the remaining six were slightly injured but they were all awed by Li Moying’s move as all of them scurried backwards in shock, not daring to get any closer.","But although they had all temporarily retreated, they did not leave at all, merely hiding in a slightly further place as all of them kept a watchful eye on Li Moying. The greed in their eyes had not lessened, instead it increased!","Evidentially, the huge thunder attributed energy which Li Moying lured had shocked them but on the other hand, it also attracted their lust!","Such powerful and pure energy was something which these magical beasts had hoped for in a long time!","Although it was dangerous but with such a huge temptation in front of their eyes, which of them could bear to leave like that?","Li Moying frowned slightly on seeing these magical beasts covetous lust in their eyes, he knew that things were not going to go well.","Earlier the energy which he had attracted was much stronger than before and later on there would be even more magical beasts which were attracted by it. In order to push them back, he would need to erupt an even stronger energy, which would continue to lure new magical beasts.....","If this continued, when would there be an end to it?"]},{"number":1484,"title":"Chapter 1484 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (4)","paragraphs":["He immediately turned his head back and said to Luo Jiyun, “Alright, stop staying in a daze. Take this opportunity now when they don’t dare to approach us, we must leave immediately!”","Luo Jiyun understood that the situation was in peril and immediately nodded his head, “I understand!”","Actually many wounds on his body were still in extreme pain and his meridians were full of holes so he could not muster up his Profound Energy at all.","But he also knew that if they don’t leave now, they would definitely end up as the magical beasts’ food later on.","So he forcibly summoned up his breath as he clenched his teeth, trying to prop up that broken body of his and follow Li Moying to leave this place.","However, he had just moved a little distance when he couldn’t help but gave a miserable cry as his entire body profused with sweat, falling onto the ground!","Luo Jiyun had already tried his utmost best to get up but certain things were just not curbed based on his own determination. The bones in his feet had already been broken into several segments and he was totally unable to work up his Profound Energy, so no one would be able to use their strength to move like that.","Luo Jiyun’s expression turned deadly pale, “El... Eldest Senior Brother, I really cannot move... you’d better go on up first. I... I cannot drag you down!”","Li Moying frowned, “What silly things are you saying?”","“Rea.... Really! Those magical beasts are coveting Eldest Senior Brother, your Profound Energy which is why they gathered around here. Perhaps after you left, they would automatically disperse. Those magical beasts would not be interested in a half dead cripple like me so rest assured!”","Luo Jiyun knew that he was definitely a goner and didn’t want to drag Li Moying down so he intentionally said this. But in actual fact, anyone knew that if he continued staying here, he would absolutely die.","Just at this moment, Huang Yueli’s anxious voice was heard from the top of the cliff.","“Moying? Moying?? How are you now? Why are there such terrifying cries coming from below? There’s such strong thunder attributed fluctuations as well? Are you being attacked?”","Luo Jiyun looked at Li Moying’s expression which had instantly turned worried and gave a ghastly smile, “Eldest Senior Brother, quickly head up! Little Sister-in-law is still waiting for you up there! When these magical beasts get tangled with you, then you’d really not be able to leave! Who will take care of little Sister-in-law?”","He knew that for Huang Yueli, Li Moying would definitely not allow himself to die here, so.....","“Shut up!”","Li Moying called out sharply to stop him from continuing.","Following that, he shot up like an arrow as he unleashed the Immortal Binding Rope from his waist, which Huang Yueli had stuffed to him, as he tied it around Luo Jiyun’s waist.","Luo Jiyun looked at his actions in a daze, “Eldest Senior Brother, this... this is....”","Li Moying narked, “Stop moving around, I’ll get your Sister-in-law to pull you up!”","“Ah?” Luo Jiyun was puzzled beyond words.","Li Moying had already raised up his head as he shouted to the top, “Li’er we’re fine. Jiyun is seriously injured and he totally can’t move. Use the Immortal Binding Rope and pull him up first!”","“Ah!” Huang Yueli’s shocked voice was heard and immediately after, “Alright, secure him tightly and pull the rope three times consecutively! I’ll then start pulling him up!”","Li Moying’s movements were very fast and within a few breaths of time, he had already tied Luo Jiyun into a rice dumpling. After checking the knot on Luo Jiyun, he pulled the rope consecutively for three times.","Luo Jiyun originally couldn’t move and now that he was tied up so securely, he felt as though he was like a piece of pork belly which was waiting to be butchered by others.","His expression turned slightly green, “El... Eldest Senior Brother, are you certain that little Sister-in-law is able to pull me up?”"]},{"number":1485,"title":"Chapter 1485 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1485: Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (5)","Li Moying gave him a hard stare, “Stop acting silly, your Sister-in-law is a fifth stage realm practitioner! How heavy are you? Is she not able to pull you?”","Saying that, Luo Jiyun’s body was lifted up by a chunk and the speed was swift. Furthermore it was very stable. Apparently the person who pulled the rope had a lot of strength, with remaining energy leftover.","His body kept on rising up, bit by bit.","Right now, he was no longer concerned about his own safety as he turned to look at Li Moying.","Just one look and his expression changed abruptly!","Because those few flying magical beasts which were hiding in alertness far away had actually crowded around him again and furthermore, several new magical beasts appeared in the middle of the sky.","“Eldest Senior Brother, you... you’d better let Sister-in-law let me down and pull you up first! You’re in this state, what will happen later...”","Li Moying swept him a glance and with a biting cold tone, “Go up! Don’t drag my leg! I naturally have my own means to get out of danger!”","“But....”","Luo Jiyun wanted to say more but Huang Yueli’s speed in pulling him up was very fast as his body was lifted yet another distance again.","The distance between him and Li Moying was pulled away fast, almost to the point of not able to see each other’s figures any longer.","In the thick fog, he could only see Li Moying facing that group of magical beasts yet again and the cold but aloof expression on that good looking face was filled with a thick murderous intent!","Following that, he continued to rise up and could no longer see Li Moying anymore.","Not long after, Luo Jiyun went past the thick fog and could see the peak of the cliff indistinctly.","Out of his expectations, Huang Yueli was not the one who tugged at the rope tightly but she was seated by the side of the cliff as her hands propped up her cheeks, using a pair of watery large eyes staring anxiously and in anticipation towards the bottom of the cliff.","By her side was a small sized pinion mechanism and there was a piece of magical beast crystal core which was supplying the energy.","The rope which was tied onto Luo Jiyun was linked to that mechanism as he was pulled up bit by bit.","Luo Jiyun gasped with his mouth wide open, thinking to himself that it was no wonder that the speed of his ascent was so uniform. So.... This was indeed the ability of an Armament Master!","Huang Yueli looked at his figure and gave a shrill of joy, “Junior Brother Luo, you’ve successfully gotten out of the perilous situation! That’s great!”","But following that, her vision swept below Luo Jiyun as her heart thumped hard, revealing a disappointed expression, “Where’s Moying? He still hasn’t come up?”","Luo Jiun heard her question and his heart pounded wildly as the scenario of Li Moying’s chilly expression while facing that group of magical beasts appeared right in front of his eyes.","He simply could not imagine that if he was in Li Moying’s position, what kind of outcome would that be. He would probably have died without a full corpse by now?","But the person who was covering a retreat below... was Li Moying.","Would Eldest Senior Brother be able to successfully come through?","Luo Jiyun usually believed in his Eldest Senior Brother a lot but today, he didn’t dare to guarantee that Li Moying would be able to win!","Gazing at Huang Yueli’s little face which was filled with anticipation, Luo Jiyun’s throat seemed to be stuffed as he totally couldn’t make any sound at all.","He really didn’t know how he should answer this question.","Should he tell Huang Yueli that Eldest Senior Brother had thrown himself into a precarious situation in order to save him and the chances of survival were very limited? Just how much of a shock would that be to his little Sister-in-law?","Huang Yueli saw that he didn’t reply and somehow had an ominous premonition as her lips pursed up.","She was just about to ask again but at this moment, something happened!","She suddenly sensed a strong wind rising from her back and a burst of intense and sharp Profound Energy was casted towards her direction swiftly!"]},{"number":1486,"title":"Chapter 1486 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli’s attention was entirely placed on Luo Jiyun who was on the cliff and had not expected anyone to suddenly attack her from behind!","She had originally still maintained a bit of alertness but after staying on the top of the cliff for such a long time, she had not met with any danger hence there was a silent consent that it was absolutely safe at the top of the cliff.","At the current moment, to be attacked suddenly really could be said as she was caught totally unprepared!","However, her experience in battles was especially abundant and her response time was also extremely swift!","At the critical moment, she swiftly evaded to the right side as she rolled onto the ground, avoiding the fatal strike which was casted towards her back!","Huang Yueli rolled onto the ground for a moment and immediately got up, thinking of counter-attacking.","But by the time she turned around to look at the person, she realised that the person did not follow up with the attack but instead turned around heading towards the small mechanism which she had refined, attempting to cut the rope using a curved knife in his hand.","“Stop it!” Huang Yueli’s eyes turned wide as she called out sharply, gathering her Profound Energy and casting it towards the other party!","However, that person came prepared and his actions were extremely swift. Before Huang Yueli could arrive in time, his long sword blade had already fallen onto the rope!","A “Plop” sound was heard!","The long sword was swept with Profound Energy as it slashed heavily onto it! Even the ground was driven a deep mark as dust and mud flew everywhere!","Luo Jiyun also realised that something had happened on the top of the cliff but he was helpless right now.","Li Moying had tied him up tightly into a bundle to prevent him from falling and he was totally immovable. Of course, even if he wasn’t tied up, he was no different from a cripple so he couldn’t help Huang Yueli anyways.","Seeing that the other party wanted to cut off the rope, Luo Jiyun was scared witless that his heart almost jumped out from his mouth.","He witnessed the blade of the knife falling down towards the rope and shut his eyes tightly, awaiting the drop into the valley!Visit web novel. live If You like manga , comics","He had not expected that after Li Moying expended so much work but yet he was still going to die here!","But out of his expectations, Luo Jiyun waited for a while but had not felt the gravity pulling fall. On the contrary, he was lifted up by a distance again!","Luo Jiyun hurriedly opened his eyes and saw the masked man who had struck also dazed on the spot, apparently not expecting this rope to be so durable. A fifth tier upper grade Profound Weapon knife slashing down so hard and it actually... didn’t break off?","Huang Yueli took the opportunity while the masked man was in a daze to take out a large quantity of Thunder Flame Balls, throwing it towards him!","The masked man was shocked by the sudden obstruction and didn’t manage to respond in time. By the time he was aware of the danger, it was already too late.","Huang Yueli’s secret weapon exploded consecutively in front of him. He evaded to the left and right but was still bombed several times. With many injuries on his body, he had no choice but to retreat continuously!","Huang Yueli immediately rushed upwards towards the mechanism.","At this particular moment, she only had one thought in mind which was to pull Luo Jiyun up immediately!","Although the Immortal Binding Rope could resist against Profound Weapons which were fifth tiered and below, but the Profound Weapon in the masked man’s hand was a fifth tiered upper grade weapon. The Immortal Binding Rope could still resist against one or two slashes, but if the number of slashes increased, it would still break off!","So she made a prompt decision immediately!","Huang Yueli bent down and stretched out her arm to grab the Immortal Binding Rope while infusing her Profound Energy into it!","After that she used her strength to swing the rope, swinging up the rope into the sky!","The masked man’s eyes flashed past a shocked look as he cried out in alarm, “It’s bad! Quickly stop her! We can’t let her pull Li Moying up!”"]},{"number":1487,"title":"Chapter 1487 - Mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind (7)","paragraphs":["Hearing that, Huang Yueli’s heart faintly felt a sliver of puzzlement.","Li Moying? Why would they mention Li Moying? The one she was pulling up, wasn’t he Luo Jiyun?","However before she could give it any further thought, she sensed another burst of Profound Energy attacking from her right back! It was directed at the fatal spot of below her ribs!","This move was extremely meticulous. If she didn’t let go of the Immortal Binding Rope to block this move, then she would be struck in the ribs, and this would definitely cause haemorrhage! This was a fatal spot concerning her life and death!","But if she was entangled with the person, that would give the masked man a chance to continue slashing the rope.","Luo Jiyun was originally seriously injured so if he were to fall down from such a height, there was no way that he wouldn’t die!","This person apparently thought that he was very smart as the moment he drew out his sword, he opened his mouth and talked.","“Miss Bai, withdraw your hand! For a man, giving up your life really isn’t worth it! You have such a bright future in front of you so why do this!”","This voice sounded extremely familiar and Huang Yueli’s mind seemed to ignite a spark as she seemed to have guessed the identity of that person.","The movements in her hands paused for a moment and the strength used to swing the rope seemed to have weakened.","The person who came felt delighted as he thought that his threat had developed some use so the move he struck out wasn’t that vicious. After all, his motive was to kill Li Moying and not to kill Huang Yueli!","He revealed a smile on his face but before he gave a broader smile, he saw Huang Yueli bent down.","The person looked at her in surprise.","Huang Yueli’s finger drew an arc on the ground and coincidentally drew out a series of array patterns as she softly cried, “Break!”","While the person’s face was still in a daze, he felt the earth which he was standing on suddenly loosening as he sunk downwards directly. His body lost balance and he landed head first onto the ground.","“You...”","The person tried his best to steady himself on his feet.","But in this way, it hindered a chance for battle.","Huang Yueli re-established her strength as she started swinging the rope once again. Luo Jiyun’s body was swung out of the pathway along with the rope, drawing out a half moon arc in mid-air before he crashed heavily onto the ground not too far away!","At the same time, Huang Yueli rushed towards him immediately!","She knew that Luo Jiyun would not have any battle strength now and if the person who tried to stop her from pulling him up wanted to kill him, it was as easy as lifting a finger!","So Luo Jiyun required her full protection right now.","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and patted heavily onto Luo Jiyun’s back and the rope on him loosened.","Whereas Huang Yueli herself had retrieved her Icy Jade Zither from the Sky Phoenix Ring and her fingers lightly plucked at the strings as she began to play!","The urgent zither sounds rang continuously as though silver bottles broke abruptly, intimidating the will of the people!","But just at this moment, the person on the side suddenly stopped his attacks as he used an extremely astonished tone crying out, “What’s going on? It’s not Li Moying??”","The masked man heard that and stopped as he gazed behind Huang Yueli.","“He really isn’t! What’s going on? How come Li Moying didn’t come up but instead he sent this trashy Luo Jiyun up instead? Could it be that he’s still at the bottom of the cliff?”","Speaking of that, he seemed to have thought of something as he couldn’t help but laughed out loudly, “That’s right, I know already. Li Moying is definitely still at the bottom of the mountain and he should have met with trouble so he can’t come up! Could it be that we don’t even need to lift a hand and he directly died down there?”"]},{"number":1488,"title":"Chapter 1488 - Utterly shameless (1)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli heard their tone and voice and her heart jolted as the tune that she was playing on the zither suddenly paused for a moment as it was totally messed up.","She bluntly stopped as she stared at the duo in shock.","“You... you are Leng Yi Feng!! And Li Lingchuan! You... the both of them, since when have you colluded together?!”","It wasn’t anything strange for either one of them to want to scheme on Li Moying but now the both of them are actually taking action together?","How could this be possible? Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect’s relationship was at loggerheads!","After the two men’s identities were exposed, they exchanged glances and directly stopped hiding as they removed the disguise used to conceal their identities.","“You’re deserved to be called Miss Bai, your eyesight is really extraordinary. We’ve been exposed in such a short amount of time.” Li Lingchuan originally wanted to be the mastermind behind the scenes but whoever knew that Huang Yueli had exposed his identity in such a short while. He was extremely unreconciled as the words he said were full of spunk.","Leng Yi Feng pursed his lips as his expression was chilly, not saying a single word.","Huang Yueli stared at them in a biting cold stare, “It indeed is the both of you! I was just suspecting why Junior Brother Luo would suddenly run into the central region for no apparent reason and even got trapped with a serious injury. Someone must be behind all these! I’d not expected you two to be the culprits! Li Lingchuan, no matter what, you’re Sect Master Murong’s beloved disciple, how could you be like Murong Ni, becoming a traitor of the Sect!”","Li Lingchuan laughed, “Traitor? Your words are too harsh! Murong Ni was a lackey for Green Cloud Sect which is really called the Sect’s traitor. I’m merely cooperating with Mister Leng. No matter how I see it, we’re merely benefiting from each other’s relationship.”","Huang Yueli didn’t wish to hear his denial and bluntly asked, “Stop all these rubbish talk. What do you want to do by luring me and Moying over? Do you want to take Moying’s life?”","Huang Yueli had seen plenty of internal strife in the Sect and originally suspected that there was something fishy behind all these. Now on seeing Li Lingchuan’s stance, her heart swiftly analysed and deduced around eighty to ninety percent of the cause and effects.Read comics on our Read.live","Not waiting for Li Lingchuan’s answer, she continued, “Let me guess, Junior Brother Li made a move this time, could it be for Moying’s Young Sect Master’s position? I’ve never expected that a mere Celestial Light Sect’s Young Sect Master status will make you betray the Sect, coming out with such an underhanded method! A sect like Celestial Light Sect in Sky Emperor City isn’t even considered as third rated! It’s only trash like you who treat it so importantly!”","Li Lingchuan’s thoughts had been seen through by her as his eyes widened in disbelief.","Right before this, he knew that Huang Yueli’s innate talent was outstanding and she had unparalleled beauty but he had not expected Huang Yueli’s thoughts to be so profound or that her foresight was so sharp!","Those shameful thoughts couldn’t mask her eyes at all as she easily saw through it, without any concealment.","This feeling seemed like he was stripped of all his clothes in the bustling city and made to run around naked, which made him both angry and embarrassed.","Furthermore, under Huang Yueli’s deep and chilly gaze, Li Lingchuan uncontrollably shuddered as he suddenly felt an icy sensation in his heart.","At that moment, he had an illusion that the person he was facing... was Li Moying himself! Huang Yueli’s imposing manner which radiated around her was totally not any lesser than Li Moying!","After being dazed for a moment did Li Lingchuan regain his senses as he cried out in a dishevelled state, “How daring of you! Celestial Light Sect is merely a third rate Sect?”"]},{"number":1489,"title":"Chapter 1489 - Utterly shameless (2)","paragraphs":["“That’s right, there’s no way that Celestial Light Sect could be compared against those super powerhouses or hidden sacred grounds which had been around for several hundred thousands of years. But can ordinary people go to that level of powerhouse? Celestial Light Sect in South Sky Region is considered as a first rate powerful Sect! To be able to obtain Celestial Light Sect, it will allow me to ride over all the practitioners in South Sky Region for my entire life!”","As Li Lingchuan spoke, a malicious glint flashed past his eyes as his expression was filled with irreconciliation!”","“Based on my innate talent, I’m originally a first rate peerless genius in South Sky Region! If it wasn’t for Li Moying who blocked my way, obstructing my future, how could I possibly only be a direct disciple? The position of Celestial Light Sect’s Young Sect Master should be mine! You wretched lass really don’t know how high the sky is or how thick the earth is, how dare you look down on Celestial Light Sect?”","Huang Yueli secretly rolled her eyes back as she gave a sneer, “Who’s the one who is speaking arrogantly? And who is it who doesn’t know how high the sky is or how thick the earth is?”","Hearing Li Lingchuan say out such utterly shameless words, she lost all her strength to even ridicule him.","Based on her status and innate talent, she naturally knew just how much Celestial Light Sect weighted. It really wasn’t anything in the entire Soaring Heavens Continent and only a short-sighted man like Li Lingchuan would not want to heighten his own ability. Instead he was fighting to obtain the reins of such a small sect, putting it as his final aim.","This was the difference between the two men’s foresight and level.","Of course, what she found the funniest was that Li Lingchuan actually thought that Li Li Moying was obstructing his future!","Li Moying couldn’t possibly be interested in such a small benefit that was not even a housefly in his eyes!","Li Lingchuan met her disdainful sight and his heart started fuming with anger!","It was exactly this kind of gaze which was like Li Moying’s that looked down on him which made him feel extremely infuriated and ill at ease!","“Wretched lass, you’re rather sharp tongued but do you think I’m on the same level as that trashy Fang Shaoning and I can’t do anything to you? To be honest, I totally cannot be bothered about your little bit of ability. Now that Li Moying isn’t here, it just takes a finger for me to kill you! If not for Master Leng today, I’d let you understand what it means by a loose tongue may cause a lot of trouble!”","Huang Yueli didn’t place his threat on her mind at all as she frowned and looked towards Leng Yi Feng.","“Master Leng, you’re not Celestial Light Sect’s people so why are you here to join in the muddy water? What advantage can you gain from colluding with this Li fellow to scheme against Moying together?”","Leng Yi Feng appeared to be rather embarrassed.","Why scheme against Li Moying? Of course it was to win Huang Yueli over!","But under this sort of situation, for him to confess in front of Huang Yueli was just.....","Li Lingchuan, on the other hand, didn’t have any qualms, “Why is Master Leng willing to help me? Of course it’s because he wants Li Moying to die! Can’t you tell that Master Leng had always been secretly admiring you? Li Moying is so overbearing and if he doesn’t die, how could he possibly snatch you over? It’s all femme fatale your fault which caused Li Moying’s murderous disaster! It’s not me who caused him to die but you who brought him such a fatal crisis!”","He intentionally said that as his eyes stared at Huang Yueli tightly, wanting to see her shocked, frustrated and frightened expression!","Unfortunately, Huang Yueli wasn’t someone who would be scared off by mere words and she didn’t show any reaction at all. Instead, she laughed coldly, “So that’s the case, now I understand everything! A traitor who helps others and a toad who lusts after a swan! Just based on the two of you, and you actually want to kill Moying? Haven’t you ever considered that once he returns from the cliff below, what kind of horrible death would you end up in?”"]},{"number":1490,"title":"Chapter 1490 - Utterly shameless (3)","paragraphs":["When Li Lingchuan heard that, he immediately started laughing, “Ha ha ha ha, this is really funny! Are you still dreaming that Li Moying could still come back?”","Huang Yueli’s lips curled coldly as she didn’t say a word.","Li Lingchuan complacently said, “You totally don’t understand the situation below the cliff. No matter how capable Li Moying is, it is hard for him to get out of the perilous situation! Otherwise no matter how precipitous this cliff is, it would merely take a quarter of an hour for him to climb up. Why is it that he still hasn’t climbed up till now?”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she suddenly felt uneasy.","That’s right, since she pulled Luo Jiyun up to expose Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng’s identity, it had already been one hour but Li Moying still hadn’t appeared. Instead the lighting bolts in the sky were falling one after another, more and more concentrated....","Her vision shot towards Luo Jiyun and upon seeing his ghastly expression with his forehead filled with sweat, his eyes bore a hopeless expression.","Li Lingchuan also noticed him and immediately laughed, “Look, my beloved Fifth Junior Brother obviously knows the situation down the cliff. When you came up, Li Moying must have been tangled with those magical beasts down the cliff isn’t it? Aren’t those magical beasts’ abilities much stronger than your imagination?”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, not quite believing in Li Lingchuan’s words.","However, Luo Jiyun’s trembling body had already verified Li Lingchuan’s words.","Li Lingchuan continued, “To tell you the truth, I have a Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region’s map in my hands! It’s stated very clearly on the map that below this cliff is the central region of the mystic region! It is filled with dangers here and there are various high levelled magical beasts. It’s even rumoured that there are many other traps so even if a ninth stage realm practitioner falls in, he can forget about leaving this place alive! Although Li Moying’s innate talent isn’t bad, but he’s just in the seventh stage realm. How could he possibly leave that place?”","Saying that he turned towards Luo Jiyun, “Have I said it correctly? Fifth Junior Brother?”","Luo Jiyun’s expression flushed white and he looked as though he was about to cry, choking as he spoke, “Lil... Little Sister-in-law, I’ve done you wrong! It’s all because I’m so dumb that I can’t even figure out such a simple trap. Not to mention that I’ve been schemed, I’ve even dragged Eldest Senior Brother down for coming to save me! We.... We had been tangled with ten over high levelled magical beasts earlier and he personally stopped those magical beasts in order to let me come up first! Now.... now.....”","Hearing Luo Jiyun’s words, Li Lingchuan laughed so much that he couldn’t stand straight!","“Hear that, what I said wasn’t wrong eh? Li Moying... he’s definitely dead!”","Huang Yueli’s expression was gloomy as her lips were tightly pursed. Her eyelids drooped down and she didn’t say a single word, not knowing what she was thinking about.","Li Lingchuan continued, “Miss Bai, now that things have come to such a pass, Li Moying is already dead! There’s no point for you to keep tangling on this! We only want Li Moying’s life and not to harm you at all so you need not be so tightly strung.”","He turned back and gestured towards Leng Yi Feng’s direction, “Look at that Master Leng, he’s one talented person! You probably don’t know about this right? Master Leng is a ninth grade talented peerless genius and he’s not only Green Cloud Sect’s eldest disciple, he’s even a direct descendant of the Leng family! His status is much higher than Li Moying’s! Why don’t you just follow him instead! Woman, isn’t following any man the same? As long as the other party is powerful enough! It’s your honour that Master Leng wants a second hand good like you!”"]},{"number":1491,"title":"Chapter 1491 - Utterly shameless (4)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli had yet to say anything when Luo Jiyun couldn’t stop himself from cursing.","“Despicable!! Utterly shameless! Second Senior Brother, I’ve really misjudged you, you’ve caused Eldest Senior Brother’s death and even helped Leng Yi Feng to dominate Lil Sister-in-law! Under the heavens, how is it possible to even find such a shameless person like you!”","Luo Jiyun was so angry that he kept shaking and at the same time he was feeling guilty and blamed himself!","Things had developed to such a step all because he was just too dumb!","If it was possible, he really wanted to end in mutual destruction with Li Lingchuan and the others!","But unfortunately, he was now like a dead dog, bundled up and thrown into a corner, not being able to do anything at all!","Li Lingchuan’s expression changed as he turned his head and gave him a malicious stare, “Shut up, what thing are you? Is it even your turn to lecture me?”","Luo Jiyun retorted, “My ability is indeed not up to you but at least I still know what is integrity and honour! You dare to even do such lowlife things yet still afraid of me cursing you? You caused a fellow from the Sect to die and coerced Sister-in-law, you’d definitely get retribution.... AH!”","Li Lingchuan was originally feeling guilt and hearing his curses, he felt even more frustrated.","He waved his sleeves and a burst of Profound Energy flew towards Luo Jiyun as it struck him on the chest in one blow.","Luo Jiyun flew out and threw up blood consecutively, smashing heavily onto the ground.","He was originally heavily injured and now it was another injury on top of the previous so when he landed on the ground, he was panting more than he was breathing and it looked as though he was on his last breath but that pair of eyes stared at Li Lingchuan intensely, unresigned.","Li Lingchuan stared at him sinisterly, “I asked you to shut up, didn’t you hear me? On account that you’re my Junior Brother, I can forgive you for the last time for offending me! As long as you swear your loyalty towards me in future, I can let bygones be bygones, otherwise.....”","“Pui!” Luo Jiyun immediately spat out a mouthful of bloody spit.","Li Lingchuan abruptly had a change in colours, “Looking for death!”","He was flabbergasted as his imposing manner rose swiftly around him. With Profound Energy concentrated in his palm, he casted a vicious hand towards Luo Jiyun directly!","Based on Luo Jiyun’s current condition, if he was stuck by this move, he would probably die on the spot!","However, this Profound Energy was stopped in the middle of its path.","Luo Jiyun had originally shut his eyes waiting for death but he didn’t feel the expected pain. Instead a Profound Energy clashing explosive sound rang by the side of his ears.","Following that, a young lady’s tender angry voice rang, “Enough! Li Lingchuan, Luo Jiyun is already severely hurt and isn’t of any threat to you, why must you kill to the last one?”","Li Lingchuan’s move had utilised seventy percent of his power and he had not expected the fifth stage realm Huang Yueli to be able to stop it.","He narrowed his eyes as an astonished look flashed past.","“Indeed the woman who Master Leng and Li Moying took fancy on. For you who’s able to block my move, you’re indeed considered to have outstanding innate talent! It’s not hard if you want me to let Luo Jiyun go. As long as you nod your head now and leave with Master Leng, I promise that I won’t make a move against Luo Jiyun.”","Luo Jiyun immediately cried out in shock, “No way! Lil Sister-in-law, just ignore me. I rather die than to let you suffer such humiliation!”","Hearing that, Leng Yi Feng uncontrollably got angry out of embarrassment, “Indeed, you are seeking death! Why is following me a humiliation? So many young ladies want to enter my Leng family’s door and this Master cannot be bothered! Miss Bai, as long as you nod your head to return to Sky Emperor City with me, I will guarantee Master Luo’s safety and also be responsible for treating all the injuries on him.”"]},{"number":1492,"title":"Chapter 1492 - Li Moying appears (1)","paragraphs":["Leng Yi Feng also started to use Luo Jiyun as an excuse.","He realised that Luo Jiyun being alive, had become Huang Yueli’s soft soft and as long as she cared about Luo Jiyun’s life and death, then there would be the possibility of her being threatened.","However, Huang Yueli bit her lips tightly, not saying a single word.","Leng Yi Feng felt that it was a little strange.","Huang Yueli had always been a sharp tongued lady and usually when she met such things, it would be strange if she didn’t answer back sarcastically so how could she possibly remain silent?","Could it be that because of Li Moying’s death, she suffered too huge a blow and decided that she should consider carefully if she should follow himself?","Before Leng Yi Feng had time to be happy, he suddenly heard Li Lingchuan’s cry of surprise, “You... what are you doing?”","Right before her eyes, a blinding flame suddenly lit up, slashing the empty space!","Wherever the flame went, the warmth of the surroundings rose steadily, so scorching hot as though it was about to burn everything into ashes!","Along this burst of flame was an overbearing and raging fire attributed energy as it flew out of Huang Yueli’s hand, charging straight towards Li Lingchuan’s face!","At the same time, several thin cicada-like daggers were thrown out all at one go, splitting into upper, middle and lower directions, obstructing all avenues of Leng Yi Feng’s retreat!","Huang Yueli’s move was simply too sudden and as she had stayed in a daze earlier, both men thought that she was about to be convinced as they assumed that she was considered what conditions she would like to raise, hence they totally had not expected her to make a move at all!","So this round, both men were caught unprepared!","Li Lingchuan hastily evaded the attack, foregoing his image as he rolled along the ground for half a round but he was still burnt by the flame as his right shoulder’s clothes were all burnt into nothing, with an evident burnt mark on his flesh.","Whereas Leng Yi Feng was also struck. His left thigh was slashed by the dagger and was bleeding non-stop.","But even so, Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng were genuine sixth stage realm end stage top experts and their foundations were stable, absolutely not a half past standard like Murong Fei.","Even though the both of them were caught in a sneak attack, but their reactions were still swift as they managed to evade their vital points from being hit, and at the same time putting out a defensive stance while preparing to counterattack at any point of time.","Later on, Huang Yueli couldn’t find any chance to make a move!","Li Lingchuan laughed chillingly, “Bai Ruoli, you’re rather amazing, still know how to do a sneak attack while everything is still messy! But don’t get it wrong, you’re just at an elementary fifth stage realm cultivation and no matter how talented you are, are you intending to challenge two sixth stage realm practitioners at the same time? Do you really think we’re idiots? You cannot run so stop the useless struggles! You’d better lie flat and obediently serve Master Leng, so that your future days would be.....”","He said a load of words delightfully.","But before he could finish talking, he heard a sinister and biting cold voice from his back.","“You say..... you want my fiancé to go serve who?”","“Who else could it be? Are you silly? Of course it’s Master Leng.....” Li Lingchuan replied in a sarcastic tone.","But after he spoke out, he suddenly realised that the voice sounded very familiar, not like Luo Jiyun’s voice, but.....","Li Lingchuan’s heart instantly jumped to the back of his throat as cold sweat started to roll down his spine.","Surely not right? Not possible right?","He... he must have heard wrongly right?","He didn’t dare to turn his head back but from the expression on Leng Yi Feng’s face, it had already explained everything.","“Li.... Young Sect Master Li, you... how is it possible that you... when.....”","Meeting Li Moying’s pair of deep and pitch dark eyes, Leng Yi Feng stammered as he couldn’t even finish his sentence properly."]},{"number":1493,"title":"Chapter 1493 - Li Moying appears (2)","paragraphs":["Li Moying stared coldly at the duo in front of him as his eyes were filled with a murderous air!","His vision fell on Huang Yueli and on seeing an obvious patch of dust on her clothes, his face sunk even more!","“Junior Brother Li, Master Leng, I got to admit that I admire your guts. Did you really think that a few magical beasts would be able to claim my life? You actually dare to hurt Li’er.... you’re really seeking death!”","The minute his words were spoken, Li Lingchuan couldn’t curb the terror in his inner heart as his legs softened and he plopped directly on the ground.","He trembled while explaining, “El... Eldest Senior Brother, misunderstanding... it’s all a misunderstanding.... Miss Bai’s clothes were stained with dust, that’s.... because she grazed against the ground, absolutely not hurt! Really not.....”","Huang Yueli lowered her head to find that there were indeed plenty of dirty spots on her clothes as she couldn’t help but frown.","She really wasn’t hurt but in a moment of urgency earlier, in order to save Luo Jiyun, she rolled around on the ground hence the dust stained her clothes.","But whoever didn’t knew that the little priestess of the Mythical Flame Palace loved to be beautiful the most. Being dirty made her extremely unhappy.","So she pouted and started to complain to Li Moying, “Moying, they’re really arrogant earlier! One by one, they said you were dead and asked me to quickly remarry! They even said that Leng Yi Feng was much stronger than you, so following him was the best choice!”","When Li Lingchuan heard that, he was so scared that his soul almost flew away!","Who didn’t know that Li Moying cared most about this little fiancée of his. The charge of wanting Huang Yueli to remarry was much more serious than scheming against Li Moying himself!","“No... it’s not like that... I saw Miss Bai too upset... so, in order to comfort her.....”","Luo Jiyun couldn’t take it any longer as he shouted out loudly, “Eldest Senior Brother, don’t listen to his rubbish! You weren’t around earlier and the two of them had already admitted! They wanted to harm you! Second Senior Brother did so to snatch your Young Sect Master position while Leng Yi Feng had his eyes on lil Sister-in-law for a long time!”","When he said that, Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng both stared at him flabbergasted as they wished they could use their gazes to kill him!","Originally the both of them were thinking of how to deny but in the end, they were exposed by Luo Jiyun in a few words!","But in front of Li Moying, they couldn’t do anything to Luo Jiyun at all!","At this moment, Luo Jiyun’s injuries were extremely serious and his entire body was in so much pain as though he was being roasted over fire but his feelings were totally different from earlier!","He knew that as long as Li Moying was around, there wouldn’t be any problems. No matter how Li Lingchuan and the others schemed, they had no way to fight against Li Moying’s absolute ability!","“I was just thinking why didn’t lil Sister-in-law make a sound earlier.” Luo Jiyun suddenly thought of something as he laughed, “So, you two were exchanging messages secretly earlier, discussing how to allow Eldest Senior Brother to come up safely? Whereas these two dumb fools actually thought that lil Sister-in-law really had a change of heart. That delighted look, hahaha, you guys are really humorous!”","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly, “You’ve been dumb for an entire day and now you’ve suddenly turned a little smarter.”","Luo Jiyun broke out in sweat, “This... Lil Sister-in-law, I know I’m in the wrong.....”","Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng then realised that now. No wonder Huang Yueli suddenly struck out against them, attacking the both of them at the same time!","She wasn’t intending to defeat two sixth stage realm practitioners but had already discussed with Li Moying on the next step."]},{"number":1494,"title":"Chapter 1494 - Li Moying appears (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli’s sudden attack attracted their attention and Li Moying took the opportunity to get up from the cliff.","No wonder his appearance was so silent!","Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng self-professed that they were first rate talents in South Sky Region but yet they hadn’t even sensed a single bit until Li Moying opened his mouth to realise his existence!","“You.... you all.....” Li Lingchuan’s teeth were chattering.","He suddenly recalled his delighted and satisfied look earlier and he wished he could severely give himself a tight slap!","What kind of ability did Li Moying have and just how intelligent and resourceful Huang Yueli was; this wasn’t his first day finding out but he was still so careless thinking that he had easily gotten his way?","He scarcely realised that these two had long decoded their trap which they had specially created. That show which they had performed, in their eyes, was probably no different from two clowns dancing?","Li Lingchuan’s face flushed red, feeling that he had been slapped a few hundred slaps on his face on the spot, so embarrassed to the max!","Furthermore, the most serious of it all was that his scheme had failed and he had fallen into Li Moying’s hands so his life had a bleak future.....","When Li Lingchuan thought of this, he got even more terrified.","At this very moment, he was no longer concerned about pride or whatever matters, knowing that as long as he could continue living, no matter how lowly or shameless he had to be, he must continue living!","He turned his head back and in an instance, he knelt down and kept kowtowing to Li Moying with all his might. At the same time, his tears and mucus started flowing down altogether.","“Eldest Senior Brother, I’m wrong, I really know I’m wrong! I’ve done all these because... because I was possessed and I also don’t know why I would suddenly do such a thing.... I don’t dare to , I absolutely would not dare to in future! Eldest Senior Brother, on account that we’re brothers from the same Sect, please spare my life! I will work extremely hard to redeem my mistake from now on!”","He tried his best to plead for mercy as he tried till his liver and guts were cut to pieces, simply to the point of himself being touched by his act.","However, Li Moying still remained silent, only looking down at him from the top as he turned around and walked to Huang Yueli’s side.","“Li’er, are you really not hurt?”","Huang Yueli shook her head but she appeared to be extremely upset, “I’m alright but my clothes are so dirty, I’m sure it cannot be cleaned! This is made out of wild silk yarn, extremely comfortable and beautiful and I especially love it...”","Li Moying touched her face as he looked at her tsundere expression and the huge stone pressing on his chest was finally lifted as a warm feeling filled his heart.","Heaven knew that when he was at the cliff before facing so many high levelled magical beasts, the most fearful thing was not that he might die but... if anything happened to him, what would happen to his Li’er!","The two of them had used an entire two lifetimes before they were able to connect in one heart and mind like this. They had yet to get married and had not reached the peak together.... If they were forced to separate in two worlds again, he..... would not be resigned to it!","Luckily, he managed to get rid of those magical beasts successfully and his Li’er was not hurt any bit. Hearing her soft grumbles, he could only thank heavens for this.","There was nothing much better than this...."]},{"number":1495,"title":"Chapter 1495 - Li Moying appears (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying gave a deep laugh, “No matter, we can always buy another set of clothes if it’s dirty. After we leave the mystic region, I’ll accompany you to Sky Cloud City’s biggest clothes store.”","Huang Yueli barely replied, “Alright then...”","Li Moying looked at her pouty little face as he wanted to lean over and gave her a kiss but he also knew that this wasn’t the right moment so he forced himself to suppress the impulse to get intimate with her.","While the two of them were talking, Li Lingchuan continued to kowtow.","At this present moment, he had already kowtowed for more than a hundred times and his head banged against the uneven ground and had long started to bleed.","Blood started to flow down his cheek and jaw, making his appearance look extremely malicious.","Li Moying’s ignorance made him even more humiliated as he was burning up inside but he didn’t dare to stop for fear that Li Moying felt that he was insincere!","Li Lingchuan clenched his teeth as he bore with the rage inside, still continuing to kowtow but kept repeating in his mind again and again: Li Moying, just you wait. If the day comes when you fall into my hands, I would absolutely not let you off and will get back at you for the humiliation which you have given me today!","Li Moying didn’t even bother to take a side glance at him.","He naturally knew just how infuriated Li Lingchuan was but so what about that? He totally didn’t need to bother about this clown!","Continuous dull knocking sounds were heard in the area where Li Lingchuan was.","Li Moying however looked towards Leng Yi Feng’s direction.","Leng Yi Feng was actually standing very near Huang Yueli, thinking of using the chance to get close to Huang Yueli. If she insisted on not obeying him, then he was prepared to use his advantage of his potential to the fullest, forcing her instead...","But too bad, before his plan had even materialised, Li Moying appeared.","Leng Yi Feng took advantage of the chance while Li Moying was teaching Li Lingchuan a lesson as he kept retreating backwards, and backwards and backwards even more, hoping to retreat out of the boundary of his vision.","But was Li Moying someone who was easy to fool, allowing him to run off like that?","“Master Leng, I remembered that I’ve warned you previously that if you try to get near my fiancée again, I will not take regard to the relationship between the two Sects..... I’d not expected that you actually dare to make a move towards Li’er...”","“This.....” Meeting Li Moying’s gloomy gaze, Leng Yi Feng only felt his legs turning into jelly as his body involuntarily started to shake.","He used up all his self-restraint so he didn’t knelt down on the ground in such an embarrassing manner like Li Lingchuan.","But his heart was extremely terrified!","Bearing the same chief eldest disciple status, but just one glance from Li Moying radiated such powerful aura, totally not giving him any possibility to resist against it! Why.... Why was Li Moying that strong!","He bore the brunt and spoke out with cold sweat soaking his clothes, “Li.... Young Sect Master Li, don’t be rash... this.... it’s not fake that I like Miss Bai but Miss Bai isn’t married yet, so isn’t it normal for me to like her..... even if Sect Master Murong finds out about this, he won’t blame me for it. But I’m telling you, I’m the direct descendant of Leng family from Sky Emperor City. If you really dare to.... dare to do something which is irrevocable, then the consequences.... Isn’t something which you can bear!”","“Leng family....” Li Moying repeated as there was a hesitant look in his eyes.","Leng Yi Feng hurriedly replied, “Exactly! I bear a status in my family! I’m sure you’ve heard of Leng family’s reputation....”","“..... what kind of thing is that?”","Li Moying cut him off coldly."]},{"number":1496,"title":"Chapter 1496 - Li Moying appears (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","For a moment, Leng Yi Feng thought that he had heard wrongly.","“You... what did you say?”","Seeing Li Moying’s unperturbed look, Leng Yi Feng emphasized again in disbelief, “Are you crazy? I said I’m from the Leng family! My clan is considered a huge powerhouse in Sky Emperor City! You dare to slight the Leng family??”","Li Moying said coldly, “Sky Emperor City has seven Great Hidden Sacred Grounds, may I ask what rank does Leng family stand at?”","“This...”","Leng Yi Feng’s mouth was agape as his tongue was tied, not expecting him to ask such a question.","Leng family as compared to the top Seven Sacred Lands’ disciples of course wasn’t even worth a fart but in the eyes of ordinary people, it was already an existence which they couldn’t even claim connections with!","Li Moying continued, “Even if you’re one of the disciples from the Seven Sacred Lands, but now that you’re in the mystic region, who can save you here?”","Leng Yi Feng’s eyes widened as he simply could not believe that such a thing was happening!","He had always been proud of his birth. Everything he was crushed by Li Moying, he would comfort himself: No matter how strong Li Moying’s ability was, so what about it? In future his achievements would outshine Li Moying because their backgrounds were just too different!","Don’t think Li Moying was unparalleled now. If he really went to Sky Emperor City, it would not be his turn to be complacent!","Leng Yi Feng had always maintained this self-confidence but in the end, the thing which he had been so proud of, in Li Moying’s eyes, was actually nothing at all!","He gritted his teeth, “Li Moying, you... you can continue to be stubborn and reluctant to admit the fact! Even if I’m in the mystic region, if I die here, my family would find out about the news and by then they would definitely investigate and link it to you so by then it’d be difficult for you to escape even if you have wings! Who do you think you are, no matter how talented, you’re still a human, do you think that you can go against the entire Leng family?”","Li Moying calmly replied, “Anyway you’re going to die right now, so you don’t need to worry about these!”","Saying that, the aura from his body suddenly rose sharply as his Profound Energy gathered in an instance as powerful awe started to envelop the surrounding regions.","Leng Yi Feng retreated consecutively but he was still unable to stabilise himself.","Li Moying’s back was facing the light and his aura was so powerful to an astonishing level. In just that instance, Leng Yi Feng felt that he wasn’t going up against some seventh stage realm talented practitioner, but a peerless expert whom he totally couldn’t fight against!","Right in front of him, he appeared to be so tiny, like an ant!","Li Moying took a step towards him and Leng Yi Feng instantly felt his blood surging around his chest as blood started to spill from the corner of his lips!","He gave a dull moan and summoned up the Profound Energy with him while shouting out loudly, “Li Lingchuan, what are you waiting for! Are you really going to be a sitting duck?”","Li Lingchuan had been waiting for this moment and when he heard that, he swiftly leaped up from the ground!","The two of them struck out at the same time.","They knew that in front of Li Moying, even if they joined hands, there was no possibility of victory at all so right from the start, the both of them used all their energy to unleash their killer moves and also gathered all their Profound Energy, casting their attack towards Li Moying!","Luo Jiyun was so scared that he broke out in cold sweat and cried out in shock, “Eldest Senior Brother, be careful!”","Huang Yueli, on the other hand, stood at her original spot calmly, as though nothing had happened.","If this degree of sneak attack was successful, then Li Moying would have been done away with in his past time long ago so how would he become the number one top exponent?","Indeed, facing two sixth stage realm practitioners’ utmost strike, there wasn’t any change in Li Moying’s expression at all.","Seven Sacred Lands: Number one was Blue Profound Sect whereas number two was Mythical Flame Palace..."]},{"number":1497,"title":"Chapter 1497 - Out of expectations (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying had long expected that these two fellows would absolutely not surrender just like that and had been guarding against their kickback.","At this moment, he merely retreated back slightly as he evaded the duo’s attacks.","At the same time, his right hand flipped and the Amethyst Light Sword was unsheathed!","Li Lingchuan’s attack landed on empty ground and when he saw Li Moying preparing to make a move, he totally didn’t hesitate as he turned around and fled in defeat towards the densely packed forest!","Leng Yi Feng was preparing to take on his attack when his side glance noticed that his ally had actually run off!","He was so angry that he threw out a mouthful of blood immediately, “Li Lingchuan, you... you villain! You’re making me bear the brunt for you!”","The two of them had obviously arranged to make a move together but Li Lingchuan grabbed the opportunity to escape first so wasn’t that obvious that he was letting him be the cannon ash? Facing a top exponent like Li Moying alone, he definitely had no chance of survival!","Although he knew Li Lingchuan was a despicable man, but he had not expected that he could be so shameless to this extent!","Li Lingchuan wouldn’t bother about him as he ran off without saying a word. At this moment in time, preserving his own life was the most important thing so who would bother about society’s morality? Leng Yi Feng had teased Huang Yueli and he would definitely be dead so he wouldn’t possibly accompany him in his doom!","However at this moment, he suddenly heard a burst of split air sound!","Immediately following that, his back felt a pained sensation as he was sent flying!","Li Moying saw Li Lingchuan escaping for his life and his gaze flashed as the next strike was not directed towards Leng Yi Feng, but conjuring the heaven and earth’s profound qi, he pursued after Li Lingchuan!","Intending to escape for his life while things were still disorientated? That would have to depend on whether Li Moying was agreeable or not!","How could Li Lingchuan possibly imagined that his self-professed intelligence had instead attracted Li Moying’s attention, which brought his doom quicker than usual.","Li Lingchuan’s body was like a kite with a broken string as he shakingly fell into the deep end of the dense forest.","The minute Leng Yi Feng saw Li Moying distracted, he immediately retrieved a circular Profound Armament from his realm ring.","This was an eighth tier Profound Armament, Thousand Ray Seal. It could only be activated once and the minute it was activated, it could exhibit a strike which was equivalent to an eighth stage realm peak’s potential!","This was something which the family gave to direct descendants as a means to save their lives and unless it was a life and death crisis, otherwise they were absolutely not allowed to use it easily.","Leng Yi Feng originally couldn’t bear to bring it out but Li Moying refused to falter and his ability was so powerful. Seeing the heavy strike which he dealt Li Lingchuan, it appeared that he was really prepared to murder someone!","Leng Yi Feng knew that if he didn’t use this ultimate move now, he might not have another chance later so he could only clench his teeth tightly as he placed all his stakes in this one bet. While Li Moying wasn’t paying attention, he activated the Thousand Ray Seal and threw it out towards Li Moying’s back!","“Moying, be careful! He has the Thousand Ray Seal in his hands!”","This time, even Huang Yueli became anxious as she cried out loudly.","At the same time, she abruptly struck out, throwing out a handful of sixth tier Profound Armaments, clashing against the Thousand Ray Seal.","Sixth tier Profound Armaments naturally couldn’t resist against eighth tier Profound Armaments but as the quantity of Profound Armaments which Huang Yueli threw out was a lot, when it clashed against the Thousand Ray Seal, it managed to diminish a portion of its energy and at the same time, decreased the speed of the Thousand Ray Seal.","Li Moying heard her cry and hurriedly turned back.","Leng Yi Feng’s lips revealed a cold smile.","Although he had not expected Huang Yueli to suddenly make a move and had actually managed to diminish a portion of the might from the Thousand Ray Seal, but even so, this was still the full force strike from an eighth stage realm practitioner who was at the peak!"]},{"number":1498,"title":"Chapter 1498 - Out of expectations (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Under such kind of pressure, practitioners under ninth stage realm would all suffer from serious injury. Li Moying was just in seventh stage realm so naturally there was no need to say anything else.","Perhaps he might even die on the spot, becoming a dead corpse!","At the very least, he would be seriously injured and was unable to continue battling!","Even it was a waste of his biggest ace which made Leng Yi Feng feel an extreme heartache, but thinking that he would be able to eradicate such a problematic thing and also enabling him to snatch Huang Yueli over, so he felt that overall, it was still worth it!","Unfortunately, Leng Yi Feng’s smile immediately froze on his face.","Li Moying turned around and he gave him an icy cold stare. Beneath that pair of eyes, there was no fear or terror which Leng Yi Feng had anticipated.","His right hand flicked out his sleeve and pointed the Amethyst Light Sword towards the sky as he shouted softly, “Amethyst Light Sword – Unseal!”","The spirit of the sword Little Lilac appeared in the middle of the sky and under the drive from Li Moying’s sword qi, it suddenly charged towards the Thousand Ray Seal!","The two bursts of Profound Energy clashed together and gave off an earth shattering sound. The entire cliff started shaking and there were many rocks by the side of the cliff which broke off from the vibration as it dropped down into the valley.","Huang Yueli’s blood started to surge by the vibrations and she almost threw up blood as she retreated several steps continuously, all the way until she reached the side of the cliff.","She turned her head back and realised that Luo Jiyun’s condition was pretty bad.","He was originally hurt continuously and already in a half dead state. Now suffering from the clash of the powerful Profound Energy fluctuation, his face had totally turned white like paper as his eyes lost spirit and he looked as though he was in a semi-conscious state.","Huang Yueli frowned and shot over like an arrow.","She didn’t dare to shake Luo Jiyun’s body so she could only release the rope on his body carefully, then quickly check on his injuries.","Originally after Luo Jiyun had taken the pills which Li Moying gave him earlier, he had a good turn with regards to his internal or external injuries. But later on, he was continuously injured heavily again and with the urgent turn of events, his injuries were much more serious than earlier when he was stuck in between the rocks.","Although Huang Yueli wasn’t proficient in medical skills but she could still sense that a few meridians in his body had been shattered and there was a danger of his cultivation falling apart if he didn’t get any urgent medical care.","She hurriedly retrieved the pills for treating internal injuries from the Sky Phoenix Ring and stuffed it into his mouth in huge quantities. Then she forced a large cup of Spirit Saint Spring Water down his throat and at the same time, placed her right hand against his back as she slowly infused her Profound Energy into his body.","Her Profound Energy wasn’t as overbearing as Li Moying’s and it was apparently much gentler but luckily it was extremely pure.","She had passed the refinement process and used Phoenix Blood to refine her body hence the impurities in her Profound Energy had almost been eliminated totally so what was left was all that pure Heaven and Earth Profound Energy.","Because of this, Huang Yueli’s Profound Energy merged easily along with Luo Jiyun’s, so she aided him to clear his meridians and restore the damage in his meridians.","Under Huang Yueli’s hard work, it was merely a quarter of an hour and Luo Jiyun’s complexion evidently changed for the better.","He gave a low moan and with a “pffft”, he spat out a mouthful of black, dirty blood.","After that, his eyelashes shook as he slowly opened his eyes.","Huang Yueli immediately leaned closer as she asked anxiously, “Junior Brother Luo, how are you feeling? Do you feel better now?”","Luo Jiyun was apparently still in a daze as he didn’t respond.","Huang Yueli frowned and wanted to continue asking.","Whoever knew that Luo Jiyun suddenly opened his eyes as it was filled with terror.","“Little Sister-in-law, be.... Behind...”"]},{"number":1499,"title":"Chapter 1499 - Out of expectations (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was stunned momentarily and didn’t manage to respond in time.","However at the next moment, she suddenly felt someone pushing her back hard and she fell sideways as she lost her balance!","She had placed all her attention on Luo Jiyun. Directing Profound Energy was an extremely dangerous thing and if she didn’t control it well, both parties had a possibility of falling into Qi Deviation so she didn’t dared to be careless. Plus the fact that the only person present who was a threat to her was Leng Yi Feng but he was currently under Li Moying’s control so she didn’t think that any other accidents could happen.","Right now, when she was suddenly pushed by someone, she regained her senses and steadied herself.","But the position she was at was originally very near to the side of the cliff and many of the rocks below her feet had already loosened from the vibration earlier.","She stepped down on one foot and just nicely stepped on a piece of loosened rock and that rock immediately slipped down from the cliff.","Huang Yueli managed to steady her own body and pulled out a coil of rope from her arms as she thought of securing a stable position to help with her balance.","However the minute she threw out her rope, it was instantly thrown back at her.","Huang Yueli couldn’t find any stronghold and she was unable to control her own body totally so she fell down the cliff along with that falling rock beneath her feet!","“Little Sister-in-law—!”","Luo Jiyun’s inconsolable terrified voice was heard from the top of the cliff.","Huang Yueli tried her best to turn her head back and she looked upwards.","A familiar figure appeared in her vision.","..... It was Murong Fei?? Damnit, all of them had forgotten about Muring Fei!","This thought flashed past her mind and immediately after, her body started to drop downwards swiftly.","At this particular moment, Li Moying was finishing up Leng Yi Feng.","As a direct descendant of the Leng family, Leng Yi Feng had a number of Profound Artifacts on him, as well as some ace Profound Skills that he had up his sleeves. Although Li Moying had gained the upper hand, but in order to kill him, he still needed to put in some effort.","Just as he had heavily injured Leng Yi Feng and was about to kill him, Luo Jiyun’s miserable cry suddenly entered his ears.","Li Moying’s actions stopped and he turned back to take a look.","On one look, he felt his entire body’s blood froze instantly!","Because he had just witnessed the scene where Huang Yueli’s body falling down from the cliff!","“NO—! LI’ER!!!”","He couldn’t be bothered about Leng Yi Feng as he immediately turned around and sped towards the direction of the cliff, wanting to pull Huang Yueli.","But no matter how fast his speed was, it was already too late as he could only watch Huang Yueli’s figure disappearing in the thick fog.","Li Moying’s body shook as he couldn’t believe that he had just left for such an amount of time and his Li’er actually met with critical danger, falling down the cliff! Whereas he... had once again saw her disappearing right before his eyes!","It was.... exactly the same as what happened in his past life!","Li Moying’s vision grazed past Murong Fei cold. That gloomy gaze was so terrifying, as though he was a demon who came from hades as he was filled with an indescribable hatred and murderous air!","Murong Fei was so scared that her soul almost flew out to the extent of her teeth chattering.","Right before this, Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng had intentionally found a reason to send her away just because they were afraid that she would mess things up, so that they could deal with Li Moying in peace.","They originally thought that things would be settled very quickly but whoever knew that it had dragged on for so long. Furthermore, instead of deriving at their motive, they fell into Li Moying’s hands instead!"]},{"number":1500,"title":"Chapter 1500 - Out of expectations (4)","paragraphs":["Murong Fei was left out by them for a long time and she finally couldn’t wait any further as she ran over by herself.","The minute she arrived, the first thing she saw was Li Moying and Leng Yi Feng breaking out into a big fight and she was suddenly confused as she didn’t know what had happened.","However, on the second look, she saw Huang Yueli and Luo Jiyun by the side of the cliff.","The position where the both of them stood was simply too near the cliff and the minute Murong Fei saw that, an evil intent immediately arose.","She had long wanted Huang Yueli to die but Li Lingchuan and the others refused to let her kill her. Murong Fei had been feeling worried, especially when she thought about the fact that Huang Yueli would follow Leng Yi Feng in future and even becoming the Young Mistress of Leng family, it made her extremely jealous!","Now there was a once in a blue moon opportunity which was right in front of her.","Huang Yueli’s back was facing her and she was so concentrated in treating Luo Jiyun’s injuries.","She only needed to give a slight push from behind and that little slut who had been crushing her in every day, would die!","Murong Fei was thinking of that and her lips revealed an evil smile, as she immediately acted on it.","Her luck wasn’t bad at all as she successfully pushed Huang Yueli down.","Originally she intended to push Huang Yueli down and then quickly hid herself away. She thought that Li Moying was intoxicated in the battle and probably had not noticed her at all.","However, she had not expected Luo Jiyun to suddenly regain consciousness at this moment in time and even spoiling her plan to hide away!","Murong Fei actually wanted to push Luo Jiyun down as well but luckily for him, his ankle was still tangled by the rope. She pushed him and he fell out by a distance and was tangled, almost falling down!","In this way, Murong Fei was completely exposed in front of Li Moying.","Luo Jiyun cried out in grief and indignation, “Eldest Senior Brother, little Sister-in-law she.... she... you absolutely cannot let Murong Fei off! I saw it with my own eyes, she’s the one who pushed little Sister-in-law down!”","Murong Fei’s body shook as she knew she was totally a goner as Li Moying would definitely torture her to death, alive!","She didn’t think too much as she immediately turned around and escaped in a panic!","However she had just taken a step and was struck by Li Moying’s casual bolt of lightning. Her entire body was smoking and she fell straight downwards.","Luo Jiyun stared at Li Moying tightly, thinking that he would chase up to her and catch Murong Fei to torture her alive to take revenge for Huang Yueli.","Whoever knew that after Li Moying struck once, he totally didn’t bother about Murong Fei’s situation.","He didn’t stop in his tracks and he ran over to the cliff directly!","Luo Jiyun instantly realised what his motive was as he cried out in terror, “Eldest Senior Brother, don’t... please don’t do it—!”","But Li Moying’s speed was extremely fast and before his words ended, Li Moying already leapt up, jumping into the deep abyss!","Luo Jiyun’s expression was pale as he pounced to the side of the cliff.","He only saw Li Moying’s black figure dropping down speedily and not long after, he too disappeared into the thick fog.","“ELDEST SENIOR BROTHER—! LITTLE SISTER-IN-LAW—! BOTH OF YOU...PLEASE DON’T DIE—! IT’S ALL MY FAULT, I’M THE ONE WHO CAUSED YOUR DEMISE!”","Luo Jiyun fell onto the ground in a slump as he was extremely remorseful, feeling guilty to the max!","All these happened because of him. First, Li Moying met with danger and had a narrow escape before he finally got up from the cliff. Thinking that everything had been solved, whoever knew that to save him, Huang Yueli didn’t notice and fell down the cliff!"]}]);
